{"abstract":"Sex hormones are potentially involved in major depressive disorder (MDD) as there are sex differences in risk for depression, symptomatology and treatment efficacy. Such hormonal contributions to MDD have mainly been studied in women and scarcely in men. We, therefore, investigate whether testosterone and estradiol levels in unmedicated men with MDD are associated with depressive symptom profiles, SSRI treatment response, and sexual side-effects. Pretreatment plasma testosterone and estradiol were available from 26 unmedicated men (age 18–49). The patients were treated with 10–20 mg escitalopram for 12 weeks. Depression severity was measured by Hamilton Depression Rating Scale 17 (HAMD17), and treatment response was the change in HAMD6 from baseline. Sexual side-effects were assessed with a standardized clinician-rated scale. Pretreatment testosterone was positively associated with depression severity (p = 0.016), the association was primarily driven by vegetative symptoms: weight loss, gastrointestinal symptoms, and insomnia (p ≤ 0.027). Pretreatment sex hormone levels were not associated with antidepressant treatment outcome. However, pretreatment sex hormones were lower in patients who experienced sexual side-effects after 8–12 weeks of escitalopram treatment; low estradiol was associated with erectile and ejaculatory dysfunction (p = 0.039) and low testosterone and low estradiol were both associated with decreased libido (p ≤ 0.004). In conclusion, we find low testosterone in men with MDD coupled with depression severity, particularly vegetative symptoms. However, pretreatment sex hormone levels were not associated with treatment efficacy but with sexual side-effects. Taken together, our findings highlight sex hormone profiles as potential prognostic biomarkers of SSRI-induced sexual dysfunction. Data from: Clinical study (NCT02869035).","author_count":7,"contributors":["Jensen, Kristian H.Reveles","Aarestrup, Malene Ravn","Larsen, Søren Vinther","Köhler-Forsberg, Kristin","Knudsen, Gitte Moos","Jørgensen, Martin Balslev","Frokjaer, Vibe G."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-777855"],"filters":{"added":"2025-01","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Escitalopram","Estrogen","Mood disorder","SSRI","Sexual dysfunction","Testosterone"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"psychoneuroendocrine profiles of unmedicated men with major depressive disorder and associations to treatment effects and sexual side effects","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.nsa.2024.104050","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-777855","identifier":[{"id":"PMC12244185","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"40656082","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85208436830","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-5f3cc356-300c-41fa-9861-1921a259d9a1"],"keyword":["Escitalopram","Estrogen","Mood disorder","SSRI","Sexual dysfunction","Testosterone"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-888D919B109001D11BE6D81404CD019D"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.nsa.2024.104050","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/412169901/Psychoneuroendocrine_profiles.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Biomedical Sciences, Molecular and Translational Pharmacology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"capital region of denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CAP","l3nl":"Capital Region of Denmark","l3nn":"Capital Region of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Capital Region of Denmark","namevar":["Copenhagen University Hospital - Rigshospitalet","Psychiatric Centre Copenhagen"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CAP","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1 2","first":"Kristian H.Reveles","key":"jensenpau","last":"Jensen","locid":"f211bd71-e4a8-442e-8fb3-6fed293b9782","name":"Jensen, Kristian H.Reveles","orcid":"0000-0001-6117-4379","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Malene Ravn","key":"aarestruppau","last":"Aarestrup","name":"Aarestrup, Malene Ravn","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Søren Vinther","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","name":"Larsen, Søren Vinther","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Kristin","key":"köhlerforsbergpau","last":"Köhler-Forsberg","name":"Köhler-Forsberg, Kristin","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2 1","first":"Gitte Moos","key":"knudsenpau","last":"Knudsen","locid":"f02aee9e-69cf-491a-9765-ff062f734db8","name":"Knudsen, Gitte Moos","orcid":"0000-0003-1508-6866","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2 1","first":"Martin Balslev","key":"jørgensenpau","last":"Jørgensen","locid":"dfc70acd-d15d-44f9-891e-6a7646d1727d","name":"Jørgensen, Martin Balslev","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2 1","first":"Vibe G.","key":"frokjaerpau","last":"Frokjaer","locid":"ab1287b2-e920-4656-b4bc-1b7d3dffd2dc","name":"Frokjaer, Vibe G.","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["40656082"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.nsa.2024.104050","issn":["27724085"],"journal":"Neuroscience Applied","paperid":"104050","status":"p","title":"Neuroscience Applied","volume":"3"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85208436830"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-5f3cc356-300c-41fa-9861-1921a259d9a1"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Psychoneuroendocrine profiles of unmedicated men with major depressive disorder and associations to treatment effects and sexual side-effects","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-777855","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
{"abstract":"Denne episode af Praksis har fokus på idrætsfaget i bred forstand. CFU’s fagkonsulent i faget, Mikkel Rygaard Pedersen, fortæller blandt andet, hvordan man som lærer kan skabe inkluderende læringsmiljøer og deltagelsesmuligheder for alle, både i idrætshallen, på boldbanen og på dansegulvet. Du kan også blive klogere på vigtige didaktiske værktøjer såsom Handlekompetencemodellen og Boldtrappen.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Pedersen, Mikkel Rygaard","Westergaard, Mette Bechmann","Pedersen, Maria Ulrik","Knudsen, Søren Bøgh","Hjuler, Kristian Neubert"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-782271"],"filters":{"added":"2025-01","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-UC"],"level3":{"UC":["DI-UC-AB","DI-UC-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-UC-AB"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"idrætsfaget m mikkel rygaard pedersen 000000000034 praksis","src":["pha"],"src-code":["DI-UC-AB"],"type":"dnt","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/34-idr%C3%A6tsfaget-m-mikkel-rygaard-pedersen/id1553652931?i=1000647625883","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-782271","ids":["pha-22b1ae2b-6659-4d75-916c-3f752a6b1da9"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-0F39AB5BF1E4E97018B02C11AA0424C5"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/34-idr%C3%A6tsfaget-m-mikkel-rygaard-pedersen/id1553652931?i=1000647625883","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"university college absalon","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-AB","l3nl":"University College Absalon","l3nn":"University College Absalon","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"University College Absalon","namevar":["Professionshøjskolen Absalon, Direktionen - Slagelse, Pædagogik og Ledelsesområdet, Lære