{"abstract":"Anaerobic digestion is a common method for managing liquid manure and other biomasses, generating biogas as a renewable energy source. The resulting digestate can be processed into organic fertilizers to enhance nutrient recycling, but its environmental impact warrants investigation. In this study, a life cycle assessment was conducted to examine the impact of fertilizers derived from cattle slurry and grass-clover co-digestion on global warming (measured in CO2 equivalents) compared to untreated cattle slurry (CA). The different treatments analyzed include CA, digestate, liquid fractions (LFs) from digestate separation, and an enriched liquid nitrogen-sulfur product derived from post-processing of biogas and drying of the solid fraction. The functional units of this study were 100 kg of total nitrogen in the final organic fertilizer (FU1) with the cradle-to-processing gate boundary, and the harvesting of 1 ton of spring barley dry matter (FU2) with the cradle-to-field application boundary. The carbon footprint ranged from 24% to 49% of the baseline scenario for FU1, and from −6% to 177% of the baseline scenario for FU2. The main contributors to the carbon footprint of fertilizers included greenhouse gas emissions from storage and field application. However, biogas production from anaerobic digestion, together with the concurrent mitigation of CH4 emissions during storage, contributed most to a reduction in the overall global warming potential associated with anaerobic digestate and its LF. This study showed large climate prospects in replacing untreated slurry as organic fertilizer with alternatives resulting from its anaerobic digestion and post-treatment.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Meng, Xiaoyi","Knudsen, Marie Trydeman","Petersen, Søren O","Møller, Henrik Bjarne","Hashemi, Fatemeh"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-763078"],"filters":{"added":"2024-11","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corresponding_author":["Meng, Xiaoyi"],"keyword":["Anaerobic digestion","Cattle slurry","Grass clover","Greenhouse gas emission","Life cycle assessment","Organic farming"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"climate impact of alternative organic fertilizers using life cycle assessment","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1088/1748-9326/ad8589","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-763078","identifier":[{"id":"85209099539","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-59bfcaab-202e-420e-8a0a-e0233b48f3b8"],"keyword":["anaerobic digestion","cattle slurry","grass-clover","greenhouse gas emission","life cycle assessment","organic farming"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-D16027525130407FD894CA15CBD96465"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.au.dk/ws/files/421788096/Meng_2024_Environ._Res._Lett._19_124050.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1088/1748-9326/ad8589","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Technical Sciences, Department of Agroecology, Department of Agroecology - Soil Fertility","Aarhus University, Technical Sciences, iCLIMATE Aarhus University Interdisciplinary Centre for Climate Change, iCLIMATE Aarhus University Interdisciplinary Centre for Climate Change - iCLIMATE Aarhus University Interdisciplinary Centre for Climate Change, Foulum"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Xiaoyi","key":"mengpau","last":"Meng","locid":"f2a93356-c6ec-4f0a-9803-c514944e6bfa","name":"Meng, Xiaoyi","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Marie Trydeman","key":"knudsenpau","last":"Knudsen","locid":"f409fce7-7fa9-494a-a089-7965887b5bd9","name":"Knudsen, Marie Trydeman","orcid":"0000-0001-7905-0382","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Søren O","key":"petersenpau","last":"Petersen","locid":"9ea8da1c-a327-4dc9-9ed9-29a56cfa2f5d","name":"Petersen, Søren O","orcid":"0000-0001-7524-6695","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Henrik Bjarne","key":"møllerpau","last":"Møller","locid":"a2eda86a-cdac-4996-8db0-3cecfe51be12","name":"Møller, Henrik Bjarne","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Fatemeh","key":"hashemipau","last":"Hashemi","locid":"cb730ccb-034e-407a-830b-d1c6081faa30","name":"Hashemi, Fatemeh","orcid":"0000-0002-4756-9339","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1088/1748-9326/ad8589","issn":["17489326"],"issue":"12","journal":"Environmental Research Letters","paperid":"124050","publisher":"Institute of Physics","status":"p","title":"Environmental Research Letters","volume":"19"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85209099539"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-59bfcaab-202e-420e-8a0a-e0233b48f3b8"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Climate impact of alternative organic fertilizers using life cycle assessment","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-763078","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
{"abstract":"Background: Inter-hospital transfer is necessary for the transport of patients to specialized treatment. Rotor-wing aircraft may be used in lieu of ambulances in time-critical conditions over long distances and when specialist team skills are called for. The purpose of the review is to assess the current scientific literature that describes the scenario to develop a national guideline for inter-hospital transfers using rotor-wing aircraft. The aim is to describe the patterns and challenges. Methods and Analysis: The authors will conduct a scoping review as per Joanna Briggs Institute guideline. The protocol for the scoping review will adhere to the Open Science Framework guideline for scoping reviews and we will report the findings of the scoping review as per PRISMA-ScR guideline. We have developed the search strategy with the help of a research librarian and will conduct search in relevant electronic databases and include gray literature as well, using the PRESS and PRISMA-S guidelines. Two authors will independently screen titles and abstracts for inclusion as per eligibility criteria and conflicts will be resolved by a third reviewer. Full text retrieval will be conducted accordingly. We will analyze the extracted data using validated statistical methods. Ethics and Dissemination: According to Danish law, scoping reviews are exempt from ethics committee approval. The findings of this scoping review will provide the scientific foundation for a national guideline on rotor-wing aircraft conveyed inter-hospital transfers in Denmark. Furthermore, we will publish the results of the scoping review in a relevant scientific journal.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Hansen, Peter Martin","Rudolph, Søren Steemann","Barfod, Charlotte","Hansen, Troels Martin","Knudsen, Jens Stubager","Fedog, Trond Nuland","Krog, Jan"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-772206"],"filters":{"added":"2025-01","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Hansen, Peter Martin"],"country":["Norway"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Norsk Luftambulanse AS"],"keyword":["Emergency Medical Services","HEMS","inter hospital transfer","rotor wing aircraft"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GV","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"GV":["DI-GV-ALL","DI-GV-FSK"],"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-OTH","DI-HO-SDR"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-GV-FSK","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-OTH","DI-HO-SDR","DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"inter hospital transfers in rotor wing aircraft patterns and challenges protocol for a scoping review","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"djr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1111/aas.14500","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-772206","identifier":[{"id":"85198550490","type":"scopus"},{"id":"39004509","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["au-41dc95dc-8c41-4e83-b8fa-bb752b1675bd"],"keyword":["HEMS","emergency medical services","inter-hospital transfer","rotor-wing aircraft"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-3-5-BD8FE9F91231DA843FEDC4713F948C8E"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1111/aas.14500","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"other hospitals","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-OTH","l3nl":"Other Hospitals","l3nn":"Other Hospitals","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Other Hospitals","namevar":["Danish Air Ambulance"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-OTH","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"region of southern denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-SDR","l3nl":"Region of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"Region of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Region of Southern Denmark","namevar":["Odense University Hospital","Region of Southern Denmark"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-SDR","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"dk","key":"capital region of denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CAP","l3nl":"Capital Region of Denmark","l3nn":"Capital Region of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Capital Region of Denmark","namevar":["National Hospital of Denmark"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CAP","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"dk","key":"fsk the armed forces medical command","l2":"DI-GV","l2n":"Governmental Institutions","l3":"DI-GV-FSK","l3nn":"FSK The Armed Forces Medical Command","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"FSK The Armed Forces Medical Command","namevar":["Danish Armed Forces Health Services"],"nora_code":"DI-GV-FSK","used":1},{"affno":"5","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine - Præhospitalet"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"6","country":"no","key":"norsk luftambulanse as","loc":["Norway","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Norsk Luftambulanse AS","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"first":"Peter Martin","key":"hansenpetermartinpau","last":"Hansen","name":"Hansen, Peter Martin","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 3","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren Steemann","key":"rudolphsørensteemannpau","last":"Rudolph","name":"Rudolph, Søren Steemann","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 4","corresponding":null,"first":"Charlotte","key":"barfodcharlottepau","last":"Barfod","name":"Barfod, Charlotte","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 5","corresponding":null,"first":"Troels Martin","key":"hansentroelsmartinpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"8ceafc71-fca4-489a-80da-95dd94500129","name":"Hansen, Troels Martin","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"first":"Jens Stubager","key":"knudsenjensstubagerpau","last":"Knudsen","name":"Knudsen, Jens Stubager","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"6","corresponding":null,"first":"Trond Nuland","key":"fedogtrondnulandpau","last":"Fedog","name":"Fedog, Trond Nuland","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 5","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jan","key":"krogjanpau","last":"Krog","locid":"6d018e39-093c-4924-84cb-e4b2c9dd4ef3","name":"Krog, Jan","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["39004509"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1111/aas.14500","issn":["00015172"],"issue":"10","journal":"Acta Anaesthesiologica Scandinavica","pages":"1556-1560","publisher":"Blackwell Munksgaard","status":"p","title":"Acta Anaesthesiologica Scandinavica","volume":"68"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85198550490"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Governmental Institutions","All Hospitals","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-GV","DI-GV-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Governmental Institutions","Hospitals","Other Hospitals","Region of Southern Denmark","Universities","danish air ambulance"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-41dc95dc-8c41-4e83-b8fa-bb752b1675bd"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Inter hospital transfers in rotor wing aircraft. Patterns and challenges. Protocol for a scoping review","type":"Journal Review","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-772206","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
{"abstract":"I CFU-Absalon er vi så heldige at have fået to nye sprogkonsulenter for henholdsvis engelsk og tysk: Kirstine Jordan og Kim Østerskov Andersen. Mød dem i denne udgave af Praksis, hvor de i fællesskab sætter fokus på mundtlighed i fremmedsprogsundervisningen. Det kommer blandt andet til at handle om forberedt og uforberedt sprog, om task-baseret undervisning og om læremidler, der kan understøtte elevernes mundtlige kompetencer.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Jordan, Kirstine","Østerskov Andersen, Kim","Westergaard, Mette Bechmann","Pedersen, Maria Ulrik","Knudsen, Søren Bøgh","Hjuler, Kristian Neubert"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-782311"],"filters":{"added":"2025-01","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-UC"],"level3":{"UC":["DI-UC-AB","DI-UC-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-UC-AB"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"mundtlighed i fremmedsprogsundervisningen m kirstine jordan og kim østerskov andersen 000000000036 praksis","src":["pha"],"src-code":["DI-UC-AB"],"type":"dnt","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/36-mundtlighed-i-fremmedsprogsundervisningen-m-kirstine/id1553652931?i=1000654133491","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-782311","ids":["pha-7fa1f990-25d8-4312-9bc1-6e1457468555"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-92042575549D056C4BD57C26594FD5AA"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/36-mundtlighed-i-fremmedsprogsundervisningen-m-kirstine/id1553652931?i=1000654133491","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"university college absalon","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-AB","l3nl":"University College Absalon","l3nn":"University College Absalon","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Univers