{"abstract":"Reliable methods to assess immune function after solid organ transplantation (SOT) are needed to guide dosing of immunosuppression. We hypothesized that toll-like receptor ligand-induced cytokine concentrations would decrease post-transplantation due to the use of immunosuppressive medication. Furthermore, we hypothesized that induced cytokine concentrations pre-transplantation would be higher in recipients with episodes of acute rejection post-transplantation due to underlying immunological dispositions. We aimed to investigate toll-like receptor ligand-induced cytokine concentrations by TruCulture","author_count":12,"contributors":["Møller, Dina Leth","Sørensen, Søren Schwartz","Perch, Michael","Gustafsson, Finn","Hald, Annemette","Knudsen, Andreas Delhbæk","Abdulovski, Ranya","Arentoft, Nicoline Stender","Lundgren, Jens","Rasmussen, Allan","Ostrowski, Sisse Rye","Nielsen, Susanne Dam"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-719478"],"filters":{"added":"2024-02","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Immunology","TLR","Transplantation","TruCulture"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"differences in toll like receptor ligand induced cytokine concentrations before and after solid organ transplantation a prospective observational cohort study in a clinical setting","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-719478","identifier":[{"id":"85177216825","type":"scopus"},{"id":"38168873","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["ku-1d20072e-3405-4840-bd5f-357ded750872"],"keyword":["TLR","TruCulture©","functional immune assay","immunology","transplantation"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-667A27968F1B96D33265F6BBC9020249"],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"capital region of denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CAP","l3nl":"Capital Region of Denmark","l3nn":"Capital Region of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Capital Region of Denmark","namevar":["Copenhagen University Hospital - Rigshospitalet"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CAP","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine","Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Internal Medicine: Nephrology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Dina Leth","key":"møllerpau","last":"Møller","name":"Møller, Dina Leth","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","first":"Søren Schwartz","key":"sørensenpau","last":"Sørensen","locid":"115ed8b6-8f6c-468a-9217-994613816c8e","name":"Sørensen, Søren Schwartz","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","first":"Michael","key":"perchpau","last":"Perch","locid":"e0a136a6-8b36-4735-9db2-8847ce581fc6","name":"Perch, Michael","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","first":"Finn","key":"gustafssonpau","last":"Gustafsson","locid":"6716eef1-891b-4209-a823-e96e765b9433","name":"Gustafsson, Finn","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Annemette","key":"haldpau","last":"Hald","name":"Hald, Annemette","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Andreas Delhbæk","key":"knudsenpau","last":"Knudsen","name":"Knudsen, Andreas Delhbæk","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Ranya","key":"abdulovskipau","last":"Abdulovski","name":"Abdulovski, Ranya","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Nicoline Stender","key":"arentoftpau","last":"Arentoft","name":"Arentoft, Nicoline Stender","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","first":"Jens","key":"lundgrenpau","last":"Lundgren","locid":"af310f7a-c49b-4381-bcb4-cf56e3fd80d8","name":"Lundgren, Jens","orcid":"0000-0001-8901-7850","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Allan","key":"rasmussenpau","last":"Rasmussen","name":"Rasmussen, Allan","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","first":"Sisse Rye","key":"ostrowskipau","last":"Ostrowski","locid":"ba497828-2322-4b15-bfae-1e8a8c3895e7","name":"Ostrowski, Sisse Rye","orcid":"0000-0001-5288-3851","rank":11,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Susanne Dam","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","name":"Nielsen, Susanne Dam","rank":12,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["38168873"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1111/sji.13337","issn":["03009475","03016323"],"issn_org":["03009475"],"issue":"2","journal":"Scandinavian Journal of Immunology","paperid":"e13337","status":"p","title":"Scandinavian Journal of Immunology","volume":"99"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85177216825"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-1d20072e-3405-4840-bd5f-357ded750872"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Differences in toll-like receptor ligand-induced cytokine concentrations before and after solid organ transplantation : A prospective, observational cohort study in a clinical setting","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-719478","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
{"abstract":"The postsynaptic density (PSD) comprises numerous scaffolding proteins, receptors, and signaling molecules that coordinate synaptic transmission in the brain. Postsynaptic density protein 95 (PSD-95) is a master scaffold protein within the PSD and one of its most abundant proteins and therefore constitutes a very attractive biomarker of PSD function and its pathological changes. Here, we exploit a high-affinity inhibitor of PSD-95, AVLX-144, as a template for developing probes for molecular imaging of the PSD. AVLX-144-based probes were labeled with the radioisotopes fluorine-18 and tritium, as well as a fluorescent tag. Tracer binding showed saturable, displaceable, and uneven distribution in rat brain slices, proving effective in quantitative autoradiography and cell imaging studies. Notably, we observed diminished tracer binding in human post-mortem Parkinson’s disease (PD) brain slices, suggesting postsynaptic impairment in PD. We thus offer a suite of translational probes for visualizing and understanding PSD-related pathologies.","author_count":19,"contributors":["Fernandes, Eduardo F. A.","Palner, Mikael","Raval, Nakul Ravi","Jeppesen, Troels E.","Danková, Daniela","Bærentzen, Simone L.","Werner, Christian","Eilts, Janna","Maric, Hans-Michael","Doose, Sören","Aripaka, Sanjay Sagar","Kaalund, Sanne Simone","Aznar, Susana","Kjaer, Andreas","Schlosser, Andreas","Kedström, Linda Maria Haugaard","Knudsen, Gitte Moos","Herth, Matthias M.","Strømgaard, Kristian"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-754125"],"filters":{"added":"2024-09","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Germany","United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","University of Würzburg","Yale University"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"development of peptide based probes for molecular imaging of the postsynaptic density in the brain","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-754125","identifier":[{"id":"85198502011","type":"scopus"},{"id":"38981131","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["ku-04f5787b-0f40-4ba4-bef2-9308bd9249f3"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-629581700A2512DB7A44E940577A8495"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Drug Design and Pharmacology, Medicinal Chemistry"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"capital region of denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CAP","l3nl":"Capital Region of Denmark","l3nn":"Capital Region of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Capital Region of Denmark","namevar":["Copenhagen University Hospital - Rigshospitalet"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CAP","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"us","key":"yale university","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"Yale University","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"de","key":"university of würzburg","loc":["Germany","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Würzburg","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Eduardo F.A.","key":"fernandespau","last":"Fernandes","locid":"36d0cdd8-d6c0-4faa-ac55-9ff691cb0c3d","name":"Fernandes, Eduardo F. A.","name_org":"Fernandes, Eduardo F.A.","orcid":"0000-0003-3406-1357","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Mikael","key":"palnerpau","last":"Palner","name":"Palner, Mikael","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2 1 3","first":"Na