, Linda Maria Haugaard","name_org":"Haugaard-Kedström, Linda M.","orcid":"0000-0003-0113-6535","rank":16,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2 1","first":"Gitte M.","key":"knudsenpau","last":"Knudsen","locid":"f02aee9e-69cf-491a-9765-ff062f734db8","name":"Knudsen, Gitte Moos","name_org":"Knudsen, Gitte M.","orcid":"0000-0003-1508-6866","rank":17,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","first":"Matthias M.","key":"herthpau","last":"Herth","locid":"001339a3-ac7c-4378-bfd6-c13d689a5f6f","name":"Herth, Matthias M.","rank":18,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Kristian","key":"stromgaardpau","last":"Stro̷mgaard","locid":"78f1a438-9c1e-4795-bf55-b266b5d2cde4","name":"Strømgaard, Kristian","name_org":"Stro̷mgaard, Kristian","orcid":"0000-0003-2206-4737","rank":19,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["38981131"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1021/acs.jmedchem.4c00615","issn":["00222623","15204804"],"issn_org":["00222623"],"issue":"14","journal":"Journal of Medicinal Chemistry","pages":"11975-11988","status":"p","title":"Journal of Medicinal Chemistry","volume":"67"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85198502011"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-04f5787b-0f40-4ba4-bef2-9308bd9249f3"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Development of Peptide-Based Probes for Molecular Imaging of the Postsynaptic Density in the Brain","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-754125","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
{"abstract":"I denne episode af 'Praksis' vender vi tilbage til temaet om det tænkende klasserum i matematik. Vi byder velkommen til manden bag konceptet, professor Peter Liljedahl, som deler indsigt fra sin forskning og bog og giver liv til de centrale ideer i det tænkende klasserum. Han tilbyder nye perspektiver på undervisningsmetoden, såsom brugen af kortspil til at danne grupper. Er du ny til konceptet om det tænkende klasserum, anbefaler vi, at du lytter til vores tidligere episode med Dorte Læssøe Ivarsen, hvor vi giver en introduktion til Det tænkende klasserum.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Liljedahl, Peter","Westergaard, Mette Bechmann","Pedersen, Maria Ulrik","Knudsen, Søren Bøgh","Hjuler, Kristian Neubert"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-782332"],"filters":{"added":"2025-01","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","OECD"],"country":["Canada"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Simon Fraser University"],"level":"pop","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-UC"],"level3":{"UC":["DI-UC-AB","DI-UC-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-UC-AB"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"det tænkende klasserum i matematikundervisningen m peter liljedahl 000000000033 praksis","src":["pha"],"src-code":["DI-UC-AB"],"type":"dnt","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/33-det-t%C3%A6nkende-klasserum-i-matematikundervisningen/id1553652931?i=1000643769021","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-782332","ids":["pha-a869322f-8d68-4375-a314-3263501ea757"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-EC0332E91488A23073568BDE0E524187"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/33-det-t%C3%A6nkende-klasserum-i-matematikundervisningen/id1553652931?i=1000643769021","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"ca","