{"abstract":"Hvad går de nye forsøgsprøver i mundtlig dansk egentlig ud på? Det spørgsmål har danskkonsulenterne i CFU fået rigtig mange gange de seneste måneder. Derfor har vi nu taget udfordringen op og bruger april måneds udgave af Praksis på at forklare både intentionerne bag forsøgsprøverne og den praktiske udformning af de såkaldte caseprøver og portefolioprøver. Det sker i en samtale mellem CFU-danskkonsulenterne Susanne Hansson og Mette Bechmann Westergaard.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Hansson, Susanne","Westergaard, Mette Bechmann","Pedersen, Maria Ulrik","Knudsen, Søren Bøgh","Hjuler, Kristian Neubert"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-782262"],"filters":{"added":"2025-01","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-UC"],"level3":{"UC":["DI-UC-AB","DI-UC-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-UC-AB"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"nye forsøgsprøver i mundtlig dansk m susanne hansson 000000000035 praksis","src":["pha"],"src-code":["DI-UC-AB"],"type":"dnt","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/35-nye-fors%C3%B8gspr%C3%B8ver-i-mundtlig-dansk-m-susanne-hansson/id1553652931?i=1000651034308","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-782262","ids":["pha-12b0b336-fc61-42cc-a259-d6dbf4fd8765"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-29540765C3C7CCD84F2905E5F562CCEA"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/35-nye-fors%C3%B8gspr%C3%B8ver-i-mundtlig-dansk-m-susanne-hansson/id1553652931?i=1000651034308","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"university college absalon","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-AB","l3nl":"University College Absalon","l3nn":"University College Absalon","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"University College A