ansactions on Visualization and Computer Graphics","pages":"649-660","publisher":"IEEE","status":"p","title":"IEEE Transactions on Visualization and Computer Graphics","volume":"30"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85175229487"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["itu-6923c60b-1cde-4d6b-8580-37965a9df780"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Challenges and Opportunities in Data Visualization Education: A Call to Action","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-718866","year":"2023","yearsub":"2023"}
{"abstract":"Systemic lupus erythematosus (SLE) is an autoimmune disease, which has been associated with Epstein–Barr virus (EBV) and Cytomegalovirus (CMV) infection. Drug-induced lupus (DIL) is a lupus-like disease caused by the intake of therapeutic drugs, which has been estimated to cause approximately 10–15% of lupus-like cases. Although SLE and DIL share common clinical symptoms, there are some fundamental differences between DIL and SLE onset. Moreover, it remains to be examined whether environmental factors, such as EBV and CMV infections, may contribute to the development of DIL. This study focused on examining the possible association between DIL and EBV and CMV infections, by examining IgG titers to EBV and CMV antigens in serum samples by enzyme-linked immunosorbent assays. Antibody titers to EBV early antigen–diffuse and CMV pp52 were found to be significantly elevated in both SLE and DIL patients compared to healthy controls, although no correlation was found for antibodies to the two virus antigens in the respective disease groups. Moreover, total IgG titers were reduced in SLE and DIL serum samples, which may reflect a general lymphocytopenia, which commonly is associated with SLE. The current findings support that EBV and CMV infections may contribute to the development of DIL and that onset of both diseases are related.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Knudsen, Julie","Trier, Nicole Hartwig","Draborg, Anette Holck","Nielsen, Christoffer Tandrup","Jacobsen, Søren","Højrup, Peter","Houen, Gunnar"],"cuid":["S02-100.00-673040"],"filters":{"added":"2023-06","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"corresponding_author":["Houen, Gunnar"],"keyword":["Antibodies","Cytomegalovirus","Epstein Barr virus","Systemic lupus erythematosus","drug induced lupus"],"level":"sci","mra":["med","sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GV","DI-U"],"level3":{"GV":["DI-GV-ALL","DI-GV-SSI"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-GV-SSI","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"elevated antibody titers to epstein barr virus and cytomegalovirus in patients with drug induced lupus","src":["ku","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3390/v15040986","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-100.00-673040","identifier":[{"id":"PMC10144390","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"37112967","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85156250703","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-055dc28f-36c2-44d8-9369-7ab731129663","sdu-0dc56e4b-2ece-439d-ba0e-896c5d07a497"],"keyword":["Epstein–Barr virus","antibodies","cytomegalovirus","drug-induced lupus","systemic lupus erythematosus"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science","Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-90A0F3BC8AE696F9B5E6263A3A1A8EBE"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/347108715/viruses_15_00986.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3390/v15040986","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/229757273/Open_Access_Version.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, Faculty of Science, Department of Biochemistry and Molecular Biology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"ssi statens serum institut","l2":"DI-GV","l2n":"Governmental Institutions","l3":"DI-GV-SSI","l3nn":"SSI Statens Serum Institut","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","No