{"abstract":"Det er vigtigt at huske, at de lærerstuderende skal udvikle deres praksiserfaringer gennem refleksion. Og hvis refleksionen skal hæve sig over det hverdagstrivielle, er den pædagogiske videnskab afgørende, skriver Danmarks Pædagogiske Tænketank","author_count":10,"contributors":["Madsen, Peter Hougaard","Akselsen, Kate Thais","Andersen, Søren Bøjgård Schleicher","Ebsen, Rikke Osbahr","Gammelgaard, Ole","Jespersen, Peter","Knudsen, Brian Han","Korf, Morten","Pjengaard, Søren","Prætorius, Jannie Lynggaard"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-659545"],"filters":{"added":"2023-08","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Det pædagogiske fagområde","Folkeskolen","Læreruddannelsen","Pædagogik"],"level":"pop","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-UC"],"level3":{"UC":["DI-UC-AB","DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-KP","DI-UC-UCL","DI-UC-UCN","DI-UC-UCS","DI-UC-VIA"]},"level3all":["DI-UC-AB","DI-UC-KP","DI-UC-UCL","DI-UC-UCN","DI-UC-UCS","DI-UC-VIA"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"danmarks pædagogiske tænketank der er en praksis fetichisme i uddannelsesdebatten men praksis er ikke meget værd uden refleksion","src":["via"],"src-code":["DI-UC-VIA"],"type":"doo","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://skolemonitor.dk/debat/art8531927/Der-er-en-praksis-fetichisme-i-uddannelsesdebatten-men-praksis-er-ikke-meget-v%C3%A6rd-uden-refleksion","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-659545","ids":["via-a4c905b9-083e-40bb-a87e-dab1873c890f"],"keyword":["det pædagogiske fagområde","folkeskolen","læreruddannelsen","pædagogik"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-388E9469B9969813E066B4398D7AF4D3"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://skolemonitor.dk/debat/art8531927/Der-er-en-praksis-fetichisme-i-uddannelsesdebatten-men-praksis-er-ikke-meget-v%C3%A6rd-uden-refleksion","version":"Published Version