{"abstract":"Det er vigtigt at huske, at de lærerstuderende skal udvikle deres praksiserfaringer gennem refleksion. Og hvis refleksionen skal hæve sig over det hverdagstrivielle, er den pædagogiske videnskab afgørende, skriver Danmarks Pædagogiske Tænketank.","author_count":10,"contributors":["Madsen, Morten Korf","Jespersen, Peter","Ebsen, Rikke Osbahr","Mikkelsen, Stinus Lundum Storm","Knudsen, Brian","Pjengaard, Søren","Bøjgaard Schleicher Andersen, Søren","Akselsen, Käte Thaisen","Madsen, Peter Hougaard","Gammelgaard, Ole"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-393202"],"filters":{"added":"2023-02","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-UC"],"level3":{"UC":["DI-UC-AB","DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-KP","DI-UC-UCL","DI-UC-UCN","DI-UC-UCS","DI-UC-VIA"]},"level3all":["DI-UC-AB","DI-UC-KP","DI-UC-UCL","DI-UC-UCN","DI-UC-UCS","DI-UC-VIA"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"der er en praksis fetichisme i uddannelsesdebatten men praksis er ikke meget værd uden refleksion","src":["kp"],"src-code":["DI-UC-KP"],"type":"doo","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-393202","ids":["kp-f6b85a03-b4e3-4fbf-b0c9-2fc001f0afd0"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-D8ACFFD98FA23AF7F1476DBBEB7F0E48"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"kp university college copenhagen","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-KP","l3nl":"KP","l3nn":"KP University College Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KP University College Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Professionshøjskole, Rektors område, Fakultet for læreruddannelse og livslang læring - Dekan, Læreruddannelse 6"],"nora_code":"DI-UC-KP","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"uc syd university college south denmark","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-UCS","l3nl":"UC SYD, University College South Denmark","l3nn":"UC SY