{"abstract":"Power-to-methanol is seen as a key energy storage technology in contributing to reach climate targets and unleash the great potential for renewable electricity. This study conducted dynamic simulations that focuses on the feed gas composition effects and surrogate modeling by using the nonlinear autoregressive exogenous (NARX) model for the green methanol production. The modeling results showed obvious influences of feed gas composition on the process efficiency and CO2 conversion, which were predicted by the NARX model with promising accuracy.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Cui, Xiaoti","Kær, Søren Knudsen","Nielsen, Mads Pagh"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-082294"],"event":{"end":"2021-08-13","place":"London, gb","start":"2021-08-09","title":"The 2nd International Conference on Energy and AI","year":"2021"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["CO2 hydrogenation","Dynamic simulation","Methanol synthesis","Nonlinear autoregressive exogenous model","Power to methanol","Surrogate modeling"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-OTH"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-PR-OTH","DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"the feed gas composition effects on the green methanol production dynamic simulation and surrogate modeling","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-082294","ids":["aau-6ed0df6f-6d18-47cf-a60b-d6ab4ebe42f5"],"keyword":["CO2 hydrogenation","Dynamic simulation","Methanol synthesis","Nonlinear autoregressive exogenous model","Power-to-methanol","Surrogate modeling"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-D5E1DBF90BCE75FCE75E221C60B06286"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U