p","title":"Journal of Hospital Infection","volume":"113"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85106391058"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Governmental Institutions","All Hospitals","All Private Research","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-GV","DI-GV-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-PR","DI-PR-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Governmental Institutions","Hospitals","NIRAS A/S","Private Research","Region of Southern Denmark","Universities","University of Copenhagen","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-edd22926-361b-459e-8924-eabb1a15aea6","sdu-682f14c8-060d-4e29-aab9-24fd02fc0c90"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Laminar airflow decreases microbial air contamination compared with turbulent ventilated operating theatres during live total joint arthroplasty : a nationwide survey","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-099.85-047195","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
{"abstract":"Neural audio synthesis is an actively researched topic, having yielded a wide range of techniques that leverages machine learning architectures. Google Magenta elaborated a novel approach called Differential Digital Signal Processing (DDSP) that incorporates deep neural networks with preconditioned digital signal processing techniques, reaching state-of-the-art results especially in timbre transfer applications. However, most of these techniques, including the DDSP, are generally not applicable in real-time constraints, making them ineligible in a musical workflow. In this paper, we present a real-time implementation of the DDSP library embedded in a virtual synthesizer as a plug-in that can be used in a Digital Audio Workstation. We focused on timbre transfer from learned representations of real instruments to arbitrary sound inputs as well as controlling these models by MIDI. Furthermore, we developed a GUI for intuitive high-level controls which can be used for post-processing and manipulating the parameters estimated by the neural network. We have conducted a user experience test with seven participants online. The results indicated that our users found the interface appealing, easy to understand, and worth exploring further. At the same time, we have identified issues in the timbre transfer quality, in some components we did not implement, and in installation and distribution of our plugin. The next iteration of our design will address these issues.","author_count":9,"contributors":["Ganis, Francesco","Knudsen, Erik F.","Lyster, Søren V.K.","Otterbein, Robin","Südholt, David","Erkut, Cumhur"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-061977"],"event":{"end":"2021-07-01","place":"Virtual, Online","start":"2021-06-29","title":"18th Sound and Music Computing Conference, SMC 2021","year":"2021"},"filters":{"added":"2022-03","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"real time timbre transfer and sound synthesis using ddsp","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY 4.0","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.5043235","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-061977","identifier":[{"id":"85122077732","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-2938a978-1ea7-4674-822b-86579a2158c1"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-3-3-A93F19798B294CCD0CE54DDBE5CEA3AA"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY 4.0","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/467128544/SMC_2021_paper_55.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY 4.0","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.5043235","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2021","yearSub":"2021"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Architecture, Design and Media Technology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Francesco","key":"ganispau","last":"Ganis","locid":"06a38818-c89c-4794-a3b6-d7f503c749c1","name":"Ganis, Francesco","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Erik F.","key":"knudsenpau","last":"Knudsen","locid":"be54166a-d40b-4913-9467-12af7c5226a8","name":"Knudsen, Erik F.","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren V.K.","key":"lysterpau","last":"Lys