{"abstract":"Pyrolysis of a single biomass pellet involves multiple processes, such as evaporation, decomposition, flow field changes, shrinking or swelling. These processes can be simulated by consolidating pyrolysis theories and computational fluid dynamics. In this paper, a one-dimensional transient model is formulated in a C++ code to simulate the process of pyrolysis of a single biomass pellet. Experimental data from the literature is used to validate this model. This paper presents detailed modelling results for a single biomass pellet under pyrolysis in nitrogen. The model can determine the temperature distribution at different locations at any certain time, and the temperature distribution, at the same location, over time. In this paper, the focus is on how different parameters develop with time within the biomass pellet.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Li, Xiyan","Yin, Chungen","Kær, Søren Knudsen","Condra, Thomas Joseph"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-051500"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corresponding_author":["Li, Xiyan"],"keyword":["Biomass","CFD","Finite volume method","Pyrolysis"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"a detailed pyrolysis model for a thermally large biomass particle","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.scopus.com/inward/record.url?scp=85086658441&partnerID=8YFLogxK","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-051500","identifier":[{"id":"85086658441","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-050498f4-4be8-412d-a691-47d36ce7bf27"],"keyword":["Biomass","CFD","Finite volume method","Pyrolysis"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-46F0F5CD6E2C3E3DC49AFB56661219D9"],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2020","yearSub":"2020"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy, Thermofluids"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Xiyan","key":"lipau","last":"Li","locid":"014a9e44-0747-4c9c-a944-54e8b42244e3","name":"Li, Xiyan","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Chungen","key":"yinpau","last":"Yin","locid":"a24ca845-2626-44cc-b726-b6c5ec9ddd24","name":"Yin, Chungen","orcid":"0000-0002-9885-7744","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Søren Knudsen","key":"kærpau","last":"Kær","locid":"898d6584-ec2e-430a-b78d-e3e0d670dcdd","name":"Kær, Søren Knudsen","orcid":"0000-0003-2151-8055","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Thomas","key":"condrapau","last":"Condra","locid":"efc8fe4a-c33b-4fb6-b2e7-2e7141f4592c","name":"Condra, Thomas Joseph","name_org":"Condra, Thomas","orcid":"0000-0002-1140-6415","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.fuel.2020.118397","issn":["00162361","18737153"],"issn_org":["00162361"],"journal":"Fuel","paperid":"118397","publisher":"Elsevier","status":"p","title":"Fuel","volume":"278"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85086658441"],"sdg":["7. Affordable and Clean Energy","All UN SDG Classification"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-050498f4-4be8-412d-a691-47d36ce7bf27"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"A detailed pyrolysis model for a thermally large biomass particle","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-051500","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
{"abstract":"Thermal analysis and thermal management of lithium-ion batteries for utilization in electric vehicles is vital. In order to investigate the thermal behavior of a lithium-ion battery, a liquid cooling design is demonstrated in this research. The influence of cooling direction and conduit distribution on the thermal performance of the lithium-ion battery is analyzed. The outcomes exhibit that the appropriate flow rate for heat dissipation is dependent on different configurations for cold plate. The acceptable heat dissipation condition could be acquired by adding more cooling conduits. Moreover, it was distinguished that satisfactory cooling direction could efficiently enhance the homogeneity of temperature distribution of the lithium-ion battery.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Madani, Seyed Saeed","Schaltz, Erik","Kær, Søren Knudsen"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-066786"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corresponding_author":["Madani, Seyed Saeed"],"keyword":["Cold plate","Lithium ion batteries","Thermal analysis"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"thermal analysis of cold plate with different configurations for thermal management of a lithium ion battery","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY 4.0","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3390/batteries6010017","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-066786","identifier":[{"id":"85081673509","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-39b84886-13e6-4c13-a83b-d47c0afd977e"],"keyword":["Cold plate","Lithium-ion batteries","Thermal analysis"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-2067D17920A390882AD2A302D8FF828E"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY 4.0","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3390/batteries6010017","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY 4.0","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/372781710/batteries_06_00017_2_.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2020","yearSub":"2020"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy, Thermofluids"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Seyed Saeed","key":"madanipau","last":"Madani","locid":"2b964c98-f205-4a96-8e1c-e2433090f82a","name":"Madani, Seyed Saeed","orcid":"0000-0003-1636-3554","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Erik","key":"schaltzpau","last":"Schaltz","locid":"6e39b31c-c3fa-470a-b47b-e69ee21195c1","name":"Schaltz, Erik","orcid":"0000-0002-8540-0040","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Søren Knudsen","key":"kærpau","last":"Kær","locid":"898d6584-ec2e-430a-b78d-e3e0d670dcdd","name":"Kær, Søren Knudsen","orcid":"0000-0003-2151-8055","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.3390/batteries6010017","issn":["23130105"],"issue":"1","journal":"Batteries","paperid":"17","publisher":"Multidisciplinary Digital Publishing Institute","status":"p","title":"Batteries","volume":"6"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85081673509"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-39b84886-13e6-4c13-a83b-d47c0afd977e"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Thermal Analysis of Cold Plate with Different Configurations for Thermal Management of a Lithium-Ion Battery","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-066786","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
{"abstract":"Methanol as a hydrogen carrier can be reformed with steam over Cu/ZnO/Al2O3 catalysts. In this paper a comprehensive pseudo-homogenous model of a multi-tubular packed-bed reformer has been developed to investigate the impact of operating conditions and geometric parameters on its performance. A kinetic Langmuir-Hinshelwood model of the methanol steam reforming process was proposed based on the work of Peppley et al. [1]. In addition to the kinetic model, the pressure drop and the mass and heat transfer phenomena along the reactor were taken into account. This model was verified by a dynamic model in the platform of ASPEN. The diffusion effect inside catalyst particles was also estimated and accounted for by the effectiveness factor. The simulation results showed axial temperature profiles in both tube and shell side with different operating conditions. Moreover, the lower flow rate of liquid fuel and higher inlet temperature of thermal air led to a lower concentration of residual methanol, but also a higher concentration of generated CO from the reformer exit. The choices of operating conditions were limited to ensure a tolerable concentration of methanol and CO in H2-rich gas for feeding into a high temperature polymer electrolyte membrane fuel cell (HT-PEMFC) stack. With fixed catalyst load, the increase of tube number and decrease of tube diameter improved the methanol conversion, but also increased the CO concentration in reformed gas. In addition, increasing the number of baffle plates in the shell side increased the methanol conversion and the CO concentration.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Zhu, Jimin","Araya, Samuel Simon","Cui, Xiaoti","Sahlin, Simon Lennart","Kær, Søren Knudsen"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-068570"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Geometric parameter","Hydrogen production","Methanol steam reforming","Multi tubular packed bed reformer","Temperature profile"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"modeling and design of a multi tubular packed bed reactor for methanol steam reforming over a cu zno al000000000002o000000000003 catalyst","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3390/en13030610","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-068570","identifier":[{"id":"85079002487","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-3ffa357f-db41-46b1-905b-1c6b24534b82"],"keyword":["geometric parameter","hydrogen production","methanol steam reforming","multi-tubular packed-bed reformer","temperature profile"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-67772496814E86549C68C7685041C0BE"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3390/en13030610","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2020","yearSub":"2020"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy, Thermofluids"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jimin","key":"zhupau","last":"Zhu","locid":"646bbb27-0236-46fb-9e23-beb875af834f","name":"Zhu, Jimin","orcid":"0000-0001-7889-4233","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Samuel","key":"simonarayapau","last":"Simon Araya","locid":"31cc4ce7-c9ae-4406-95d1-b95d4269205f","name":"Araya, Samuel Simon","name_org":"Simon Araya, Samuel","orcid":"0000-0001-9294-0793","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Xiaoti","key":"cuipau","last":"Cui","locid":"569f8898-f768-496f-8fc3-c93d917ef238","name":"Cui, Xiaoti","orcid":"0000-0001-6514-0280","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Simon Lennart","key":"sahlinpau","last":"Sahlin","locid":"10be1b68-a59d-4397-ae45-e356bf4c5844","name":"Sahlin, Simon Lennart","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Søren Knudsen","key":"kærpau","last":"Kær","locid":"898d6584-ec2e-430a-b78d-e3e0d670dcdd","name":"Kær, Søren Knudsen","orcid":"0000-0003-2151-8055","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.3390/en13030610","issn":["19961073"],"issue":"3","journal":"Energies","paperid":"610","publisher":"MDPI AG","publisher_org":"M D P I AG","status":"p","title":"Energies","volume":"13"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85079002487"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-3ffa357f-db41-46b1-905b-1c6b24534b82"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Modeling and Design of a Multi-Tubular Packed-Bed Reactor for Methanol Steam Reforming over a Cu/ZnO/Al2O3 Catalyst","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-068570","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
{"abstract":"I denne artikel komplementerer vi tidligere forskning og undersøger hvordan folkeskoleelever i 8. og 9. klasse opfatter de nationale test samt hvordan opfattelsen hænger sammen med faglighed, (mis)trivsel og køn. Undersøgelsen bygger på en spørgeskemaundersøgelse og fokusgruppeinterviews gennemført i 2019 med elever i Aalborg Kommune. Vi finder, at store elevgrupper har en overvejende negativ opfattelse af de nationale test og at elevernes humør påvirkes negativt før og efter en test. Samtidig finder vi signifikante sammenhænge mellem en mere negativ opfattelse af de nationale test og henholdsvis en svagere faglighed, større mistrivsel og køn (piger i forhold til drenge). Sammenhængene indikerer, at det tilsyneladende er hos elevgrupper, hvor behovet for faglig understøttelse er størst, at holdningen til de nationale test er mest negativ. Samlet set påpeger vi relevansen af at inddrage bredere perspektiver på effekterne af de nationale test, sætter spørgsmålstegn ved værdien af de nationale test som læringsredskab, og underbygger behovet for yderligere undersøgelser af hvordan de nationale test påvirker eleverne – personligt, socialt såvel som deres faglig udvikling.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Eriksen, Tobias Bøgeskov","Lindholst, Andrej Christian","Knudsen, Søren Valgreen"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-083627"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["De nationale test","Evaluering","Faglighed","Folkeskole","Kønsforskelle","Mistrivsel"],"level":"sci","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Aalborg Municipality"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"elevernes oplevelse af de nationale test en spørgeskemaundersøgelse af elever fra strategisk udvalgte folkeskoler i aalborg kommune","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://rauli.cbs.dk/index.php/dansksociologi/article/view/6649/7165","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-083627","ids":["aau-7386cf4d-e044-4cc8-b759-8e9ed04d8ca3"],"keyword":["De nationale test","Folkeskole","evaluering","faglighed","kønsforskelle","mistrivsel"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-21C6D3FBC075AE76F18D7882096C41B0"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://rauli.cbs.dk/index.php/dansksociologi/article/view/6649/7165","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Social Science (SOC)"],"yearPub":"2020","yearSub":"2020"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Aalborg Municipality"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Politics and Society","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Politics and Society, COMA (DPS)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Tobias Bøgeskov","key":"eriksenpau","last":"Eriksen","name":"Eriksen, Tobias Bøgeskov","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Christian","key":"lindholstpau","last":"Lindholst","locid":"c5126b02-afdf-4131-91e2-90c30307d87b","name":"Lindholst, Andrej Christian","name_org":"Lindholst, Christian","orcid":"0000-0001-8301-6187","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Søren Valgreen","key":"knudsenpau","last":"Knudsen","locid":"d59094b5-44a6-4398-9acf-f3f530e0504b","name":"Knudsen, Søren Valgreen","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["09055908"],"issue":"4","journal":"Dansk Sociologi","pages":"9-31","publisher":"Dansk Sociologforening","status":"p","title":"Dansk Sociologi","volume":"31"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","sdg":["4. Quality Education","All UN SDG Classification"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Miscellaneous","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Miscellaneous","Other Research","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-7386cf4d-e044-4cc8-b759-8e9ed04d8ca3"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Elevernes oplevelse af De Nationale Test: En spørgeskemaundersøgelse af elever fra strategisk udvalgte folkeskoler i Aalborg Kommune","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-083627","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
{"abstract":"In this work we propose a method for extracting, modelling, and predicting the resistance of Lithium-ion batteries directly from a dynamic mission profile, which was applied to the battery over a period of 38 weeks (approximately 4600 full equivalent cycles). While the extraction mainly relied on data manipulation and bookkeeping, the modelling and subsequent prediction of the resistance used a log-linear model. It is shown that the estimated log-linear model can be used to create a posterior probability distribution of the age of the battery, given an internal resistance measurement and the SOC value at which it was measured. This distribution was used to calculate the expected age of the battery, and the expected age was compared to the value obtained form battery weekly check-ups. At an SOC of 80% a mean absolute error (MAE), between the weekly check-ups and the expected age, of 5.83 weeks (706 FEC) was achieved. Furthermore, it is shown that by introducing a decision threshold, the MAE could be reduced as far as 2.65 weeks (321 FEC). Lastly, a method is introduced for handling cases where the SOC was not known prior to the battery age prediction.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Vilsen, Søren Byg","Kær, Søren Knudsen","Stroe, Daniel-Ioan"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-093051"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Battery degradation","Dynamic aging profile","Lithium ion battery","Log linear model","Resistance estimation"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"log linear model for predicting the lithium ion battery age based on resistance extraction from dynamic aging profiles","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/344033473/IEEE_IAS_FINAL.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-093051","identifier":[{"id":"85095966933","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-94523454-cc4a-49fd-a954-f4c6d651f03a"],"keyword":["Battery degradation","Dynamic aging profile","Lithium-ion battery","Log-linear model","Resistance estimation"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-4F5A2778C125676B03AEB8A8B34E881B"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/344033473/IEEE_IAS_FINAL.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2020","yearSub":"2020"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Mathematical Sciences","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Mathematical Sciences, Statistics"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Søren Byg","key":"vilsenpau","last":"Vilsen","locid":"b5209c84-7990-4da8-9a0b-684bbd14a377","name":"Vilsen, Søren Byg","orcid":"0000-0002-9718-8147","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Søren Knudsen","key":"kærpau","last":"Kær","locid":"898d6584-ec2e-430a-b78d-e3e0d670dcdd","name":"Kær, Søren Knudsen","orcid":"0000-0003-2151-8055","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Daniel-Ioan","key":"stroepau","last":"Stroe","locid":"5811b49e-3576-45ee-847b-ca093b034b5d","name":"Stroe, Daniel-Ioan","orcid":"0000-0002-2938-8921","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1109/tia.2020.3020529","issn":["00939994"],"issue":"6","journal":"IEEE Transactions on Industry Applications","pages":"6937-6948","paperid":"6","publisher":"IEEE (Institute of Electrical and Electronics Engineers)","status":"p","title":"IEEE Transactions on Industry Applications","title_org":"I E E E Transactions on Industry Applications","volume":"56"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85095966933"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-94523454-cc4a-49fd-a954-f4c6d651f03a"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Log-Linear Model for Predicting the Lithium-ion Battery Age based on Resistance Extraction from Dynamic Aging Profiles","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-093051","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
{"abstract":"A fundamental thermodynamic analysis of an air-cooled fuel cell, where the reactant air stream is also the coolant stream, is presented. The adiabatic cell temperature of such a fuel cell is calculated in a similar way as the adiabatic flame temperature in a combustion process. Diagrams that show the dependency of the cathode outlet temperature, the stoichiometric flow ratio and the operating cell voltage are developed. These diagrams can help fuel cell manufacturers to identify a suitable blower and a suitable operating regime for their fuel cell stacks. It is found that for standard conditions, reasonable cell temperatures are obtained for cathode stoichiometric flow ratios of ξ = 50 and higher, which is in very good agreement with manufacturer's recommendations. Under very cold ambient conditions, the suggested stoichiometric flow ratio is only in the range of ξ = 20 in order to obtain a useful fuel cell operating temperature. The outside relative humidity only plays a role at ambient temperatures above 40 ◦C, and the predicted stoichiometric flow ratios should be above ξ = 70 in this region. From a thermodynamic perspective, it is suggested that the adiabatic outlet temperature is a suitable definition of the fuel cell operating temperature.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Berning, Torsten","Kær, Søren Knudsen"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-121328"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corresponding_author":["Berning, Torsten"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"a thermodynamic analysis of an air cooled proton exchange membrane fuel cell operated in different climate regions","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3390/en13102611","version":"Published Version"},"funding_acknowledgement":["Funding: This research was funded by EUDP, Journal number 64012-0117, and carried out in collaboration with Dantherm Power A/S and Ballard Power Systems."],"id":"S01-000.00-121328","identifier":[{"id":"85085842884","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-f53a9ddd-6639-47d8-87bc-abe5ba96bc14"],"keyword":["Adiabatic fuel cell temperature","Air-cooled proton exchange membrane fuel cells","Thermodynamic analysis of proton exchange membrane fuel cells"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-6EE04406189CE8BA2F7FD4261C2AC357"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3390/en13102611","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY 4.0","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/406315682/energies_13_02611_v2.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2020","yearSub":"2020"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy, Heating and Cooling","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy, Hydrogen and Electro-fuels","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy, Thermofluids"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Torsten","key":"berningpau","last":"Berning","locid":"eecf017d-14b4-4110-9df5-a10a6c7e9bd9","name":"Berning, Torsten","orcid":"0000-0003-3324-0927","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":