{"abstract":"The original version of this Article contained an error in the spelling of the author Trine H. Mogensen, which was incorrectly given as Trine Mogensen. This has now been corrected in both the PDF and HTML versions of the Article.","author_count":38,"contributors":["Olagnier, David","Farahani, Ensieh","Thyrsted, Jacob","Blay-Cadanet, Julia","Herengt, Angela","Idorn, Manja","Hait, Alon Schneider","Hernaez, Bruno","Knudsen, Alice","Iversen, Marie B","Schilling, Mirjam","Jørgensen, Sofie Eg","Thomsen, Michelle M","Reinert, Line S.","Lappe, Michael","Hoang, Huy-Dung","Gilchrist, Victoria H","Hansen, Anne Louise","Ottosen, Rasmus N","Gunderstofte, Camilla","Møller, Charlotte Thornild","van der Horst, Demi","Peri, Suraj","Balachandran, Siddharth","Huang, Jinrong","Jakobsen, Martin Roelsgaard","Svenningsen, Esben B","Poulsen, Thomas","Bartsch, Lydia","Thielke, Anne L","Luo, Yonglun","Alain, Tommy","Rehwinkel, Jan","Alcamí, Antonio","Hiscott, John","Mogensen, Trine H","Paludan, Søren R","Holm, Christian K"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-232623"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","Asia, East","Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Holm, Christian K"],"country":["Canada","China","Germany","United Kingdom"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Lars Bolund Institute of Regenerative Medicine","University of Göttingen","University of Ottawa","University of Oxford"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-OTH"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-PR-OTH","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"author correction sars cov000000000002 mediated suppression of nrf000000000002 signaling reveals potent antiviral and anti inflammatory activity of 000000000004 octyl itaconate and dimethyl fumarate","src":["au"]