{"abstract":"Background: Few qualitative studies have focused on clinicians' perspectives regarding treatment of suicidal people. Despite limited evidence and imperfect risk-assessment tools, the psychosocial therapy at the Danish suicide prevention clinics has been linked to reductions in numbers of repeated self-harm, deaths by suicide, and other causes. This merits an investigation into how clinicians describe their practice.Methods: Using a qualitative design, 10 semi-structured interviews were conducted and analyzed to describe the psychosocial therapy.Results: The practices that the therapists described could be categorized along four dichotomous continuums. These illustrated dilemmas encountered during treatment of suicidal patients: 1) intuitive vs. specific risk assessment, 2) meaningful vs. formal, 3) patient-oriented vs. therapist-oriented and 4) direct vs. indirect approach to suicide prevention.Conclusions: Treatment in the Danish Suicide Prevention Clinics is characterized by methodological flexibility and diversity and with an emphasis on a patient-oriented approach. Furthermore, clinicians balance knowledge available by switching between a direct and an indirect approach according to the perceived suicide risk. If suicide risk was perceived as high, they would administer a direct approach and if low, an indirect approach. Finally, there seems to be differences as to how effective therapeutic methodologies work in the practice of suicide prevention.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Lahoz, Titia","Winsløv, Jan-Henrik","Christiansen, Rikke","Krogh, Søren","Knudsen, Per Bjerregaard","Wang, August G","Erlangsen, Annette","Nielsen, Klaus"],"cuid":["S03-093.56-007002"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":3,"continent":["America, North","OECD","Oceania"],"corresponding_author":["Lahoz, Titia"],"country":["Australia","United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Australian National University","Johns Hopkins University"],"keyword":["Intervention","Qualitative","Suicide"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-SDR"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-SDR","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"the treatment in the danish suicide prevention clinics a clinician perspective","src":["aau","au","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.scopus.com/inward/record.url?scp=85084421941&partnerID=8YFLogxK","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S03-093.56-007002","identifier":[{"id":"85084421941","type":"scopus"},{"id":"32379558","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["aau-907e783e-702a-4fff-aaa0-2e3cc8917090","au-a5828a5a-7f1b-4c2f-b672-5e0336f93ee4","ku-8ac767cf-bbb4-4a8b-ae0e-5ebd6f82bee7"],"keyword":["Suicide","intervention","qualitative"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-6-72A36EDEA7A28A7C5C2D1DCF31C2A40B"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2020","yearSub":"2020"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"capital region of denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CAP","l3nl":"Capital Region of Denmark","l3nn":"Capital Region of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Capital Region of Denmark","namevar":["Copenhagen University Hospital"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CAP","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital, Psychiatry"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"dk","key":"region of southern denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-SDR","l3nl":"Region of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"Region of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Region of Southern Denmark","namevar":["Odense University Hospital"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-SDR","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"dk","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["University of Southern Denmark (SDU)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":"5","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine","Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Psychiatry"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"6","country":"au","key":"australian national university","loc":["Australia","Oceania","OECD"],"name":"Australian National University","used":1},{"affno":"7","country":"us","key":"johns hopkins university","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"Johns Hopkins University","used":1},{"affno":"8","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Aarhus BSS, Department of Psychology and Behavioural Sciences"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Titia","key":"lahozpau","last":"Lahoz","name":"Lahoz, Titia","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jan-Henrik","key":"winsløvpau","last":"Winsløv","locid":"9e8a97e8-3b61-4afc-86b4-733cdd740bf5","name":"Winsløv, Jan-Henrik","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Rikke","key":"christiansenpau","last":"Christiansen","locid":"c3c97c72-d34e-4de0-b2b2-7125281716a1","name":"Christiansen, Rikke","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3 4","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren","key":"kroghpau","last":"Krogh","name":"Krogh, Søren","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Per Bjerregaard","key":"knudsenpau","last":"Knudsen","name":"Knudsen, Per Bjerregaard","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"5 1","first":"August G.","key":"wangpau","last":"Wang","locid":"6dfb1299-b15e-42dd-bf71-44f2b5f49a7c","name":"Wang, August G","name_org":"Wang, August G.","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 6 7","corresponding":null,"first":"Annette","key":"erlangsenpau","last":"Erlangsen","name":"Erlangsen, Annette","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"8","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Klaus","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"8a1daf8c-059b-4dba-9581-630a15523fa3","name":"Nielsen, Klaus","orcid":"0000-0001-7287-8400","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["32379558"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1080/08039488.2020.1759683","issn":["08039488","08039496"],"issn_org":["08039488"],"issue":"7","journal":"Nordic Journal of Psychiatry","pages":"533-540","publisher":"Taylor and Francis Ltd.","status":"p","title":"Nordic Journal of Psychiatry","volume":"74"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85084421941"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Region of Southern Denmark","Universities","University of Copenhagen","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-907e783e-702a-4fff-aaa0-2e3cc8917090","au-a5828a5a-7f1b-4c2f-b672-5e0336f93ee4","ku-8ac767cf-bbb4-4a8b-ae0e-5ebd6f82bee7"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University","AU Aarhus University","KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"The treatment in the Danish suicide prevention clinics : a clinician perspective","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S03-093.56-007002","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
{"abstract":"Lithium-ion batteries are extensively used for electric vehicles, owing to their great power and energy density. A battery thermal management system is essential for lithium-ion batteries. With the extensive utilization of liquid-cooling approaches for lithium-ion batteries’ thermal management, temperature homogeneity is considerably influenced by coolant distribution. A lower temperature of the cooling fluid brings about a lower temperature of the cell, but the relation and the amount are important to be analyzed. The cooling efficiency is considerably influenced by the flowing conduit arrangement in the cooling plate. Different parameters are affected by the cooling performance of the battery pack. Consequently, the effect of entrance temperature of coolant fluid, current rate, environment temperature, entrance velocity of the coolant fluid, and plate material on the performance and efficiency of a battery thermal management system were investigated. In this investigation, the program ANSYS/FLUENT was employed as the numerical solver to solve the problem. The simulation was accomplished after the end of the discharge. It was seen that the temperature distributions were the most sensitive to the entrance velocity of coolant fluid. It was concluded that the entrance velocity of coolant fluid has the greatest impact on the cooling efficiency and performance of the cold plate.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Madani, Seyed Saeed","Schaltz, Erik","Kær, Søren Knudsen"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-079692"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Lithium ion batteries"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"design and simulation of internal flowing twisted conduits for cooling of lithium ion batteries through thermal characterization","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY 4.0","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3390/batteries6020031","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-079692","identifier":[{"id":"85085753409","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-660ef4e5-430c-4afb-8add-5b2b00d07f67"],"keyword":["Cooling of lithium-ion batteries","Lithium-ion batteries","Simulation of cold plates"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-3157E1A2E080EEEEACF3DF9CA03151C9"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY 4.0","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/343251331/batteries_06_00031_v2.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY 4.0","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3390/batteries6020031","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2020","yearSub":"2020"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy, Thermofluids"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Seyed Saeed","key":"madanipau","last":"Madani","locid":"2b964c98-f205-4a96-8e1c-e2433090f82a","name":"Madani, Seyed Saeed","orcid":"0000-0003-1636-3554","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Erik","key":"schaltzpau","last":"Schaltz","locid":"6e39b31c-c3fa-470a-b47b-e69ee21195c1","name":"Schaltz, Erik","orcid":"0000-0002-8540-0040","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Søren Knudsen","key":"kærpau","last":"Kær","locid":"898d6584-ec2e-430a-b78d-e3e0d670dcdd","name":"Kær, Søren Knudsen","orcid":"0000-0003-2151-8055","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.3390/batteries6020031","issn":["23130105"],"issue":"2","journal":"Batteries","paperid":"31","publisher":"Multidisciplinary Digital Publishing Institute","status":"p","title":"Batteries","volume":"6"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85085753409"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-660ef4e5-430c-4afb-8add-5b2b00d07f67"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Design and Simulation of Internal Flowing Twisted Conduits for Cooling of Lithium-Ion Batteries through Thermal Characterization","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-079692","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
{"abstract":"De globale klimaudfordringer kræver, at vi alle tager et fælles ansvar, og at kommuner, uddannelsesinstitutioner, erhverv og borgere arbejder sammen på tværs for at opfylde de ambitiøse klimamål. I de kommende år vil der være fokus på en grøn omstilling af vores samfund, og her spiller især kommunerne og energi- og forsyningssektoren en afgørende rolle. I Aalborg Kommune har vi siden begyndelsen af 1990’-erne arbejdet med at nedbringe udledningen af drivhusgasser fra energiforsyningen og transport. Vi har gennem de seneste 10 år arbejdet målrettet med langsigtet og strategisk energi- og varmeplanlægning for at opnå Aalborg Kommunes overordnede mål om at være fossilfri senest i 2050. Vi har løbende arbejdet på at fremme den grønne omstilling, hvilket blev understreget af Aalborg Kommunes køb af Nordjyllandsværket og deraf følgende fokus på at få udfaset brugen af kul. De nye politiske målsætninger, den teknologiske udvikling på energiområdet og købet af Nordjyllandsværket har medført behov for at opdatere Aalborg Kommunes visioner og strategier på energiområdet. Formålet er at få et helhedsorienteret grundlag for de langsigtede beslutninger, der skal træffes i Aalborg Kommune, blandt andet for at opfylde lokale, nationale og internationale klima- og energimålsætninger. Derfor har Aalborg Kommune nu - sammen med Aalborg Universitet – udarbejdet Energivision for Aalborg Kommune 2050 - Smart Energy Aalborg. Energivisionen omfatter det samlede energiforbrug og tager udgangspunkt i, at vi vil være uafhængige af fossile brændsler og basere os på lokale vedvarende energikilder. Energivision 2050 viser, at et samlet energisystem med 100 pct. vedvarende energi senest i 2050 er muligt. Det kræver dog, at vi får skabt et sammenhængende integreret energisystem, hvor de forskellige teknologier arbejder sammen på tværs af forsyningsarter.","author_count":10,"contributors":["Lund, Henrik","Thellufsen, Jakob Zinck","Østergaard, Poul Alberg","Nielsen, Steffen","Sperling, Karl","Djørup, Søren Roth","Sorknæs, Peter","Remmen, Arne","Kær, Søren Knudsen","Rosendahl, Lasse"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-111141"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"smart energy aalborg energivision for aalborg kommune 000000002050","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/381632383/Smart_Energy_Aalborg_final_1_.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-111141","ids":["aau-d26d24f0-14f6-44f0-9648-6d55f6129f3f"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-6590F06D762D2CC30BA6545D0C55D70E"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/381632383/Smart_Energy_Aalborg_final_1_.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Sustainability and Planning","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Sustainability and Planning, Sustainable Energy Planning Research Group"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Henrik","key":"lundpau","last":"Lund","locid":"93c1a4dd-f941-401a-822b-45161941a507","name":"Lund, Henrik","orcid":"0000-0002-4930-7885","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jakob Zinck","key":"th