{"abstract":"Artiklen undersøger, hvordan computationel tankegang kan stilladseres gennem brug af skitser og papirprototyper, når studerende uden forhåndskendskab til programmering skal designe og konstruere et digitalt artefakt. I undersøgelsen ses en klar sammenhæng mellem nybegyndernes skitse- og prototypearbejde under designprocessen og deres grad af mestring i den efterfølgende digitale konstruktion af artefaktet.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Knudsen, Søren Bøgh","Christensen, Eva Petropouleas"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-679677"],"filters":{"added":"2023-07","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-UC"],"level3":{"UC":["DI-UC-AB","DI-UC-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-UC-AB"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"det papir værd det er skrevet på om at designe og tænke computationelt gennem skitser og papirprototyper","src":["pha"],"src-code":["DI-UC-AB"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-679677","ids":["pha-0dc72230-a6ef-4553-9970-073bb749b916"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-07612158E1C967D59F4C186C26CEB90E"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"university college absalon","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-AB","l3nl":"University College Absalon","l3nn":"University College Absalon","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"University College Absalon","namevar":["Professionshøjskolen Absalon, Direktionen - Slagelse, Pædagogik og Ledelsesområdet, Center for Skole og Læring - Vordingborg"],"nora_code":"DI-UC-AB","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren Bøgh","key":"knudsenpau","last":"Knudsen","locid":"9db853d4-3f32-4055-9ca5-065fa96c5ed1","name":"Knudsen, Søren Bøgh","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Eva Petropouleas","key":"christensenpau","last":"Christensen","locid":"a9a0a47e-05a8-442a-94b4-75bcf30b075e","name":"Christensen, Eva Petropouleas","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["01065386"],"journal":"Unge Paedagoger","pages":"58","publisher":"Unge Pædagoger","status":"p","title":"Unge Paedagoger","volume":"1"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All University Colleges","DI-ALL","DI-UC","DI-UC-ALL","University College Absalon","University Colleges"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["pha-0dc72230-a6ef-4553-9970-073bb749b916"],"src":["AB University College Absalon"],"title":"Det papir værd det er skrevet på : - om at designe og tænke computationelt gennem skitser og papirprototyper","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-679677","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
{"abstract":"Aging is emerging as a druggable target with growing interest from academia, industry and investors. New technologies such as artificial intelligence and advanced screening techniques, as well as a strong influence from the industry sector may lead to novel discoveries to treat age-related diseases. The present review summarizes presentations from the 7th Annual Aging Research and Drug Discovery (ARDD) meeting, held online on the 1st to 4th of September 2020. The meeting covered topics related to new methodologies to study aging, knowledge about basic mechanisms of longevity, latest interventional strategies to target the aging process as well as discussions about the impact of aging research on society and economy. More than 2000 participants and 65 speakers joined the meeting and we already look forward to an even larger meeting next year. Please mark your calendars for the 8th ARDD meeting that is scheduled for the 31st of August to 3rd of September, 2021, at Columbia University, USA.","author_count":70,"contributors":["Mkrtchyan, Garik V.","Abdelmohsen, Kotb","Andreux, Pénélope","Bagdonaite, Ieva","Barzilai, Nir","Brunak, Søren","Cabreiro, Filipe","Cabo, Rafael de","Campisi, Judith","Cuervo, Ana Maria","Demaria, Marсo","Ewald, Collin Y.","Fang, Evandro Fei","Faragher, Richard","Ferrucci, Luigi","Freund, Adam","Silva-García, Carlos G.","Georgievskaya, Anastasia","Gladyshev, Vadim N.","Glass, David J.","Gorbunova, Vera","Grey, Aubrey de","He, Wei Wu","Hoeijmakers, Jan","Hoffmann, Eva R.","Horvath, Steve","Houtkooper, Riekelt H.","Jensen, Majken K.","Jensen, Martin Borch","Kane, Alice","Kassem, Moustapha","Keizer, Peter de","Kennedy, Brian","Karsenty, Gerard","Lamming, Dudley W.","Lee, Kai Fu","MacAulay, Nanna","Mamoshina, Polina","Mellon, Jim","Molenaars, Marte","Moskalev, Alexey","Mund, Andreas","Niedernhofer, Laura","Osborne, Brenna","Pak, Heidi H.","Parkhitko, Andrey","Raimundo, Nuno","Rando, Thomas A.","Rasmussen, Lene Juel","Reis, Carolina","Riedel, Christian G.","Franco-Romero, Anais","Schumacher, Björn","Sinclair, David A.","Suh, Yousin","Taub, Pam R.","Toiber, Debra","Treebak, Jonas T.","Valenzano, Dario Riccardo","Verdin, Eric","Vijg, Jan","Young, Sergey","Zhang, Lei","Bakula, Daniela","Zhavoronkov, Alex","Scheibye-Knudsen, Morten"],"cuid":["S02-093.92-039900"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"51-200 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["America, North","Asia, East","Asia, Middle East","Asia, South","Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD","Oceania"],"corresponding_author":["Scheibye-Knudsen, Morten"],"country":["Australia","China","Estonia","Germany","Hong Kong","Israel","Italy","Netherlands","Norway","Russia","Singapore","Sweden","Switzerland","Taiwan","United Kingdom","United States"],"glorg":["Akershus University Hospital","All Global Affiliations","Alphabet Inc.","Assuta-Ashdod University Hospital","Ben-Gurion University of the Negev","Buck Institute for Age Research","Buck Institute for Research on Aging","Columbia University","Department of Veterans Affairs","Dept of Hematology, Amsterdam UMC, University of Amsterdam, Amsterdam, NLD","ETH Zürich","Erasmus University Rotterdam","Harvard Medical School","Harvard T.H. Chan School of Public Health","Harvard University","Haut. AI","Hong Kong Science and Technology Park","Human Longevity, Inc.","Imperial College Healthcare NHS Trust","Insilico Medicine","Juvenescence Limited","Karolinska Institute and SciLifeLab","Karolinska Institutet","Longevity Vision Fund","Max Planck Institute for Biology of Ageing","National Health Research Institutes Taiwan","National Institute on Aging","National Institutes of Health","National University of Singapore","OneSkin Inc.","RAS - Komi Science Centre, Ural Branch","Regeneron Pharmaceuticals","Regeneron Pharmaceuticals, Inc.","Russian Academy of Sciences","SENS Research Foundation","San Diego Healthcare Center","San Francisco","Sinovation Ventures and Si