{"abstract":"I dette notat gengiver vi hovedresultater fra en spørgeskemaundersøgelse gennemført i foråret 2019 blandt 8. og 9. klasses folkeskoleelever i Aalborg Kommune omkring deres opfattelse/oplevelse af de national test. Spørgeskemaundersøgelsen indeholder svar fra i alt 888 folkeskoleelever på 19 strategisk udvalgte folkeskoler i Aalborg Kommune. Resultaterne viser blandt andet at meget store andele af folkeskoleeleverne har en overvejende negativ opfattelse af de nationale test og oplever at være kede af det efter at have modtaget testresultater. I tiden op til en national test er der også betydelige andele, som oplever at være nervøse. I en uddybende analyse finder vi at en mere negativ opfattelse af de nationale test hænger sammen med henholdsvist et lavere selvvurderet fagligt niveau, en større grad af mistrivsel og køn (piger i forhold til drenge).","author_count":3,"contributors":["Eriksen, Tobias Bøgeskov","Lindholst, Andrej Christian","Knudsen, Søren Valgreen"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-079339"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corresponding_author":["Lindholst, Andrej Christian"],"keyword":["Aalborg Kommune","Børn","De nationale test","Elever","Faglighed","Folkeskolen","Køn","Mistrivsel","Spørgeskema"],"level":"sci","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Aalborg Municipality"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"resultater fra en spørgeskemaundersøgelse om folkeskoleelevers opfattelse oplevelse af de nationale test","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dw","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.5278/nbmh-w514","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-079339","ids":["aau-64df376e-699e-4e4f-8db1-bb25b46a0f59"],"keyword":["De nationale test","aalborg Kommune","børn","elever","faglighed","folkeskolen","køn","mistrivsel","spørgeskema"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-B622E94EE682AEC52E74A53911B75539"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/333053578/Arbejdsnotat.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.5278/nbmh-w514","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Aalborg Municipality"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Politics and Society","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Politics and Society, COMA (DPS)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Tobias Bøgeskov","key":"eriksenpau","last":"Eriksen","name":"Eriksen, Tobias Bøgeskov","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Andrej Christian","key":"lindholstpau","last":"Lindholst","locid":"c5126b02-afdf-4131-91e2-90c30307d87b","name":"Lindholst, Andrej Christian","orcid":"0000-0001-8301-6187","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Søren Valgreen","key":"knudsenpau","last":"Knudsen","locid":"d59094b5-44a6-4398-9acf-f3f530e0504b","name":"Knudsen, Søren Valgreen","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.5278/nbmh-w514","pages":"19","place":"Institut for Politik og Samfund","publisher":"Aalborg Universitet","status":"p"},"review":"No Review","sdg":["4. Quality Education","All UN SDG Classification"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Miscellaneous","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Miscellaneous","Other Research","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-64df376e-699e-4e4f-8db1-bb25b46a0f59"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Resultater fra en spørgeskemaundersøgelse om folkeskoleelevers opfattelse/oplevelse af de nationale test","type":"Working Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-079339","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
{"abstract":"This work focuses towards online control strategy for detecting fuel and oxidant starvation and predicting an optimal stoichiometry for operation under different fuel compositions using the electrochemical impedance spectroscopy (EIS) parameter extraction method. The tests involve three fuel compositions, namely dry hydrogen, dry reformate (,, and) and wet reformate (,, and). The characterization of anode and cathode stoichiometry (both low and high) is carried out with each fuel composition by measuring electrochemical impedance spectroscopy (EIS) and current–voltage (IV) curves. The results suggest positive effects of humidified gas on the fuel cell stack performance. The changes in the mass transport resistance due to excess gas or gas starvation both on the anode and cathode could only be deduced using the EIS method. Online EIS measurement seems useful in deducing the optimal stoichiometry as the IV curves are unable to show the changes in the mass transport. Thus, to operate the fuel cell stack under an optimal fuel and oxidant utilization, an online EIS with parameter extraction algorithm can be helpful. This would ensure a better fuel and oxidant utilization and improve the system efficiency.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Thomas, Sobi","Araya, Samuel Simon","Sahlin, Simon Lennart","Kær, Søren Knudsen"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-084627"],"event":{"end":"2019-05-23","place":"Salerno, it","start":"2019-05-21","title":"13th International Conference of the IMACS TC1 Committee, ELECTRIMACS 2019","year":"2019"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corresponding_author":["Thomas, Sobi"],"keyword":["Control","EIS","Fuel cell","HT PEMFC"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"electrochemical impedance parameter extraction for online control of reformed methanol high temperature pem fuel cells","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.scopus.com/inward/record.url?scp=85084817570&partnerID=8YFLogxK","version":"Other Version"},"funding_acknowledgement":["The authors would like to thank EUDP for funding the work through the ADDPower project. The authors would also like to acknowledge Serenergy A/S for supplying the stack for the experimental work."],"id":"S01-000.00-084627","identifier":[{"id":"85084817570","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-77179596-6fcf-4d01-86f6-8a01d350e223"],"keyword":["Control","EIS","Fuel cell","HT-PEMFC","Online diagnostics"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-A0E39D13AE681CAB019AD28D0E81625F"],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2020","yearSub":"2020"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy, Thermal Energy Systems"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Sobi","key":"thomaspau","last":"Thomas","locid":"33bb2f77-e034-426b-ac72-d921d4354655","name":"Thomas, Sobi","orcid":"0000-0002-2759-3753","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Samuel Simon","key":"arayapau","last":"Araya","locid":"31cc4ce7-c9ae-4406-95d1-b95d4269205f","name":"Araya, Samuel Simon","orcid":"0000-0001-9294-0793","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Simon Lennart","key":"sahlinpau","last":"Sahlin","locid":"10be1b68-a59d-4397-ae45-e356bf4c5844","name":"Sahlin, Simon Lennart","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Søren Knudsen","key":"kærpau","last":"Kær","locid":"898d6584-ec2e-430a-b78d-e3e0d670dcdd","name":"Kær, Søren Knudsen","orcid":"0000-0003-2151-8055","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Walter","key":"zambonipedh","last":"Zamboni","name":"Zamboni, Walter","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Giovanni","key":"petronepedh","last":"Petrone","name":"Petrone, Giovanni","rank":6,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1007/978-3-030-37161-6_30","eisbn":["9783030371616"],"isbn":["9783030371609"],"issn":["18761100"],"pages":"395-403","publisher":"Springer","series":"Lecture Notes in Electrical Engineering","status":"p","subtitle":"Selected Papers","title":"ELECTRIMACS 2019","volume":"1"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85084817570"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-77179596-6fcf-4d01-86f6-8a01d350e223"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Electrochemical Impedance Parameter Extraction for Online Control of Reformed Methanol High Temperature PEM Fuel Cells","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-084627","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
{"abstract":"The Action in Diabetes and Vascular Disease: Preterax and Diamicron Modified Release Controlled Evaluation (ADVANCE) factorial trial was a landmark randomized controlled clinical trial in 11 140 type 2 diabetic patients from 215 centers in 20 countries with a two-by-two factorial design. In the blood pressure-lowering arm, patients were treated using a fixed combination of the ACE-inhibitor, perindopril, and the thiazide-like diuretic, indapamide, or placebo, whereas in the glucose-lowering arm, the intervention compared the sulphonylurea gliclazide plus other glucose-lowering drugs, targeting a glycated hemoglobin value of 6.5% or less, with standard glucose control. Primary end-points were major macro- and microvascular events in both arms. This review gives an overview of the results of the primary randomized trial, results from observational follow-up studies, and results of several biomarker studies and discusses the perspectives of these data in the context of recent major outcome trials for current medical treatment.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Knudsen, Søren Tang","Cooper, Mark E."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-129712"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["OECD","Oceania"],"corresponding_author":["Knudsen, Søren Tang"],"country":["Australia"],"glorg":["Alfred Hospital","All Global Affiliations","Monash University"],"keyword":["Antidiabetic drug","Cardiovascular disease","Clinical trial","Diabetic nephropathy","Glycaemic control","Macrovascular disease"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"renal protection what have we learnt from advance about kidney disease in type 000000000002 diabetes","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"djr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85083042552","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-129712","identifier":[{"id":"31729127","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85083042552","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-00c851e6-7edf-4a80-ab08-bd7d0d34b9d3"],"keyword":["antidiabetic drug","cardiovascular disease","clinical trial","diabetic nephropathy","glycaemic control","macrovascular disease"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-C0DD7AE05A1FBA2846087BFF05580AAF"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2020","yearSub":"2020"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine - SDCA-Steno Diabetes Center Aarhus"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"au","key":"monash university","loc":["Australia","Oceania","OECD"],"name":"Monash University","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"au","key":"alfred hospital","loc":["Australia","Oceania","OECD"],"name":"Alfred Hospital","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Søren T.","key":"knudsenpau","last":"Knudsen","locid":"f4fb113c-f8d2-4bb3-9a9d-0bc2ef14590d","name":"Knudsen, Søren Tang","name_org":"Knudsen, Søren T.","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2 3","corresponding":null,"first":"Mark E.","key":"cooperpau","last":"Cooper","name":"Cooper, Mark E.","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["31729127"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1111/dom.13917","issn":["14628902","14631326"],"issn_org":["14628902"],"issue":"S2","journal":"Diabetes, Obesity and Metabolism","pages":"12-18","publisher":"John Wiley & Sons Inc.","status":"p","title":"Diabetes, Obesity and Metabolism","volume":"22"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85083042552"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-00c851e6-7edf-4a80-ab08-bd7d0d34b9d3"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Renal protection : What have we learnt from ADVANCE about kidney disease in type 2 diabetes?","type":"Journal Review","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-129712","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
