outhern Denmark"],"title":"From randomised controlled trials to compatible, adaptable and scalable school development research - an innovative research design for school based physical activity","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-637418","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
{"abstract":"Monolithic catalysts have received increasing attention for application in the small-scale steam methane reforming process. The radial heat transfer behaviors of monolith reformers were analyzed by two-dimensional computational fluid dynamic (CFD) modeling. A parameter study was conducted by a large number of simulations focusing on the thermal conductivity of the monolith substrate, washcoat layer, wall gap, radiation heat transfer and the geometric parameters (cell density, porosity and diameter of monolith). The effective radial thermal conductivity of the monolith structure, kr,eff, showed good agreement with predictions made by the pseudo-continuous symmetric model. This influence of the radiation heat transfer is low for highly conductive monoliths. A simplified model has been developed to evaluate the importance of radiation for monolithic reformers under different conditions. A wall gap as thin as 0.05 mm significantly decreased kr,eff, while the radiation heat transfer showed limited improvement. A pseudo-homogenous two-dimensional model combined with the symmetric model has been developed for a quick evaluation of geometric parameters for a monolith reformers. Monolithic reformers based on highly conductive substrates e.g., Ni and SiC showed great potential for small-scale hydrogen production.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Cui, Xiaoti","Kær, Søren Knudsen"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-050342"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Computational ﬂuid dynamics","Monolith","Radiation","Steam methane reforming","Thermal analysis"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"two dimensional thermal analysis of radial heat transfer of monoliths in small scale steam methane reforming","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND 4.0","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/448878359/Two_dimensional_thermal_analysis_of_radial_heat_transfer_of_monoliths_in_small_scale_steam_methane_reforming.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-050342","identifier":[{"id":"85047101895","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-010bde38-f375-40cc-a20b-04b60fa84c6b"],"keyword":["Computational ﬂuid dynamics","Endothermic reaction","Monolith","Radiation","Steam methane reforming","Thermal analysis"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-76F70314C6B088CC9E40B9CA5C1ED97B"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND 4.0","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/448878359/Two_dimensional_thermal_analysis_of_radial_heat_transfer_of_monoliths_in_small_scale_steam_methane_reforming.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2018","yearSub":"2018"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy, Fluid Mechanics and Combustion","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy, Hydrogen and Electro-fuels"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Xiaoti","key":"cuipau","last":"Cui","locid":"569f8898-f768-496f-8fc3-c93d917ef238","name":"Cui, Xiaoti","orcid":"0000-0001-6514-0280","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren Knudsen","key":"kærpau","last":"Kær","locid":"898d6584-ec2e-430a-b78d-e3e0d670dcdd","name":"Kær, Søren Knudsen","orcid":"0000-0003-2151-8055","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.ijhydene.2018.04.142","issn":["03603199","18793487"],"issn_org":["03603199"],"issue":"27","journal":"International Journal of Hydrogen Energy","pages":"11952-11968","publisher":"Elsevier","status":"p","title":"International Journal of Hydrogen Energy","volume":"43"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85047101895"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-010bde38-f375-40cc-a20b-04b60fa84c6b"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Two-dimensional thermal analysis of radial heat transfer of monoliths in small-scale steam methane reforming","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-050342","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
{"abstract":"The main objective of the paper is to develop a thermal model for anticipating the heat loss behaviour of lithium titanate oxid batteries. Heat loss from experimental measurements was compared to heat loss which was determined from the modelling. The heat loss was quantified through reversible and irreversible heat sources in a 13 Ah pouch type commercial lithium titanate oxid battery. Experimental heat loss was measured by using isothermal battery calorimeter. The heat generation of the lithium-ion battery during functioning was estimated by the aggregate of two fundamental sources, which are the irreversible and reversible heat. The reversible heat generation rate was determined from the entropy variation. The irreversible heat is a complicated parameters to be determined and is characterized in dissimilar procedures in various heat analysing models. In this paper the irreversible heat was determined through internal resistance and current rate.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Madani, Seyed Saeed","Schaltz, Erik","Kær, Søren Knudsen"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-081293"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"thermal modelling of a lithium titanate oxide battery","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-081293","identifier":[{"id":"85061024925","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-6b7ae30c-fb84-411a-8b16-804a8bea4fee"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-4B6EF7BB38933E4767AEBE8D4F08B900"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2018","yearSub":"2018"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy, Fluid Mechanics and Combustion"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Seyed Saeed","key":"madanipau","last":"Madani","locid":"2b964c98-f205-4a96-8e1c-e2433090f82a","name":"Madani, Seyed Saeed","orcid":"0000-0003-1636-3554","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Erik","key":"schaltzpau","last":"Schaltz","locid":"6e39b31c-c3fa-470a-b47b-e69ee21195c1","name":"Schaltz, Erik","orcid":"0000-0002-8540-0040","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren Knudsen","key":"kærpau","last":"Kær","locid":"898d6584-ec2e-430a-b78d-e3e0d670dcdd","name":"Kær, Søren Knudsen","orcid":"0000-0003-2151-8055","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1149/08701.0315ecst","issn":["19385862"],"issn_org":["19386737"],"issue":"1","journal":"ECS Transactions","pages":"315-326","publisher":"Institute of Physics","status":"p","title":"ECS Transactions","volume":"87"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85061024925"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-6b7ae30c-fb84-411a-8b16-804a8bea4fee"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Thermal Modelling of a Lithium Titanate Oxide Battery","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-081293","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
{"abstract":"The degradation of the electrochemical reaction of the proton exchange membrane water electrolysis (PEMWE) can be characterized using in-situ current mapping measurements (CMM). CMM is significantly affected by the amount of clamping pressure and method. In this work the current is mapped downstream at the cathode side of 50 cm2 active area single PEMWE cell at different clamping pressure and different clamping methods. Two clamping methods are used; bolting the cell with 8 bolts around the active area and clamping the cell from the whole area of the end plate using highly pressurized clamping set-up. CMM is carried out using S++ setup, where the segmented plate is placed between the current distributor and flow field plate downstream at the cathode side of the PEMWE cell. The segmented plate consists of 100 segments over the 50 cm2, thus each segment area is 0.5 cm2. Initial results show that, the clamping pressure effect on the CMM is not symmetrical in both clamping method and it directly affects the CMM homogeneity. Also it is concluded that higher PEMWE cell performance not necessary means more homogeneous CMM over the cell area.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Al Shakhshir, Saher","Zhou, Fan","Kær, Søren Knudsen"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-088202"],"event":{"end":"2018-05-17","place":"Seattle, us","start":"2018-05-13","title":"233rd ECS Meeting","year":"2018"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"on the effect of clamping pressure and methods on the current distribution of a proton exchange membrane water electrolyzer","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dco","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/293650627/Saher_Al_Shakhshir_ECS_233.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-088202","ids":["aau-8317a181-2218-415f-aa56-6635783d961a"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-16BC1026C8B7BF4A04F051F3E14854C8"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/293650627/Saher_Al_Shakhshir_ECS_233.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy, Fluid Mechanics and Combustion"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Saher","key":"alshakhshirpau","last":"Al Shakhshir","locid":"0e7cf7ea-3c90-45b7-acae-48cae2af40e6","name":"Al Shakhshir, Saher","orcid":"0000-0002-5947-8522","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Fan","key":"zhoupau","last":"Zhou","locid":"874642c9-fe83-4b87-9b5e-9b8088c39e6a","name":"Zhou, Fan","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren Knudsen","key":"kærpau","last":"Kær","locid":"898d6584-ec2e-430a-b78d-e3e0d670dcdd","name":"Kær, Søren Knudsen","orcid":"0000-0003-2151-8055","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-8317a181-2218-415f-aa56-6635783d961a"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"On the Effect of Clamping Pressure and Methods on the Current Distribution of a Proton Exchange Membrane Water Electrolyzer","type":"Conference Poster","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-088202","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
{"abstract":"Thermodynamic analyses of cracking, partial oxidation (POX), steam reforming (SR) and oxidative steam reforming (OSR) of butane and propane (for comparison) were performed using the Gibbs free energy minimization method under the reaction conditions of T = 250–1000 °C, steam-to-carbon ratio (S/C) of 0.5–5 and O2/HC (hydrocarbon) ratio of 0–2.4. The simulations for the cracking and POX processes showed that olefins and acetylene can be easily generated through the cracking reactions and can be removed by adding an appropriate amount of oxygen. For SR and OSR of propane and butane, predicted carbon formation only occurred at low S/C ratios (<2) with the maximum level of carbon formation at 550–650 °C. For the thermal-neutral conditions, the TN temperatures decrease with the increase of the S/C ratio (except for O/C = 0.6) and the decrease of the O/C ratio. The simulated results for SR or OSR of propane and butane are very close under the investigated conditions.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Cui, Xiaoti","Kær, Søren Knudsen"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-100692"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Butane","Carbon formation","Liquefied petroleum gas","Steam reforming","Thermodynamic analysis"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"thermodynamic analysis of steam reforming and oxidative steam reforming of propane and butane for hydrogen production","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND 4.0","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/303218143/2018_Xiaoti_Cui_accepted_manuscript.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-100692","identifier":[{"id":"85048591839","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-ae80dfd5-6719-447c-b98b-d96520c7f637"],"keyword":["Butane","Carbon formation","Liquefied petroleum gas","Steam reforming","Thermodynamic analysis"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-69968655C57F39D650802BDB07406798"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND 4.0","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/303218143/2018_Xiaoti_Cui_accepted_manuscript.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2018","yearSub":"2018"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy, Fluid Mechanics and Combustion","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy, Hydrogen and Electro-fuels"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Xiaoti","key":"cuipau","last":"Cui","locid":"569f8898-f768-496f-8fc3-c93d917ef238","name":"Cui, Xiaoti","orcid":"0000-0001-6514-0280","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren Knudsen","key":"kærpau","last":"Kær","locid":"898d6584-ec2e-430a-b78d-e3e0d670dcdd","name":"Kær, Søren Knudsen","orcid":"0000-0003-2151-8055","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.ijhydene.2018.05.083","issn":["03603199","18793487"],"issn_org":["03603199"],"issue":"29","journal":"International Journal of Hydrogen Energy","pages":"13009-13021","publisher":"Elsevier","status":"p","title":"International Journal of Hydrogen Energy","volume":"43"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85048591839"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-ae80dfd5-6719-447c-b98b-d96520c7f637"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Thermodynamic analysis of steam reforming and oxidative steam reforming of propane and butane for hydrogen production","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-100692","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
{"abstract":"The temperature distribution of lithium-ion batteries in the electric vehicle is very important for the electric vehicle performance. Heat is produced during lithium-ion batteries operation while being charged and discharged. The battery can in worst case go into thermal runaway if the heat cannot be dissipated rapidly. This experimental investigation analysis the thermal behaviour of a 13Ah pouch type lithium-ion battery through characterisation and determination of the evolution of surface temperature distribution and profiles when there is a bad connection in the positive tab. Infrared thermography and contact thermocouples were employed for a commercial cell thermal analysis. Different types of load profiles were applied to the battery cell. The loads consisted of constant current charge and discharge cycles with currents magnitude of 13A, 26A, 39A and 52A.It was concluded that bad connection increased the non-uniformity of surface temperature and risk of thermal runaway in lithium-ion batteries.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Madani, Seyed Saeed","Schaltz, Erik","Kær, Søren Knudsen"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-115685"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"effect of bad connection on surface temperature of lithium ion batteries by using infrared thermography","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-115685","identifier":[{"id":"85061045372","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-e1b0922f-eec9-476b-a2d7-1fab0944ccbe"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-9415990EEA881F731C94E8F9BD2E9DD6"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2018","yearSub":"2018"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy, Fluid Mechanics and Combustion"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Seyed Saeed","key":"madanipau","last":"Madani","locid":"2b964c98-f205-4a96-8e1c-e2433090f82a","name":"Madani, Seyed Saeed","orcid":"0000-0003-1636-3554","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Erik","key":"schaltzpau","last":"Schaltz","locid":"6e39b31c-c3fa-470a-b47b-e69ee21195c1","name":"Schaltz, Erik","orcid":"0000-0002-8540-0040","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren Knudsen","key":"kærpau","last":"Kær","locid":"898d6584-ec2e-430a-b78d-e3e0d670dcdd","name":"Kær, Søren Knudsen","orcid":"0000-0003-2151-8055","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1149/08701.0039ecst","issn":["19385862"],"issn_org":["19386737"],"issue":"1","journal":"ECS Transactions","pages":"39-50","publisher":"Institute of Physics","status":"p","title":"ECS Transactions","volume":"87"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85061045372"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-e1b0922f-eec9-476b-a2d7-1fab0944ccbe"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Effect of Bad Connection on Surface Temperature of Lithium-Ion Batteries by Using Infrared Thermography","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-115685","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
{"author_count":4,"contributors":["Blom, Jens Yde","Thomsen, Philip Kjettinge","Knudsen, Søren From","Schønheyder, Henrik Carl"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-117450"],"event":{"end":"2018-04-24","place":"Madrid, es","start":"2018-04-21","title":"28th European Congress of Clinical Microbiology and Infectious Diseases","year":"2018"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-NDR"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-NDR","DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"increasing the utility of nation wide nosocomial infection data an informatics solution for end users in hospitals","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-117450","ids":["aau-e7d32622-b6c8-47cd-9f40-f94e5d2b6429"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-07F611FEC0E31866EE55D2F0694ED304"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital, Department of Clinical Microbiology","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital, Klinik Diagnostik"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"north denmark region","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-NDR","l3nl":"North Denmark Region","l3nn":"North Denmark Region","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"North Denmark Region","namevar":["Region Nordjylland"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-NDR","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jens Yde","key":"blompau","last":"Blom","locid":"635bde53-fe8c-4f19-bde4-caabdb774c72","name":"Blom, Jens Yde","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Philip Kjettinge","key":"thomsenpau","last":"Thomsen","locid":"b603f965-1b1e-481c-a627-959d693e4c17","name":"Thomsen, Philip Kjettinge","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren From","key":"knudsenpau","last":"Knudsen","name":"Knudsen, Søren From","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Henrik Carl","key":"schønheyderpau","last":"Schønheyder","locid":"d35b264a-6efc-467d-ac9d-e558542ef8a8","name":"Schønheyder, Henrik Carl","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","North Denmark Region","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-e7d32622-b6c8-47cd-9f40-f94e5d2b6429"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Increasing the utility of nation-wide nosocomial infection data : an informatics solution for end-users in hospitals","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-117450","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
{"abstract":"Malaria is among the major threats to global health with the main burden of disease being in rural areas of developing countries where accurate diagnosis based on non-invasive samples is in high demand. We here present a novel molecular assay for detection of malaria parasites based on technology that may be adapted for low-resource settings. Moreover, we demonstrate the exploitation of this assay for detection of malaria in saliva. The setup relies on pump-free microfluidics enabled extraction combined with a DNA sensor substrate that is converted to a single-stranded DNA circle specifically by topoisomerase I expressed by the malaria causing Plasmodium parasite. Subsequent rolling circle amplification of the generated DNA circle in the presence of biotin conjugated deoxynucleotides resulted in long tandem repeat products that was visualized colorimetrically upon binding of horse radish peroxidase (HRP) and addition of 3,3',5,5'-Tetramethylbenzidine that was converted to a blue colored product by HRP. The assay was directly quantitative, specific for Plasmodium parasites, and allowed detection of Plasmodium infection in a single drop of saliva from 35 out of 35 infected individuals tested. The results could be determined directly by the naked eye and documented by quantifying the color intensity using a standard paper scanner.","author_count":18,"contributors":["Hede, Marianne Smedegaard","Fjelstrup, Søren","Lötsch, Felix","Zoleko, Rella Manego","Klicpera, Anna","Groger, Mirjam","Mischlinger, Johannes","Endame, Lilian","Veletzky, Luzia","Neher, Ronja","Simonsen, Anne Katrine Wrist","Petersen, Eskild","Mombo-Ngoma, Ghyslain","Stougaard, Magnus","Ho, Yi-Ping","Labouriau, Rodrigo","Ramharter, Michael","Knudsen, Birgitta R."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-153457"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Asia, East","Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Austria","Germany","Hong Kong"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Chinese University of Hong Kong","Medical University of Vienna","University of Tübingen"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Unspecified organisation"],"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-OTH"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-PR-OTH","DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"detection of the malaria causing plasmodium parasite in saliva from infected patients using topoisomerase i activity as a biomarker","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41598-018-22378-7","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-153457","identifier":[{"id":"85048288590","type":"scopus"},{"id":"29515150","type":"pmid"},{"id":"PMC5841400","type":"pmcid"}],"ids":["au-2a17249a-104b-4cc2-8cf9-8d951db0858e"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-C9112E25958A0D2A2F5CED2AB2A766C6"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.au.dk/ws/files/126410742/Detection_of_the_Malaria_causing_Plasmodium_Parasite_in_Saliva_from_Infected_Patients_using_Topoisomerase_I_Activity_as_a_Biomarker.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41598-018-22378-7","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.au.dk/ws/files/127975649/s41598_018_22378_7.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2018","yearSub":"2018"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"other companies","l2":"DI-PR","l2n":"Private Research","l3":"DI-PR-OTH","l3nl":"Other Companies","l3nn":"Other Companies","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Other Companies","namevar":["Zymonostics ApS"],"nora_code":"DI-PR-