 Faculty of Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine, Danish Center for Clinical Health Services Research"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren Valgreen","key":"knudsenpau","last":"Knudsen","locid":"d59094b5-44a6-4398-9acf-f3f530e0504b","name":"Knudsen, Søren Valgreen","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Henrik Vitus Bering","key":"laursenpau","last":"Laursen","locid":"79f3767c-c51c-4756-95f3-2e1decc71e29","name":"Laursen, Henrik Vitus Bering","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Lars Holger","key":"ehlerspau","last":"Ehlers","locid":"2ceddc99-bbe0-4721-8040-b4253e22468f","name":"Ehlers, Lars Holger","orcid":"0000-0001-6512-5566","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jan","key":"mainzpau","last":"Mainz","locid":"fadbea42-81be-48a2-afb2-c868f9dfa4f5","name":"Mainz, Jan","orcid":"0000-0003-0242-9233","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-959b0d04-49be-44a5-8b7e-aa4156a4275e"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Does Quality Improvement improve the Quality of Care? A Systematic Review of the Effect and Methodological Rigor of the Plan-Do-Study-Act (PDSA) Method","type":"Conference Poster","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-093456","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
{"abstract":"PtNi/C octahedral nanocrystal catalyst is prepared through surfactant-assisted solvothermal approach using cetyltrimethylammonium bromide as structure directing agent, and its performance on rotating disk electrode and membrane electrode assembly are investigated through experiment and simulation. Its mass activity and specific activity at 0.9 V vs. RHE are about 6.1 and 6.6 times high of commercial Pt/C, respectively. The membrane electrode assembly that is fabricated using PtNi/C octahedral catalyst in cathode exhibits enhanced power generation performance and durability. Its cell voltage at 1000 mA cm−2 is increased by 34 mV compared with the control, and its maximum power densities are raised by 160.2 mW cm−2 and 0.27 kW gPt−1. After 100 h galvanostatic durability test, the attenuation rates of its cell voltage at 1000 mA cm−2 and maximum power density are 6.9% and 14.3% (10.9% and 18.4% for the control), respectively. The simulation results also reveal that PtNi/C octahedral catalyst not only has high half cell performance, but also shows actual application potential in single cell, which demonstrates the feasibility that the excellent performance of PtNi/C octahedral catalyst at rotating disk electrode level can be realized in single cells through optimization of membrane electrode assembly fabrication and cell operation conditions.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Wang, Jue","Li, Bing","Gao, Xin","Yang, Daijun","Lv, Hong","Xiao, Qiangfeng","Kær, Søren Knudsen","Zhang, Cunman"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-104761"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Asia, East"],"corresponding_author":["Li, Bing"],"country":["China"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Tongji University"],"keyword":["CTAB","Membrane electrode assembly","Oxygen reduction reaction"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"from rotating disk electrode to single cell exploration of ptni c octahedral nanocrystal as practical proton exchange membrane fuel cell cathode catalyst","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.scopus.com/inward/record.url?scp=85055050315&partnerID=8YFLogxK","version":"Other Version"},"funding_acknowledgement":["The authors appreciate the National Natural Science Foundation (No. 21676204 ) and the Program of Ministry of Science & Technology of China (No. 2018YFB0106503 ) for financial support. Appendix A"],"id":"S01-000.00-104761","identifier":[{"id":"85055050315","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-bcbb1d4a-3227-4edd-bcf0-4c2d2ea486bc"],"keyword":["CTAB","Membrane electrode assembly","Octahedral nanocrystals","Oxygen reduction reaction","PtNi"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-DD35886EA75C1E314E68F393F2E870C4"],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2018","yearSub":"2018"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"cn","key":"tongji university","loc":["China","Asia, East"],"name":"Tongji University","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy, Thermal Energy Systems"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jue","key":"wangpau","last":"Wang","name":"Wang, Jue","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Bing","key":"lipau","last":"Li","name":"Li, Bing","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Xin","key":"gaopau","last":"Gao","locid":"0c7cc98f-3f75-4d7a-baac-8833cfc63ab5","name":"Gao, Xin","orcid":"0000-0001-6011-0859","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Daijun","key":"yangpau","last":"Yang","name":"Yang, Daijun","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Hong","key":"lvpau","last":"Lv","name":"Lv, Hong","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Qiangfeng","key":"xiaopau","last":"Xiao","name":"Xiao, Qiangfeng","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren Knudsen","key":"kærpau","last":"Kær","locid":"898d6584-ec2e-430a-b78d-e3e0d670dcdd","name":"Kær, Søren Knudsen","orcid":"0000-0003-2151-8055","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Cunman","key":"zhangpau","last":"Zhang","name":"Zhang, Cunman","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.jpowsour.2018.10.010","issn":["03787753","18732755"],"issn_org":["03787753"],"journal":"Journal of Power Sources","pages":"118-127","publisher":"Elsevier","status":"p","title":"Journal of Power Sources","volume":"406"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85055050315"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-bcbb1d4a-3227-4edd-bcf0-4c2d2ea486bc"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"From rotating disk electrode to single cell : Exploration of PtNi/C octahedral nanocrystal as practical proton exchange membrane fuel cell cathode catalyst","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-104761","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
{"abstract":"Lithium-ion batteries are regarded as the key energy storage technology for both e-mobility and stationary renewable energy storage applications. Nevertheless, Lithium-ion batteries are complex energy storage devices, which are characterized by a complex degradation behavior, which affects both their capacity and internal resistance. This paper investigates, based on extended laboratory calendar ageing tests, the degradation of the internal resistance of a lithium-ion battery. The dependence of the internal resistance increase on the temperature and state-of-charge level has been extensive studied and quantified. Based on the obtained laboratory results, an accurate semiempirical lifetime model, which is able to predict with high accuracy the internal resistance increase of the lithium-ion battery over a wide temperature range and for all state-of-charge levels, was proposed and validated.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Stroe, Daniel-Ioan","Swierczynski, Maciej Jozef","Kær, Søren Knudsen","Teodorescu, Remus"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-106287"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Calendar ageing","Degradation","Internal Resistance","Modeling","lithium ion Li ion battery"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"degradation behavior of lithium ion batteries during calendar ageing the case of the internal resistance increase","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/311054890/Degradation_Behavior_of_Lithium_Ion_Batteries_during_Calendar_Ageing_The_Case_of_the_Internal_Resistance_Increase.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-106287","identifier":[{"id":"85040974742","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-c1d2dbab-287b-4389-9f7d-6e33808df219"],"keyword":["Calendar ageing","degradation","internal resistance","lithium-ion (Li-ion) battery","modeling"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-D2DB69EBC8EDD2171DBD6F6F1DEEA5A9"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/311054890/Degradation_Behavior_of_Lithium_Ion_Batteries_during_Calendar_Ageing_The_Case_of_the_Internal_Resistance_Increase.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2018","yearSub":"2018"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy, E-Mobility and Drives","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy, Power Electronic Systems"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Daniel-Ioan","key":"stroepau","last":"Stroe","locid":"5811b49e-3576-45ee-847b-ca093b034b5d","name":"Stroe, Daniel-Ioan","orcid":"0000-0002-2938-8921","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Maciej Jozef","key":"swierczynskipau","last":"Swierczynski","locid":"767958b2-8061-4038-82d6-7a0068c26efe","name":"Swierczynski, Maciej Jozef","orcid":"0000-0003-3837-9696","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren Knudsen","key":"kærpau","last":"Kær","locid":"898d6584-ec2e-430a-b78d-e3e0d670dcdd","name":"Kær, Søren Knudsen","orcid":"0000-0003-2151-8055","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Remus","key":"teodorescupau","last":"Teodorescu","locid":"fd2ad1e5-313f-45d9-a445-53a24f644768","name":"Teodorescu, Remus","orcid":"0000-0002-2617-7168","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1109/tia.2017.2756026","issn":["00939994"],"issue":"1","journal":"IEEE Transactions on Industry Applications","pages":"517-525","paperid":"8048537","publisher":"IEEE (Institute of Electrical and Electronics Engineers)","status":"p","title":"IEEE Transactions on Industry Applications","title_org":"I E E E Transactions on Industry Applications","volume":"54"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85040974742"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-c1d2dbab-287b-4389-9f7d-6e33808df219"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Degradation Behavior of Lithium-Ion Batteries during Calendar Ageing – The Case of the Internal Resistance Increase","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-106287","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
{"abstract":"The heterogeneity of the local current distribution (LCD) of proton exchange membrane water electrolysis cell (PEMWE) has a significant effect on its degradation. More heterogeneous LCD leads to faster degradation rate and vice versa. LCD is affected by the amount of clamping pressure and methods. In this work, LCD is measured at the cathode side of 50 cm2 PEMWE cell at different clamping pressures and methods; bolting the cell with 8 bolts around the active area and compressing the overall area of the end plate using pneumatic set-up. S++® Current Scan Lin is used for LCD measurements, where the segmented plate is placed between the current distributor and flow field plate. Initial results show that, Increasing the torque in the bolted cell results in heterogeneous LCD and vice versa for the pneumatically compressed cell. Also it is concluded that, higher PEMWE cell performance does not necessary mean homogeneous LCD.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Al Shakhshir, Saher","Zhou, Fan","Kær, Søren Knudsen"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-111065"],"event":{"end":"2018-05-17","place":"Seattle, us","start":"2018-05-13","title":"233rd ECS Meeting","year":"2018"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Proton exchange membrane water electrolysis"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"on the effect of clamping pressure and methods on the current distribution of a proton exchange membrane water electrolyzer","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-111065","identifier":[{"id":"85056851018","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-d2328245-d2f6-4e0a-b4f8-0d738082f136"],"keyword":["Local Current Distribution","Proton Exchange Membrane Water Electrolysis"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-916A9BC61EFA068814DC298D0848D040"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2018","yearSub":"2018"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy, Fluid Mechanics and Combustion"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Saher","key":"alshakhshirpau","last":"Al Shakhshir","locid":"0e7cf7ea-3c90-45b7-acae-48cae2af40e6","name":"Al Shakhshir, Saher","orcid":"0000-0002-5947-8522","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Fan","key":"zhoupau","last":"Zhou","locid":"874642c9-fe83-4b87-9b5e-9b8088c39e6a","name":"Zhou, Fan","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren Knudsen","key":"kærpau","last":"Kær","locid":"898d6584-ec2e-430a-b78d-e3e0d670dcdd","name":"Kær, Søren Knudsen","orcid":"0000-0003-2151-8055","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1149/08513.0995ecst","issn":["19385862"],"issn_org":["19386737"],"issue":"13","journal":"ECS Transactions","pages":"995-1004","publisher":"Institute of Physics","status":"p","title":"ECS Transactions","volume":"85"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85056848592","2-s2.0-85056851018"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-d2328245-d2f6-4e0a-b4f8-0d738082f136"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"On the effect of Clamping Pressure and Methods on the Current Distribution of a Proton Exchange Membrane Water Electrolyzer","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-111065","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
{"abstract":"Gonadoblastoma and malignant transformations thereof can occur in females with Turner syndrome (TS) and Y chromosomal material. However, in females with TS and no Y chromosomal material, this is rarely seen. We report a female with an apparent 45,X karyotype (in blood and tumor) who was diagnosed with a metastatic embryonal carcinoma. Exome sequencing of blood and the tumor was done, and no Y chromosomal material was detected, while predicted deleterious mutations in KIT (likely driver), AKT1, and ZNF358 were identified in the tumor. The patient was treated with chemotherapy (first-line: cisplatin, etoposide, and bleomycin; second-line: paclitaxel and gemcitabine), and after that surgical debulking was performed. She is currently well and without signs of relapse. We conclude that embryonal carcinoma can apparently occur in 45,X TS without signs of Y chromosomal material.","author_count":12,"contributors":["Gravholt, Claus Højbjerg","Dollerup, Ole L","Duval, Lone","Mejlgaard, Else","Stribolt, Katrine","Vang, Søren","Laursen, Britt Elmedal","Knudsen, Michael","Thorsen, Kasper","Hersmus, Remko","Looijenga, Leendert H J","Krag, Kirstine Stochholm"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-199833"],"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Cancer","Clinical practice guidelines","Diagnosis","Dysgerminoma","Features","Female","Germ cell neoplasia in situ","Gonadoblastoma","Malignancy","Markers","UPDATE","germ cell tumors"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"a rare case of embryonal carcinoma in a patient with turner syndrome without y chromosomal material but mutations in kit akt000000000001 and znf000000000358 demonstrated using exome sequencing","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85037372676","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-199833","identifier":[{"id":"85037372676","type":"scopus"},{"id":"000424206100005","type":"wos"},{"id":"29197878","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["au-7b3c71bc-7276-498e-b462-d3e22639b770"],"keyword":["45,X","CANCER","CLINICAL-PRACTICE GUIDELINES","DIAGNOSIS","Dysgerminoma","FEATURES","FEMALE","GERM-CELL TUMORS","GONADOBLASTOMA","Germ cell neoplasia in situ","MALIGNANCY","MARKERS","UPDATE"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-3-EFE48AEF5D421ABFC81C1FC6207B0578"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2018","yearSub":"2018"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine - Department of Endocrinology and Internal Medicine","Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine - Department of Molecular Medicine (MOMA)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Claus H","key":"gravholtpau","last":"Gravholt","locid":"22ab3957-d834-426e-8ba5-3d45496b0d2a","name":"Gravholt, Claus Højbjerg","name_org":"Gravholt, Claus H","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Ole L","key":"dolleruppau","last":"Dollerup","locid":"571b3fca-42a9-44aa-853b-054665af5b80","name":"Dollerup, Ole L","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Lone","key":"duvalpau","last":"Duval","locid":"f4ea9721-dcd6-4157-b939-5a82c04b7953","name":"Duval, Lone","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Else","key":"mejlgaardpau","last":"Mejlgaard","locid":"