38","1421993X"],"issn_org":["03022838"],"issue":"4","journal":"European Urology","pages":"535-540","publisher":"Elsevier BV","publisher_org":"Elsevier B.V.","status":"p","title":"European Urology","volume":"73"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85029904678"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-213df835-7195-4a30-8c2d-27f2afa5b739"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Monitoring treatment response and metastatic relapse in advanced bladder cancer by liquid biopsy analysis","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-148379","year":"2018","yearsub":"2017"}
{"abstract":"According to the traditional view, GTPases act as molecular switches, which cycle between distinct 'on' and 'off' conformations bound to GTP and GDP, respectively. Translation elongation factor EF-Tu is a GTPase essential for prokaryotic protein synthesis. In its GTP-bound form, EF-Tu delivers aminoacylated tRNAs to the ribosome as a ternary complex. GTP hydrolysis is thought to cause the release of EF-Tu from aminoacyl-tRNA and the ribosome due to a dramatic conformational change following P i release. Here, the crystal structure of Escherichia coli EF-Tu in complex with a non-hydrolysable GTP analogue (GDPNP) has been determined. Remarkably, the overall conformation of EF-Tu·GDPNP displays the classical, open GDP-bound conformation. This is in accordance with an emerging view that the identity of the bound guanine nucleotide is not 'locking' the GTPase in a fixed conformation. Using a single-molecule approach, the conformational dynamics of various ligand-bound forms of EF-Tu were probed in solution by fluorescence resonance energy transfer. The results suggest that EF-Tu, free in solution, may sample a wider set of conformations than the structurally well-defined GTP- and GDP-forms known from previous X-ray crystallographic studies. Only upon binding, as a ternary complex, to the mRNA-programmed ribosome, is the well-known, closed GTP-bound conformation, observed.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Johansen, Jesper Sanderhoff","Kavaliauskas, Darius","Pfeil, Shawn","Blaise, Michael","Cooperman, Barry","Goldman, Yale","Thirup, Søren Skou","Knudsen, Charlotte Rohde"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-149895"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","OECD"],"country":["United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","University of California at Berkeley"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"e coli elongation factor tu bound to a gtp analogue displays an open conformation equivalent to the gdp bound form","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1093/nar/gky697","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-149895","identifier":[{"id":"PMC6144822","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"85061295299","type":"scopus"},{"id":"30107565","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["au-23d48296-7774-44b5-86ae-21ed46338a2f"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-6162B84D85383A789856621BF0EFBDC5"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.au.dk/ws/files/141810893/gky697.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1093/nar/gky697","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2018","yearSub":"2018"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Natural Sciences, Department of Molecular Biology and Genetics, Department of Molecular Biology and Genetics - Molecular Intervention"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"us","key":"university of california at berkeley","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"University of California at Berkeley","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jesper Sanderhoff","key":"johansenpau","last":"Johansen","locid":"fcf1e65e-81cc-43aa-946c-3ef1a856126e","name":"Johansen, Jesper Sanderhoff","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Darius","key":"kavaliauskaspau","last":"Kavaliauskas","locid":"e45be045-1c0e-4b04-b6df-7fa7444a6490","name":"Kavaliauskas, Darius","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Shawn","key":"pfeilpau","last":"Pfeil","name":"Pfeil, Shawn","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Michael","key":"blaisepau","last":"Blaise","locid":"0b266288-c588-4019-891e-9a54a6569ce2","name":"Blaise, Michael","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Barry","key":"coopermanpau","last":"Cooperman","name":"Cooperman, Barry","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Yale","key":"goldmanpau","last":"Goldman","name":"Goldman, Yale","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Søren Skou","key":"thiruppau","last":"Thirup","locid":"58274bd2-99ea-4148-b16d-fb4f744ca9b5","name":"Thirup, Søren Skou","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Charlotte Rohde","key":"knudsenpau","last":"Knudsen","locid":"782aeedc-6bcd-4ce7-867a-57a7cfbcf1bc","name":"Knudsen, Charlotte Rohde","orcid":"0000-0003-2356-4821","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["30107565"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1093/nar/gky697","issn":["03051048","13624962"],"issn_org":["03051048"],"issue":"16","journal":"Nucleic Acids Research","pages":"8641-8650","publisher":"Oxford University Press","status":"p","title":"Nucleic Acids Research","volume":"46"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85061295299"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-23d48296-7774-44b5-86ae-21ed46338a2f"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"E. coli elongation factor Tu bound to a GTP analogue displays an open conformation equivalent to the GDP-bound form","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-149895","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
{"abstract":"For this demo, we will show two interactive visualizations: Energy Futures and Pipeline Incidents. We designed and developed these visualizations as part of an open data initiative that aims to create interactive data visualizations to help make Canada's energy data publicly accessible, transparent, and understandable. This work was conducted in collaboration with the National Energy Board of Canada (NEB) and a visualization software development company, VizworX.","author_count":17,"contributors":["Knudsen, Søren","Vermeulen, Jo","Kosminsky, Doris","Walny, Jagoda","West, Mieka","Frisson, Christian","Adriel Aseniero, Bon","Macdonald Vermeulen, Lindsay","Perin, Charles","Quach, Lien","Buk, Peter","Tabuli, Katrina","Chopra, Shreya","Willett, Wesley","Carpendale, Sheelagh"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-241793"],"event":{"acronym":"CHI","end":"2018-04-26","place":"Montreal, ca","start":"2018-04-21","title":"ACM SIGCHI Conference on Human Factors in Computing Systems","year":"2018"},"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","America, South","OECD"],"country":["Brazil","Canada"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Universidade Federal do Rio de Janeiro","University of Calgary"],"keyword":["Citizen engagement","Data visualization","Information visualization","Open data"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"democratizing open energy data for public discourse using visualization","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85052026361","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-241793","identifier":[{"id":"85052026361","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-c50533ff-e4d1-41a8-a759-8261deec82c7"],"key