null,"country":"dk","first":"L H","key":"ehlerspau","last":"Ehlers","locid":"2ceddc99-bbe0-4721-8040-b4253e22468f","name":"Ehlers, Lars Holger","name_org":"Ehlers, L H","orcid":"0000-0001-6512-5566","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"J","key":"mainzpau","last":"Mainz","locid":"fadbea42-81be-48a2-afb2-c868f9dfa4f5","name":"Mainz, Jan","name_org":"Mainz, J","orcid":"0000-0003-0242-9233","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1093/intqhc/mzx125.72","issn":["13534505","14643677"],"issn_org":["13534505"],"issue":"suppl.1","journal":"International Journal for Quality in Health Care","pages":"45-45","paperid":"ISQUA17-3217","publisher":"Oxford University Press","status":"p","title":"International Journal for Quality in Health Care","volume":"29"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-eec028c3-b257-4549-9ef2-36ca16d9af9e"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"There is need for improvement of quality improvement - a systematic review of the PDSA method in QI studies","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-119459","year":"2017","yearsub":"2017"}
{"abstract":"In this article, we show that there exists a graph G with O(n) nodes such that any forest of n nodes is an induced subgraph of G Furthermore, for constant arboricity k, the result implies the existence of a graph with O(nk) nodes that contains all n-node graphs of arboricity k as node-induced subgraphs, matching a Ω(nk) lower bound of Alstrup and Rauhe. Our upper bounds are obtained through a log2 n + O(1) labeling scheme for adjacency queries in forests. We hereby solve an open problem being raised repeatedly over decades by authors such as Kannan et al., Chung, and Fraigniaud and Korman.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Alstrup, Stephen","Dahlgaard, Søren","Knudsen, Mathias Bæk Tejs"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-403194"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Graph theory","Induced universal graphs","Trees","XML"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"optimal induced universal graphs and adjacency labeling for trees","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"https://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/license.html","type":"rem","url":"http://arxiv.org/pdf/1504.02306","version":"Pre-print"},"id":"S01-000.00-403194","identifier":[{"id":"85028082133","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-107a8ba0-c140-4022-bc24-aa38db345f8d"],"keyword":["Adjacency labeling","Graph theory","Induced universal graphs","Trees","XML"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-B5B98A8EA69AB5F4EB68A17794091C19"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"https://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/license.html","type":"rem","url":"http://arxiv.org/pdf/1504.02306","version":"Pre-print"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2017","yearSub":"2017"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Science, Department of Computer Science, Department of Computer Science","Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Science, Department of Computer Science, The APL Section"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Stephen","key":"alstruppau","last":"Alstrup","locid":"6d1b63fb-235a-4932-8345-413b4ac8d6a5","name":"Alstrup, Stephen","orcid":"0000-0001-7896-8386","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Søren","key":"dahlgaardpau","last":"Dahlgaard","locid":"4788aa93-be24-420b-8767-e735d6dcc61d","name":"Dahlgaard, Søren","orcid":"0000-0003-2925-746X","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Mathias Bæk Tejs","key":"knudsenpau","last":"Knudsen","locid":"28c3a2af-0485-4bfb-83ba-e8a330c65b22","name":"Knudsen, Mathias Bæk Tejs","orcid":"0000-0001-5308-9609","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1145/3088513","issn":["00045411","1557735X"],"issn_org":["00045411"],"issue":"4","journal":"Journal of the ACM","paperid":"27","status":"p","title":"Journal of the ACM","volume":"64"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85028082133"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-107a8ba0-c140-4022-bc24-aa38db345f8d"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Optimal induced universal graphs and adjacency labeling for trees","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-403194","year":"2017","yearsub":"2017"}
{"abstract":"AIM: We investigated the consequences of applying different imaging guidelines for urological anomalies after first pyelonephritis in children with normal routine antenatal ultrasounds. METHODS: The cohort comprised 472 children treated for their first culture-positive pyelonephritis and investigated with ultrasound and renal scintigraphy. We excluded patients with known urological anomalies and patients born before routine antenatal ultrasound. We followed the cohort for a median of 5.7 years (3.1-10.1 years) by reviewing their medical reports. RESULTS: Urological anomalies were diagnosed in 95 patients. Dilated vesicoureteral reflux (VUR) was the predominant finding (n = 29), including nine who initially had surgery. Using imaging guidelines from the American Academy of Pediatrics would have missed 11 urological patients, including two with initial surgery, and avoided 339 scintigraphies. Using the European Association of Paediatric Urology guidance would have missed three urological patients, one with initial surgery, and avoided 46 scintigraphies. Investigating patients under two years with ultrasound and scintigraphy, and just ultrasound in children over two years, would have identified all patients initially treated with surgery and avoided 65 scintigraphies. CONCLUSION: Dilated VUR was the dominant anomaly in a cohort with first time pyelonephritis and normal antenatal ultrasound. The optimal imaging strategy after pyelonephritis must be identified.","author_count":10,"contributors":["Mola, Gylli","Wenger, Therese Ramstad","Salomonsson, Petra","Knudsen, Inge Jenny Dahl","Madsen, Jan Lysgaard","Møller, Søren","Olsen, Beth Härstedt","Vinicoff, Pablo Gustavo","Thorup, Jorgen","Cortes, Dina"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-463409"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Journal Article"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"selective imaging modalities after first pyelonephritis failed to identify significant urological anomalies despite normal antenatal ultrasounds","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-463409","identifier":[{"id":"85019890694","type":"scopus"},{"id":"28437563","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["ku-7504bb3c-f897-4f4c-83f5-91a1eabd8a48"],"keyword":["Journal Article"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-D87AA89D590A328884E1C0037FD269D6"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2017","yearSub":"2017"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Clinical Physiology and Nuclear Medicine","Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"","first":"Gylli","key":"molapau","last":"Mola","name":"Mola, Gylli","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Therese Ramstad","key":"wengerpau","last":"Wenger","name":"Wenger, Therese Ramstad","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Petra","key":"salomonssonpau","last":"Salomonsson","name":"Salomonsson, Petra","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Inge Jenny Dahl","key":"knudsenpau","last":"Knudsen","name":"Knudsen, Inge Jenny Dahl","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Jan Lysgaard","key":"madsenpau","last":"Madsen","name":"Madsen, Jan Lysgaard","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Søren","key":"møllerpau","last":"Møller","locid":"a4bee617-45cc-4a85-a58a-817fb06a5525","name":"Møller, Søren","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Beth Härstedt","key":"olsenpau","last":"Olsen","name":"Olsen, Beth Härstedt","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Pablo Gustavo","key":"vinicoffpau","last":"Vinicoff","name":"Vinicoff, Pablo Gustavo","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Jorgen","key":"thoruppau","last":"Thorup","locid":"3996b86b-6f0e-4a92-a051-b03ed8e3d689","name":"Thorup, Jorgen","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Dina","key":"cortespau","last":"Cortes","locid":"be6fea38-44d6-4d7a-b421-abffa8d19cc2","name":"Cortes, Dina","orcid":"0000-0002-6852-6530","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["28437563"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1111/apa.13894","issn":["08035253","08035326"],"issn_org":["08035253"],"issue":"7","journal":"Acta Paediatrica","pages":"1176-1183","status":"p","title":"Acta Paediatrica","title_org":"Acta paediatrica (Oslo, Norway : 1992)","volume":"106"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85019890694"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-7504bb3c-f897-4f4c-83f5-91a1eabd8a48"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Selective imaging modalities after first pyelonephritis failed to identify significant urological anomalies, despite normal antenatal ultrasounds","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-463409","year":"2017","yearsub":"2017"}
