{"author_count":4,"contributors":["Vang, Jakob Rabjerg","Zhou, Fan","Andreasen, Søren Juhl","Kær, Søren Knudsen"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-080839"],"event":{"end":"2015-07-31","place":"Glasgow, gb","start":"2015-07-26","title":"ECS Conference on Electrochemical Energy Conversion &amp; Storage with SOFC-XIV","year":"2015"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["EIS","HTPEM fuel cell","Impedance spectroscopy","Modelling"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"estimating important electrode parameters of high temperature pem fuel cells by fitting a model to polarisation curves and impedance spectra","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://ecs.confex.com/ecs/sofc2015/webprogram/Paper53825.html","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-080839","ids":["aau-69f7b710-8413-4b1c-ac9f-2c8f15f5c401"],"keyword":["EIS","HTPEM fuel cell","Impedance spectroscopy","Modelling","Polarisation curves"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-2F2C85C93CAC709D2EB000EDB405B0D5"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://ecs.confex.com/ecs/sofc2015/webprogram/Paper53825.html","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (ENG)","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy, Fluid Mechanics and Combustion"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jakob Rabjerg","key":"vangpau","last":"Vang","locid":"863c6a36-4e04-431b-a5b0-9e141fd73553","name":"Vang, Jakob Rabjerg","orcid":"0000-0002-4497-3205","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Fan","key":"zhoupau","last":"Zhou","locid":"874642c9-fe83-4b87-9b5e-9b8088c39e6a","name":"Zhou, Fan","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren Juhl","key":"andreasenpau","last":"Andreasen","locid":"02115d16-a485-4ac6-b914-7460ef6c4e83","name":"Andreasen, Søren Juhl","orcid":"0000-0002-0767-5874","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren Knudsen","key":"kærpau","last":"Kær","locid":"898d6584-ec2e-430a-b78d-e3e0d670dcdd","name":"Kær, Søren Knudsen","orcid":"0000-0003-2151-8055","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-69f7b710-8413-4b1c-ac9f-2c8f15f5c401"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Estimating Important Electrode Parameters of High Temperature PEM Fuel Cells By Fitting a Model to Polarisation Curves and Impedance Spectra","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-080839","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
{"abstract":"A high temperature PEM (HTPEM) fuel cell model capable of simulating both steady state and dynamic operation is presented. The purpose is to enable extraction of unknown parameters from sets of impedance spectra and polarisation curves. The model is fitted to two polarisation curves and four impedance spectra measured on a Dapozol 77 MEA. The model is capable of achieving good agreement with the recorded curves. Except at OCV, where the voltage is overpredicted, the simulated polarisation curves deviate maximum 3.0% from the measurements. The impedance spectra deviate maximum 3.7%. The fitted parameter values are within the range reported in literature. The only exception is the catalyst layer acid content, which is an order of magnitude lower. This may derive from acid migration. The model is used to illustrate the effect of reactant dynamics on the impedance spectrum. The model can aid in the analysis of data from degradation tests.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Vang, Jakob Rabjerg","Zhou, Fan","Andreasen, Søren Juhl","Kær, Søren Knudsen"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-087159"],"event":{"end":"2015-07-31","place":"Glasgow, gb","start":"2015-07-26","title":"ECS Conference on Electrochemical Energy Conversion &amp; Storage with SOFC-XIV","year":"2015"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["EIS","Fuel cell","HTPEM","Impedance spectroscopy","Modelling"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-OTH"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-PR-OTH","DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"estimating important electrode parameters of high temperature pem fuel cells by fitting a model to polarisation curves and impedance spectra","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/226437914/Paper_53825_manuscript_16922_0.pdf","version":"Pre-print"},"id":"S01-000.00-087159","identifier":[{"id":"84957028504","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-7f88b520-2125-4fc9-814a-a505091d53f7"],"keyword":["EIS","Fuel cell","HTPEM","Impedance spectroscopy","Modelling","Polarisation curve"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-4E150636DFB5B19B8DF3DB2B618A8ECB"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/226437914/Paper_53825_manuscript_16922_0.pdf","version":"Pre-print"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2015","yearSub":"2015"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (ENG)","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy, Fluid Mechanics and Combustion"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"other companies","l2":"DI-PR","l2n":"Private Research","l3":"DI-PR-OTH","l3nl":"Other Companies","l3nn":"Other Companies","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Other Companies","namevar":["SerEnergy"],"nora_code":"DI-PR-OTH","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jakob Rabjerg","key":"vangpau","last":"Vang","locid":"863c6a36-4e04-431b-a5b0-9e141fd73553","name":"Vang, Jakob Rabjerg","orcid":"0000-0002-4497-3205","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Fan","key":"zhoupau","last":"Zhou","locid":"874642c9-fe83-4b87-9b5e-9b8088c39e6a","name":"Zhou, Fan","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren Juhl","key":"andreasenpau","last":"Andreasen","locid":"02115d16-a485-4ac6-b914-7460ef6c4e83","name":"Andreasen, Søren Juhl","orcid":"0000-0002-0767-5874","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren Knudsen","key":"kærpau","last":"Kær","locid":"898d6584-ec2e-430a-b78d-e3e0d670dcdd","name":"Kær, Søren Knudsen","orcid":"0000-0003-2151-8055","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1149/06803.0013ecst","issn":["19385862"],"issn_org":["19386737"],"issue":"3","journal":"ECS Transactions","pages":"13-34","publisher":"Institute of Physics","status":"p","title":"ECS Transactions","volume":"68"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84957028504"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Private Research","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-PR-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Other Companies","Private Research","Universities","serenergy"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-7f88b520-2125-4fc9-814a-a505091d53f7"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Estimating Important Electrode Parameters of High Temperature PEM Fuel Cells By Fitting a Model to Polarisation Curves and Impedance Spectra","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-087159","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
{"abstract":"Various system topologies are available when it comes to designing high temperature PEM fuel cell systems. Very simple system designs are possible using pure hydrogen, and more complex system designs present themselves when alternative fuels are desired, using reformer systems. The use of reformed fuels utilizes one of the main advantages of the high temperature PEM fuel cell: robustness to fuel quality and impurities. In order for such systems to provide efficient, robust, and reliable energy, proper control strategies are needed. The complexity and nonlinearity of many of the components in such systems allow the development of both simple linear and also advanced fuzzy logic and neural network controllers able to adapt system performance to the ever changing conditions which the systems operate in over their entire lifetime.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Andreasen, Søren Juhl","Kær, Søren Knudsen","Justesen, Kristian Kjær","Sahlin, Simon Lennart"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-088603"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Catalyst","Fuel cell","High temperature PEM","Membrane","Methanol reforming","PBI","Stack","System control"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"high temperature pem fuel cell systems control and diagnostics chapter 000000000021","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-088603","identifier":[{"id":"84956760386","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-84848faf-802d-40a7-94d7-0709bba4cf5d"],"keyword":["Catalyst","Fuel cell","High temperature PEM","Membrane","Methanol reforming","PBI","Stack","System control"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-48006149535E9CBD0A036AC4AB3774A5"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (ENG)","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy, Thermal Energy Systems"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren Juhl","key":"andreasenpau","last":"Andreasen","locid":"02115d16-a485-4ac6-b914-7460ef6c4e83","name":"Andreasen, Søren Juhl","orcid":"0000-0002-0767-5874","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren Knudsen","key":"kærpau","last":"Kær","locid":"898d6584-ec2e-430a-b78d-e3e0d670dcdd","name":"Kær, Søren Knudsen","orcid":"0000-0003-2151-8055","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Kristian Kjær","key":"justesenpau","last":"Justesen","locid":"071a392f-a11c-48e9-a4c7-d15094d235c8","name":"Justesen, Kristian Kjær","orcid":"0000-0002-9703-8747","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Simon Lennart","key":"sahlinpau","last":"Sahlin","locid":"10be1b68-a59d-4397-ae45-e356bf4c5844","name":"Sahlin, Simon Lennart","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Qingfeng","key":"lipedh","last":"Li","name":"Li, Qingfeng","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"David","key":"ailipedh","last":"Aili","name":"Aili, David","rank":6,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Hans Aage","key":"hjulerpedh","last":"Hjuler","name":"Hjuler, Hans Aage","rank":7,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Jens Oluf","key":"jensenpedh","last":"Jensen","name":"Jensen, Jens Oluf","rank":8,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1007/978-3-319-17082-4_21","edition":"1","eisbn":["9783319170824"],"isbn":["9783319170817"],"pages":"459-486","place":"Switzerland","publisher":"Springer","status":"p","subtitle":"Approaches, Status, and Perspectives","title":"High Temperature Polymer Electrolyte Membrane Fuel Cells","volume":"1"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84956760386"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-84848faf-802d-40a7-94d7-0709bba4cf5d"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"High Temperature PEM Fuel Cell Systems, Control and Diagnostics : Chapter 21","type":"Book Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-088603","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
{"abstract":"Operation under fuel starvation has been proved to be harmful to the fuel cell by causing severe and irreversible degradation. To characterize the behaviors of the high temperature PEM fuel cell under fuel starvation conditions, the cell voltage and local current density is measured simultaneously under different H2 stoichiometries below 1.0 and at different current loads. The experimental results show that the cell voltage decreases promptly when the H2 stoichiometry decreases to below 1.0. Negative cell voltage can be observed which indicates cell reversal. The local current density starts to diverge when the cell voltage decreases. In the H2 upstream regions the current densities show an increasing trend, while those in the H2 downstream regions show a decreasing trend. Consequently, the current density distribution becomes very uneven. The current density is the highest in the upstream regions, decreasing along the flow channel direction, becoming the lowest in the downstream regions. In addition, the CO2 and even the O2 can be detected in the anode exhaust under fuel starvation conditions, confirming the occurring of carbon corrosion and water electrolysis reactions. With lower H2 stoichiometry and higher current load, the cell voltage decrease rate is higher and the cell reversal is more severe. Higher CO2 concentration in anode exhaust is measured under these conditions, suggesting the degradation is more severe.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Zhou, Fan","Andreasen, Søren Juhl","Kær, Søren Knudsen"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-104641"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["HT PEM fuel cell"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"experimental study of cell reversal of a high temperature polymer electrolyte membrane fuel cell caused by h000000000002 starvation","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-104641","identifier":[{"id":"WOS:000354581100021","type":"wos"},{"id":"84928762606","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-bc4b356b-05f8-48ad-9b76-9191fda4b12b"],"keyword":["Cell reversal","Current density distribution","H2 starvation","HT-PEM fuel cell"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-687721F138F0C6174959A59D96B8EAE8"],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2015","yearSub":"2015"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (ENG)","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy, Fluid Mechanics and Combustion","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy, Hydrogen and Electro-fuels"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Fan","key":"zhoupau","last":"Zhou","locid":"874642c9-fe83-4b87-9b5e-9b8088c39e6a","name":"Zhou, Fan","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren Juhl","key":"andreasenpau","last":"Andreasen","locid":"02115d16-a485-4ac6-b914-7460ef6c4e83","name":"Andreasen, Søren Juhl","orcid":"0000-0002-0767-5874","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren Knudsen","key":"kærpau","last":"Kær","locid":"898d6584-ec2e-430a-b78d-e3e0d670dcdd","name":"Kær, Søren Knudsen","orcid":"0000-0003-2151-8055","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.ijhydene.2015.03.148","issn":["03603199","18793487"],"issn_org":["03603199"],"issue":"20","journal":"International Journal of Hydrogen Energy","pages":"6672-6680","publisher":"Elsevier","status":"p","title":"International Journal of Hydrogen Energy","volume":"40"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84928762606"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-bc4b356b-05f8-48ad-9b76-9191fda4b12b"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Experimental study of cell reversal of a high temperature polymer electrolyte membrane fuel cell caused by H2 starvation","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-104641","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
{"abstract":"Different Test Modules (TM) are defined for the functional and performance characterization of a PEMFC stack. The master document TM2.00 defines requirements and methodology for parameter variation, stability and data acquisition.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Mitzel, Jens","Gülzow, Erich","Friedrich, K. Andreas","Araya, Samuel Simon","Kær, Søren Knudsen"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-122678"],"event":{"end":"2015-06-17","place":"Ulm, de","start":"2015-06-16","title":"From Harmonized Fuel Cell Stack Testing to Standardization","year":"2015"},"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"summary of functional and performance test procedures","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dco","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-122678","ids":["aau-fa0e3105-d26c-4775-8433-9f0c8940e63b"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-BA0699743FBA5969D2E15239C59E20FD"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (ENG)","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy, Fluid Mechanics and Combustion","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy, Hydrogen and Electro-fuels"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Jens","key":"mitzelpau","last":"Mitzel","name":"Mitzel, Jens","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","co