alborg University"],"title":"Sociologien som videnskab og perspektiv","type":"Book Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-097745","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
{"abstract":"In this work, a non-equilibrium formulation of a compression dependent water uptake model has been implemented in a two-dimensional, two-phase, multi-component and non-isothermal high pressure PEM electrolysis model. The non-equilibrium formulation of the water uptake model was chosen in order to account for interfacial transport kinetics between each fluid phase and the perfluorinated sulfonic acid membrane. Besides modeling water uptake, the devised membrane model accounts for water transport through diffusion and electro-osmotic drag in the electrolyte phase, and hydraulic permeation in the liquid phase. Charge transport and electrochemistry are likewise included. The obtained model is validated against experimental measurements. In order to investigate the effect of membrane compression, a parametric study is carried. Results underline that the predicted water uptake and cell voltage are highly dependent on the applied water uptake model depending on operation conditions like temperature and the specific surface area of the ionomer in the catalyst layer.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Olesen, Anders Christian","Kær, Søren Knudsen"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-110880"],"event":{"end":"2015-07-31","place":"Glasgow, gb","start":"2015-07-26","title":"ECS Conference on Electrochemical Energy Conversion &amp; Storage with SOFC-XIV","year":"2015"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"the effect of pfsa membrane compression on the predicted performance of a high pressure pem electrolysis cell","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-110880","identifier":[{"id":"84957044599","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-d1879261-a08b-4f0d-b4e9-fd3e037a39b6"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-BF8FB4631F2D7665E4D5A2C498E56C00"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2015","yearSub":"2015"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (ENG)","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy, Fluid Mechanics and Combustion"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Anders Christian","key":"olesenpau","last":"Olesen","locid":"a6c83a7f-2f25-4b66-b42d-9ef435ffeecf","name":"Olesen, Anders Christian","orcid":"0000-0002-8344-914X","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren Knudsen","key":"kærpau","last":"Kær","locid":"898d6584-ec2e-430a-b78d-e3e0d670dcdd","name":"Kær, Søren Knudsen","orcid":"0000-0003-2151-8055","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1149/06803.0099ecst","issn":["19385862"],"issn_org":["19386737"],"issue":"3","journal":"ECS Transactions","pages":"99-116","publisher":"Institute of Physics","status":"p","title":"ECS Transactions","volume":"68"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84957044599"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-d1879261-a08b-4f0d-b4e9-fd3e037a39b6"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"The Effect of PFSA Membrane Compression on the Predicted Performance of a High Pressure PEM Electrolysis Cell","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-110880","year":"2015","yearsub"