{"abstract":"In the field of malaria diagnosis much effort is put into the development of faster and easier alternatives to the gold standard, blood smear microscopy. Nucleic acid amplification based techniques pose some of the most promising upcoming diagnostic tools due to their potential for high sensitivity, robustness and user-friendliness. In the current review, we will discuss some of the different DNA-based sensor systems under development for the diagnosis of malaria.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Hede, Marianne Smedegaard","Fjelstrup, Søren","Knudsen, Birgitta R."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-224333"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"dna sensors for malaria diagnosis","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"djr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1142/S1793984415410032","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-224333","ids":["au-a6ae839e-1890-4952-892a-72834b916839"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-3-D69BD44A647C100C10A69CDD712D8C8F"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1142/S1793984415410032","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.worldscientific.com/loi/nl","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2015","yearSub":"2015"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Natural Sciences, Department of Molecular Biology and Genetics, Department of Molecular Biology and Genetics - Genome stability and technology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Marianne Smedegaard","key":"hedepau","last":"Hede","locid":"a2ee0e39-20a4-4aec-9cd5-25b07849ae4b","name":"Hede, Marianne Smedegaard","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren","key":"fjelstruppau","last":"Fjelstrup","locid":"406fb03d-d28d-416b-8218-005358fd6a78","name":"Fjelstrup, Søren","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Birgitta R.","key":"knudsenpau","last":"Knudsen","locid":"50fca07c-ced4-453a-a26a-0d664c9a1491","name":"Knudsen, Birgitta R.","orcid":"0000-0002-3484-3802","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1142/s1793984415410032","issn":["17939844","17939852"],"issn_org":["17939844"],"issue":"2","journal":"Nano Life","paperid":"1541003","publisher":"World Scientific","status":"p","title":"Nano Life","volume":"5"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-a6ae839e-1890-4952-892a-72834b916839"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"DNA Sensors for Malaria Diagnosis","type":"Journal Review","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-224333","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
{"abstract":"Idiopathic venous thrombosis (VTE) is frequently associated with underlying malignancy. Thus, it is tempting to search for underlying cancer in these patients. However, extensive screening is cost-intensive and no survival benefit has been demonstrated. Based on a review of the literature, we recommend the performance of a thorough medical history and physical examination in addition to basic biochemical screening and a chest X-ray in patients with idiopathic VTE. Only specific symptoms or findings should lead to a more extensive work-up.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Holt, Marianne Ingerslev","Knudsen, Søren Tang","Andersen, Birthe Søgaard","Grove, Erik Lerkevang"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-253762"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"detection of occult cancer in patients with idiopathic venous thrombosis","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85021847948","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-253762","identifier":[{"id":"85021847948","type":"scopus"},{"id":"26239961","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["au-d9feb1d5-97d7-4456-b491-7a1543482b3d"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-6F8B6C9E5B0572E3E451FCC65850DA2D"],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2015","yearSub":"2015"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Aarhus University, Faculty of Health Sciences, The Depar