{"abstract":"This work presents the results of using the electrochemical impedance to analyse the behaviour of a BASF Celtec P2100 MEA operated under varying operating conditions with different temperatures and gas concentrations. Figure 1 shows the experimental setup used for these measurements.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Jensen, Hans-Christian Becker","Andreasen, Søren Juhl","Kær, Søren Knudsen","Schaltz, Erik"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-090534"],"event":{"end":"2013-04-18","place":"Karlsruhe, de","start":"2013-04-16","title":"5th International Conference FDFC2013","year":"2013"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Brændselscelle","CO","Fuel cell","HTPEM","PBI","PEM"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"estimation of co concentration in high temperature pem fuel cells using electrochemical impedance","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dco","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/77236847/FDFC2013_Estimation_of_CO_concentration_in_high_temperature_PEM_fuel_cells_using_electrochemical_impedance_spectroscopy.pptx","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-090534","ids":["aau-8b465722-c694-490a-a396-b45de48f598a"],"keyword":["CO","PEM","brændselscelle","fuel cell","htpem","pbi"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-3BE80097C9FF1F6260522B8D2889B68A"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/77236847/FDFC2013_Estimation_of_CO_concentration_in_high_temperature_PEM_fuel_cells_using_electrochemical_impedance_spectroscopy.pptx","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (ENG)","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Hans-Christian Becker","key":"jensenpau","last":"Jensen","locid":"372be06d-7f4f-4025-86a1-75eb41ce5af8","name":"Jensen, Hans-Christian Becker","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren Juhl","key":"andreasenpau","last":"Andreasen","locid":"02115d16-a485-4ac6-b914-7460ef6c4e83","name":"Andreasen, Søren Juhl","orcid":"0000-0002-0767-5874","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren Knudsen","key":"kærpau","last":"Kær","locid":"898d6584-ec2e-430a-b78d-e3e0d670dcdd","name":"Kær, Søren Knudsen","orcid":"0000-0003-2151-8055","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Erik","key":"schaltzpau","last":"Schaltz","locid":"6e39b31c-c3fa-470a-b47b-e69ee21195c1","name":"Schaltz, Erik","orcid":"0000-0002-8540-0040","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-8b465722-c694-490a-a396-b45de48f598a"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Estimation of CO concentration in high temperature PEM fuel cells using electrochemical impedance","type":"Conference Poster","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-090534","year":"2013","yearsub":"2013"}
{"abstract":"Floating wind turbines are considered as a new and promising solution for reaching higher wind resources beyond the water depth restriction of monopile wind turbines. But on a floating structure, the wave-induced loads significantly increase the oscillations of the structure. Furthermore, using a controller designed for an onshore wind turbine yields instability in the fore-aft rotation. In this paper, we propose a general framework, where a reference model models the desired closed-loop behavior of the system. Model predictive control combined with a state estimator finds the optimal rotor blade pitch such that the state trajectories of the controlled system tracks the reference trajectories. The framework is demonstrated with a reference model of the desired closed-loop system undisturbed by the incident waves. This allows the wave-induced motion of the platform to be damped significantly compared to a baseline floating wind turbine controller at the cost of more pitch action.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Christiansen, Søren","Tabatabaeipour, Seyed Mojtaba","Bak, Thomas","Knudsen, Torben"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-092199"],"event":{"end":"2013-06-19","place":"Washington, us","start":"2013-06-17","title":"The 2013 American Control Conference","year":"2013"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Floating turbine","Wind energy","Wind turbine control"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"wave disturbance reduction of a floating wind turbine using a reference model based predictive control","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/195547386/Knudsen2013ACC.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-092199","identifier":[{"id":"84883502402","type":"scopus"},{"id":"WOS:000327210202064","type":"wos"}],"ids":["aau-910b764a-4b42-4147-a4e7-a165e2c5ec2d"],"keyword":["Floating turbine","Wind energy","Wind turbine control"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-8EF10D47308D892BAE2240C834AF7B11"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://ieeexplore.ieee.org/xpl/login.jsp?tp=&arnumber=6580164","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/195547386/Knudsen2013ACC.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2013","yearSub":"2013"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (TECH)","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems, Automation & Control"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Søren","key":"christiansenpau","last":"Christiansen","locid":"31e1968a-95d9-469a-bc94-0ce41a58b13b","name":"Christiansen, Søren","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Seyed Mojtaba","key":"tabatabaeipourpau","last":"Tabatabaeipour","locid":"dced3679-c241-45e0-b425-8d1710c5589e","name":"Tabatabaeipour, Seyed Mojtaba","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Thomas","key":"bakpau","last":"Bak","locid":"474a52b5-2182-461f-8b5c-4ef451576fe4","name":"Bak, Thomas","orcid":"0000-0002-8282-5932","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","fir