{"abstract":"Central blood pressure (BP) has attracted increasing interest because of a potential superiority over brachial BP in predicting cardiovascular morbidity and mortality. Several devices estimating central BP noninvasively are now available. The aim of our study was to determine the validity of the Arteriograph, a brachial cuff-based, oscillometric device, in patients with type 2 diabetes.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Rossen, Niklas B","Laugesen, Esben","Peters, Christian Daugaard","Ebbehøj, Eva","Knudsen, Søren Tang","Poulsen, Per Løgstrup","Bøtker, Hans Erik","Hansen, Klavs Würgler"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-232500"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"invasive validation of arteriograph estimates of central blood pressure in patients with type 000000000002 diabetes","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.au.dk/ws/files/55805139/Am_J_Hypertens_2013_Rossen_ajh_hpt162.pdf","version":"Pre-print"},"id":"S01-000.00-232500","identifier":[{"id":"23996499","type":"pmid"},{"id":"84898869348","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-b4cf4f93-1485-41f8-9008-8257f3fd4a0a"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-546CC1497DD6DA2F7F996DAD335A2A6E"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.au.dk/ws/files/55805139/Am_J_Hypertens_2013_Rossen_ajh_hpt162.pdf","version":"Pre-print"},{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1093/ajh/hpt162","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2013","yearSub":"2013"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine - Department of Endocrinology and Internal Medicine","Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine - Medicinsk afdeling, Silkeborg"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Niklas Blach","key":"rossenpau","last":"Rossen","locid":"fde04f7b-b73f-42bb-8fed-7ced5a87b6fc","name":"Rossen, Niklas B","name_org":"Rossen, Niklas Blach","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Esben","key":"laugesenpau","last":"Laugesen","locid":"e06ca9b7-d51f-40f2-b042-696ca2b18492","name":"Laugesen, Esben","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Christian Daugaard","key":"peterspau","last":"Peters","locid":"02fa09b3-c04d-41e2-a9b0-0f23130799f4","name":"Peters, Christian Daugaard","orcid":"0000-0002-4917-1535","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Eva","key":"ebbehøjpau","last":"Ebbehøj","locid":"771ecd1e-220d-410b-8c3e-b83b391fa1f3","name":"Ebbehøj, Eva","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren Tang","key":"knudsenpau","last":"Knudsen","locid":"f4fb113c-f8d2-4bb3-9a9d-0bc2ef14590d","name":"Knudsen, Søren Tang","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Per Løgstrup","key":"poulsenpau","last":"Poulsen","locid":"a965cecb-44f9-4913-a8e1-7bc669e8ffd9","name":"Poulsen, Per Løgstrup","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Hans Erik","key":"bøtkerpau","last":"Bøtker","locid":"09b03c00-11a8-4f72-800f-181f26155750","name":"Bøtker, Hans Erik","orcid":"0000-0001-6358-8962","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Klavs Würgler","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"a2dc4053-a6dd-47ea-bfeb-e689b3b6fc94","name":"Hansen, Klavs Würgler","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["23996499"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1093/ajh/hpt162","issn":["08957061","11395990"],"issn_org":["08957061"],"journal":"American Journal of Hypertension","publisher":"Oxford University Press","status":"p","title":"American Journal of Hypertension"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84898869348"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-b4cf4f93-1485-41f8-9008-8257f3fd4a0a"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Invasive Validation of Arteriograph Estimates of Central Blood Pressure in Patients With Type 2 Diabetes","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-232500","year":"2013","yearsub":"2013"}
{"abstract":"Abstract Aims. Patients with type 2 diabetes have increased arterial stiffness and a high incidence of cardiovascular disease compared with non-diabetics. Arterial stiffness and central waveforms can be assessed by carotid-femoral pulse wave velocity (PWV) and pulse wave analysis (PWA) using the SphygmoCor device. These methods can potentially improve cardiovascular risk stratification in the future. However, a prerequisite is acceptable reproducibility. The objective of this study was to assess the intra- and inter-observer reproducibility of PWV and PWA indices in patients with type 2 diabetes using the SphygmoCor device. Methods. Two trained observers (A and B) each undertook two PWA and two carotid-femoral PWV recordings in random order in 20 patients with type 2 diabetes under standardized conditions on the right side of the patients. Observer A also made double recordings on the left side. The mean of the two recordings was used for inter-observer comparison. Data were analyzed by Bland-Altman plots. Results. The mean intra-observer differences (± 2SD) on the right side for observer A and B, respectively, were 0.0 ± 2.8 mmHg and 0.3 ± 3.2 mmHg (aortic systolic blood pressue (BP)), 0.0 ± 1.2 mmHg and 0.1 ± 1.0 mmHg (aortic diastolic BP), - 1.1 ± 3.2% and 1.1 ± 9.6% (central augmentation index (Aix)), - 1.6 ± 6.6% and 0.1 ± 9.0% (Aix normalized to heart rate 75 beats/min (Aix@HR75)) and 0.1 ± 1.8 m/s and 0.0 ± 1.6 m/s (PWV). The mean inter-observer differences (± 2SD) were - 2.6 ± 13.0 mmHg (aortic systolic BP), - 2.1 ± 7.4 mmHg (aortic diastolic BP), - 0.8 ± 8.4% (Aix), - 1.5 ± 7.4% (Aix@HR75) and - 0.3 ± 1.6 m/s (PWV). Left-vs-right comparison showed comparable results (observer A). Conclusions. PWA and PWV assessed with the SphygmoCor device are characterized by good reproducibility in patients with type 2 diabetes.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Laugesen, Esben","Rossen, Niklas B","Høyem, Pernille","Christiansen, Jens Sandahl","Knudsen, Søren Tang","Hansen, Klavs Würgler","Hansen, Troels Krarup","Poulsen, Per Løgstrup"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-248355"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"reproducibility of pulse wave analysis and pulse wave velocity in patients with type 000000000002 diabetes","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3109/00365513.2013.800578","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-248355","identifier":[{"id":"84882432355","type":"scopus"},{"id":"23777282","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["au-d05220d9-1832-449c-ae99-8fa4fd5ac161"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-514C583854B80C225E555811C157A25E"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3109/00365513.2013.800578","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2013","yearSub":"2013"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine - Department of Endocrinology and Internal Medicine"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Esben","key":"laugesenesbenpau","last":"Laugesen","locid":"e06ca9b7-d51f-40f2-b042-696ca2b18492","name":"Laugesen, Esben","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Niklas B","key":"rossenniklasbpau","last":"Rossen","locid":"fde04f7b-b73f-42bb-8fed-7ced