{"abstract":"Salmonella enterica serovar Typhimurium requires the Type III Secretion System, encoded by Salmonella pathogenicity island 1 (SPI1) and controlled by the master regulator, HilA, to penetrate the intestinal epithelium. Numerous regulators affect virulence through influence on this system, including the proteolytic component ClpP, the stationary phase regulator RpoS and the carbon storage regulator CsrA. However, the mechanism behind the ClpP regulation is not fully understood. To elucidate this we examined differentially expressed genes in a ΔclpP mutant compared with wild-type using global transcriptomic analysis. SPI1 and SPI4 virulence genes were significantly down-regulated in the ΔclpP mutant whereas several RpoS-dependent genes and the fliC gene encoding flagellin were up-regulated. While the ΔclpP mutant was attenuated in cell invasion, this attenuation was not present in a ΔclpP/rpoS::amp double mutant suggesting the repression of invasion was directed through RpoS. The expression of the csrA virulence regulator was increased in the ΔclpP mutant and decreased in the rpoS::amp and ΔclpP/rpoS::amp mutants indicating that ClpP affects the csrA expression level as well. Thus, this study suggests that ClpP affects SPI1 expression and thereby virulence indirectly through its regulation of both RpoS and CsrA.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Knudsen, Gitte Maegaard","Olsen, John E.","Aabo, Søren","Barrow, Paul","Rychlik, Ivan","Thomsen, Line E."],"cuid":["S02-093.30-035807"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"country":["Czechia","United Kingdom"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Czech Academy of Agricultural Sciences","Czech Academy of Sciences","University of Nottingham"],"keyword":["Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences","Protease","Salmonella","virulens"],"level":"sci","mra":["med","sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Division of Industrial Food Research"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"clpp deletion causes attenuation of em salmonella em typhimurium virulence through mis regulation of rpos and indirect control of csra and the spi genes","src":["dtu","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1099/mic.0.065797-0","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-093.30-035807","identifier":[{"id":"23676436","type":"pmid"},{"id":"84879820120","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-8be24da8-cc1f-4374-958c-05d1ecebb5e4","ku-2471c433-33d1-42f4-b6b1-177201ad053b"],"keyword":["Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences","protease","salmonella","virulens"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science","Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-ADE60C4AE958DA17A2BD203682DADE12"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1099/mic.0.065797-0","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2013","yearSub":"2013"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Systems Biology","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Systems Biology, Center for Systems Microbiology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Division of Industrial Food Research"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Veterinary and Animal Sciences, Veterinary Clinical Microbiology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"gb","key":"university of nottingham","loc":["United Kingdom","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Nottingham","used":1},{"affno":"5","country":"cz","key":"czech academy of agricultural sciences","loc":["Czechia","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Czech Academy of Agricultural Sciences","used":1},{"affno":"6","country":"cz","key":"czech academy of sciences","loc":["Czechia","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Czech Academy of Sciences","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Gitte Maegaard","key":"knudsenpau","last":"Knudsen","locid":"bb84b997-02d1-4569-be9c-278ebb453bf3","name":"Knudsen, Gitte Maegaard","orcid":"0000-0002-3983-0541","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","first":"John Elmerdahl","key":"olsenpau","last":"Olsen","locid":"d7f792e1-ac2c-4d67-8887-3615a3a98edb","name":"Olsen, John Elmerdahl","orcid":"0000-0001-6225-6587","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Søren","key":"aabopau","last":"Aabo","locid":"b86b74ee-7bf8-41f6-9c29-1cbcc8bbd994","name":"Aabo, Søren","orcid":"0000-0003-1430-1480","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"first":"Paul","key":"barrowpau","last":"Barrow","name":"Barrow, Paul","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"5 6","corresponding":null,"first":"Ivan","key":"rychlikpau","last":"Rychlik","name":"Rychlik, Ivan","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","first":"Line E","key":"thomsenpau","last":"Thomsen","locid":"e8fab8c4-e7bb-404b-8