{"author_count":3,"contributors":["Arsalis, Alexandros","Nielsen, Mads Pagh","Kær, Søren Knudsen"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-055614"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corresponding_author":["Arsalis, Alexandros"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"corrigendum to modeling and simulation of a 000000000100 kwe ht pemfc subsystem integrated with an absorption chiller subsystem international journal of hydrogen energy 000000000037 000000002012 000000013484 000000013490","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijhydene.2013.01.021","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-055614","identifier":[{"id":"84875532303","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-13239c9c-76fa-4a4a-8db0-ccad010bc793"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-70FE4EE07FCCDF9BE1C54ED8F5C97443"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijhydene.2013.01.021","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.scopus.com/inward/record.url?scp=84875532303&partnerID=8YFLogxK","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2013","yearSub":"2013"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (ENG)","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy, Fluid Mechanics and Combustion"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Alexandros","key":"arsalispau","last":"Arsalis","locid":"78eb1abb-bd28-461a-8c05-68a79cd90e77","name":"Arsalis, Alexandros","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Mads Pagh","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"4167f94b-c30d-4966-8da7-b9f5a33bb6d0","name":"Nielsen, Mads Pagh","orcid":"0000-0002-9396-8525","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren Knudsen","key":"kærpau","last":"Kær","locid":"898d6584-ec2e-430a-b78d-e3e0d670dcdd","name":"Kær, Søren Knudsen","orcid":"0000-0003-2151-8055","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.ijhydene.2013.01.021","issn":["03603199","18793487"],"issn_org":["03603199"],"issue":"9","journal":"International Journal of Hydrogen Energy","pages":"13484-13490","publisher":"Elsevier","status":"p","title":"International Journal of Hydrogen Energy","volume":"38"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84875532303"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-13239c9c-76fa-4a4a-8db0-ccad010bc793"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Corrigendum to “Modeling and simulation of a 100 kWe HT-PEMFC subsystem integrated with an absorption chiller subsystem” : International Journal of Hydrogen Energy 37 (2012) 13484–13490]","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-055614","year":"2013","yearsub":"2013"}
{"abstract":"Fuel cells are getting growing interest in both backup systems and electric vehicles. Although these systems are characterized by periods of standby, they must be able to start at any instant in the shortest possible time. However, the membranes of which proton exchange membrane fuel cells are made, tend to gradually dry out when the fuel cell is not operating, increasing the time required to start up the system. A precise estimation of the hydration status of the membrane during standby is thus important for the design of a fuel cell system capable of a fast and safe start up. In previous works, the measurement of the complex impedance of a fuel cell stack during standby is used as an index of its membrane hydration status. In this article, the complex impedance of a fuel cell stack has been measured and characterized as a function of relative humidity and temperature. A non-conventional electrochemical impedance spectroscopy (EIS) technique has been used, allowing the performance of a fuel cell diagnostic when the fuel cell stack does not contain any hydrogen, which would otherwise not be possible. The results appeared to confirm that measuring the impedance of an entire fuel cell stack could be a viable way for estimating the hydration status and the temperature of its membrane before the system is started up. A summarizing table with the complete characterization of the fuel cell stack is included in this article.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Bidoggia, Benoit","Kær, Søren Knudsen"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-084940"],"event":{"end":"2013-03-30","place":"Monte Carlo, mc","start":"2013-03-27","title":"International Conference and Exhibition on Ecological Vehicles and Renewable Energies EVER 2013","year":"2013"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"estimation of membrane hydration status for standby proton exchange membrane fuel cell systems by impedance measurement first results on variable temperature stack characterization","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1109/EVER.2013.6521593","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-084940","identifier":[{"id":"WOS:000325276700076","type":"wos"},{"id":"2-s2.0-84879952849","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-78359cc9-33df-41f1-8509-fee775c11797"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-6D0CE3E990CD3ADF06F4B3C29E553BDC"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1109/EVER.2013.6521593","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (ENG)","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy, Power Electronic Systems"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Benoit","key":"bidoggiapau","last":"Bidoggia","locid":"132f2659-f4a2-4324-8b4e-88cec8230dea","name":"Bidoggia, Benoit","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren Knudsen","key":"kærpau","last":"Kær","locid":"898d6584-ec2e-430a-b78d-e3e0d670dcdd","name":"Kær, Søren Knudsen","orcid":"0000-0003-2151-8055","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1109/ever.2013.6521593","eisbn":["9781467352703"],"isbn":["9781467352697"],"pages":"1-10","publisher":"IEEE Press","status":"p","subtitle":"EVER","title":"Proceedings of the 2013 8th International Conference and Exhibition on Ecological Vehicles and Renewable Energies (EVER)"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84879952849"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-78359cc9-33df-41f1-8509-fee775c11797"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Estimation of Membrane Hydration Status for Standby Proton Exchange Membrane Fuel Cell Systems by Impedance Measurement: First Results on Variable Temperature Stack Characterization","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-084940","year":"2013","yearsub":"2013"}
