J","rank":14,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"6","corresponding":null,"first":"Karsen","key":"krygerpau","last":"Kryger","name":"Kryger, Karsen","rank":15,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"7","corresponding":null,"first":"Jeanette","key":"engstrømpau","last":"Engstrøm","name":"Engstrøm, Jeanette","rank":16,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"7","corresponding":null,"first":"Mikael","key":"elbækpau","last":"Elbæk","name":"Elbæk, Mikael","rank":17,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p","title":"DEFF-rapport: Forvaltning af forskningsdata i Danmark"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Governmental Institutions","All Universities","Copenhagen Business School","DI-ALL","DI-GV","DI-GV-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Governmental Institutions","Roskilde University","Technical University of Denmark","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["sdu-a4c83373-89f6-4f9a-87f5-27899748d9a1"],"src":["SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Forvaltning af forskningsdata i Danmark : En undersøgelse af danske universiteters og forskningsråds praksisser, politik og visioner for lagring, langtidsbevaring, tilgængeliggørelse og deling af forskningsdata","type":"Report Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-620379","year":"2013","yearsub":"2013"}
{"abstract":"An experimental study is performed to investigate the ignition, devolatilization, and burnout of single biomass particles of various shapes and sizes under process conditions that are similar to those in an industrial combustor. A charge-coupled device (CCD) camera is used to record the whole combustion process. For the particles with similar volume (mass), cylindrical particles are found to lose mass faster than spherical particles and the burnout time is shortened by increasing the particle aspect ratio (surface area). The conversion times of cylindrical particles with almost the same surface area/volume ratio are very close to each other. The ignition, devolatilization, and burnout times of cylindrical particles are also affected by the oxidizer temperature and oxygen concentration, in which the oxygen concentration is found to have a more pronounced effect on the conversion times at lower oxidizer temperatures.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Momenikouchaksaraei, Maryam","Yin, Chungen","Kær, Søren Knudsen","Troels, Bruun Hansen","Jensen, Peter","Glarborg, Peter"],"cuid":["S02-091.28-002413"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Biomass","Burnout","Combustion","Experimental study","Ignition"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"experimental study on effects of particle shape and operating conditions on combustion characteristics of single biomass particles","src":["aau","dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/51949979/ef301343q.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-091.28-002413","identifier":[{"id":"WOS:000317327700059","type":"wos"},{"id":"84872762068","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-3044c8ef-52c4-4e92-a05a-eb4ecf192e46","dtu-4da72118-7c19-42ea-8dbe-d13874623938"],"keyword":["Biomass","Burnout","Combustion","Experimental Study","Ignition"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-F469590A36709769536DA98D7EA6262A"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://pubs.acs.org/doi/abs/10.1021/ef301343q","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1021/ef301343q","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/51949979/ef301343q.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2013","yearSub":"2013"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (ENG)","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy, Fluid Mechanics and Combustion"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Chemical and Biochemical Engineering","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Chemical and Biochemical Engineering, CHEC Research Centre"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Maryam","key":"momenikouchaksaraeipau","last":"Momenikouchaksaraei","locid":"f9706a2b-7ab1-4b2d-b289-7dfee67472f8","name":"Momenikouchaksaraei, Maryam","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Chungen","key":"yinpau","last":"Yin","locid":"a24ca845-2626-44cc-b726-b6c5ec9ddd24","name":"Yin, Chungen","orcid":"0000-0002-9885-7744","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren Knudsen","key":"kærpau","last":"Kær","locid":"898d6584-ec2e-430a-b78d-e3e0d670dcdd","name":"Kær, Søren Knudsen","orcid":"0000-0003-2151-8055","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Troels Bruun","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"4aa4cfc3-356a-4856-952c-585940bc8978","name":"Hansen, Troels Bruun","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Peter Arendt","key":"jensenpau","last":"Jensen","locid":"61f75c0e-450b-4b80-9f3d-3f28b888ddb4","name":"Jensen, Peter Arendt","orcid":"0000-0001-6784-5321","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Peter","key":"glarborgpau","last":"Glarborg","locid":"bfab6b04-8648-4602-a355-c9eea46f5cce","name":"Glarborg, Peter","orcid":"0000-0002-6856-852X","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1021/ef301343q","issn":["08870624","15205029"],"issn_org":["08870624"],"issue":"1","journal":"Energy and Fuels","pages":"507-514","publisher":"American Chemical Society","status":"p","title":"Energy and Fuels","title_org":"Energy & Fuels","volume":"27"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84872762068"],"sdg":["7. Affordable and Clean Energy","All UN SDG Classification"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-3044c8ef-52c4-4e92-a05a-eb4ecf192e46","dtu-4da72118-7c19-42ea-8dbe-d13874623938"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University","DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Experimental Study on Effects of Particle Shape and Operating Conditions on Combustion Characteristics of Single Biomass Particles","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-091.28-002413","year":"2013","yearsub":"2013"}
{"abstract":"Background: The arterial system in diabetic patients is characterized by generalized non-atherosclerotic alterations in the vascular extracellular matrix causing increased arterial stiffness compared with subjects without diabetes. The underlying pathophysiology remains elusive. The elastin-associated extracellular matrix protein, fibulin-1, was recently found in higher concentrations in the arterial wall and in plasma in patients with long duration type 2 diabetes. Furthermore, plasma fibulin-1 independently predicted total mortality and was associated with pulse pressure, an indirect measure of arterial stiffness. Whether plasma fibulin-1 is associated with arterial stiffness at earlier phases of type 2 diabetes has not been determined.Methods: In this cross-sectional study, we examined 90 patients with recently diagnosed type 2 diabetes (< 5 years) and 90 gender- and age-matched controls. Plasma fibulin-1 was measured immunochemically. Arterial stiffness was assessed by carotid-femoral Pulse Wave Velocity (PWV). Differences in means were assessed by t-tests. Associations were assessed by multivariate regression analyses.Results: Plasma fibulin-1 levels were lower in the diabetic group compared with the control group, 93 ± 28 vs 106 ± 30 μg/mL, p = 0.005. In unadjusted analysis of the total study sample, plasma fibulin-1 was not associated with PWV, p = 0.46. However, with adjustment for the confounders age, gender, mean blood pressure, heart rate, body mass index, diabetes and glomerular filtration rate, a 10 μg/mL increase in plasma fibulin was associated with 0.09 ± 0.04 m/s increase in PWV, p < 0.05. In subgroup analysis, plasma fibulin-1 was associated with PWV in the diabetes group, (0.16 ± 0.07 m/s increase in PWV per 10 μg/mL increase in plasma fibulin-1, p<0.05), but not controls, β = 0.021 ± 0.057 m/s per 10 μg/mL, p = 0.70. The association remained significant in the diabetes group after adjustment for covariates, p < 0.05.Conclusions: Plasma fibulin-1 is independently associated with PWV. Yet, as the plasma level of fibulin-1 was lower in patients with recently diagnosed type 2 diabetes than in healthy controls, plasma fibulin-1 levels are not a simple marker of the degree of arterial stiffening. Further studies are needed to determine the exact role of fibulin-1 in arterial stiffness and cardiovascular risk in patients with type 2 diabetes.","author_count":9,"contributors":["Laugesen, Esben","Høyem, Pernille","Christiansen, Jens Sandahl","Knudsen, Søren Tang","Hansen, Klavs Würgler","Argraves, W Scott","Hansen, Troels Krarup","Poulsen, Per Løgstrup","Rasmussen, Lars Melholt"],"cuid":["S02-094.35-012886"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["America, North","OECD"],"country":["United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Medical University of South Carolina"],"keyword":["Aged","Arterial stiffness","Biomarkers blood","Calcium Binding Proteins blood","Case Control Studies","Cross Sectional Studies","Diabetes Mellitus Type 2 blood","Diabetic Angiopathies blood","Fibulin 1","Humans","Immunoassay","Male","Middle Aged","Multivariate Analysis","Predictive Value of Tests","Pulse Wave Analysis","Pulse wave velocity","Risk Factors","Type 2 diabetes mellitus","Vascular Stiffness"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CDR"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CDR","DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"plasma levels of the arterial wall protein fibulin 000000000001 are associated with carotid femoral pulse wave velocity a cross sectional study","src":["au","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1186/1475-2840-12-107","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-094.35-012886","identifier":[{"id":"PMC3722025","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"23866070","type":"pmid"},{"id":"84880183610","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-03f02c9e-215a-4eb5-9ffc-90b0a3a06e01","sdu-32a7d2d6-968f-4287-8791-ad859d1a0570"],"keyword":["Aged","Arterial stiffness","Biomarkers/blood","Calcium-Binding Proteins/blood","Carotid Arteries/physiopathology","Case-Control Studies","Cross-Sectional Studies","Diabetes Mellitus, Type 2/blood","Diabetic Angiopathies/blood","Femoral Artery/physiopathology","Fibulin-1","Humans","Immunoassay","Male","Middle Aged","Multivariate Analysis","Predictive Value of Tests","Pulse Wave Analysis","Pulse wave velocity","Risk Factors","Type 2 diabetes mellitus","Vascular Stiffness"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-77EE02B174639A7E7A3510B63539BCF9"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1186/1475-2840-12-107","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2013","yearSub":"2013"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine - Department of Endocrinology and Internal Medicine"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"central denmark region","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CDR","l3nl":"Central Denmark Region","l3nn":"Central Denmark Region","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Central Denmark Region","namevar":["Aarhus University Hospital"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CDR","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"us","key":"medical university of south carolina","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"Medical University of South Carolina","used":1},{"affno":"4","key":"sdu univ