{"abstract":"Legionella bozemanae is a rare isolate in clinical specimens. We describe a case of joint infection due to L. bozemanae in an immunocompromised patient with dermatomyositis. Without the use of PCR screening or culture on specialized medium, the organism would not have been detected.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Just, Søren Andreas","Bonde Knudsen, John","Uldum, Søren Anker","Holt, Hanne Marie"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-595757"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"detection of legionella bozemanae a new cause of septic arthritis by pcr followed by specific culture","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1128/JCM.01899-12","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-595757","identifier":[{"id":"84869234536","type":"scopus"},{"id":"23052316","type":"pmid"},{"id":"PMC3503013","type":"pmcid"}],"ids":["sdu-4eadade6-9dea-4693-870b-0eb6d1f3d1dc"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-44F511A73715D22992216010F3F02E0C"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1128/JCM.01899-12","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Clinical Research, KI, OUH, Research unit of Rheumatology (Odense)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren Andreas","key":"justpau","last":"Just","locid":"94aaa5ff-430a-4bdf-8d84-3248f247a78f","name":"Just, Søren Andreas","orcid":"0000-0002-3946-5919","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"John Bonde","key":"knudsenpau","last":"Knudsen","locid":"6f433995-900f-4178-897d-417c671ef417","name":"Bonde Knudsen, John","name_org":"Knudsen, John Bonde","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren Anker","key":"uldumpau","last":"Uldum","name":"Uldum, Søren Anker","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Hanne Marie","key":"holtpau","last":"Holt","locid":"925af8c8-e298-4621-bd0c-8fa295b55539","name":"Holt, Hanne Marie","orcid":"0000-0003-2456-6108","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["23052316"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1128/jcm.01899-12","issn":["00951137","1070633X"],"issn_org":["00951137"],"issue":"12","journal":"Journal of Clinical Microbiology","pages":"4180-2","publisher":"American Society for Microbiology","status":"p","title":"Journal of Clinical Microbiology","volume":"50"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84869234536"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["sdu-4eadade6-9dea-4693-870b-0eb6d1f3d1dc"],"src":["SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Detection of Legionella bozemanae, a New Cause of Septic Arthritis, by PCR Followed by Specific Culture","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-595757","year":"2012","yearsub":"2012"}
{"abstract":"Phthalates are industrial chemicals used in many cosmetics. We evaluated an in vitro model for eye irritancy testing using the human corneal endothelial cell line B4G12. Cell proliferation and toxicity were assessed after exposing to di-n-butyl phthalate (DBP), benzyl butyl phthalate (BBP), di-2-ethylhexyl phthalate (DEHP), diisodecyl phthalate (DIDP), di-n-octyl phthalate (DnOP), and di-isononyl phthalate (DINP). Gene expression and secretion of inflammatory cytokines were evaluated after exposure to DBP. Decreased cell proliferation was observed for the phthalates DBP, BBP, and DEHP, and cell toxicity was observed for DBP and BBP. Upon DBP exposure at nontoxic concentrations, a significant increased gene expression and cytokine cell secretion were observed for interleukin-1ß (IL-1ß) and IL-8, and also an increased IL-6 secretion was observed. In conclusion, the human corneal endothelial cell line B4G12 may be a potential model for inflammatory eye irritancy testing of phthalates.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Krüger, Tanja","Cao, Yi","Kjærgaard, Søren K.","Knudsen, Lisbeth E.","Bonefeld-Jørgensen, Eva Cecilie"],"cuid":["S02-100.00-023251"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Institut for Folkesundhed - Center for Arktisk Sundhed"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"effects of phthalates on the human corneal endothelial cell line b000000000004g000000000012","src":["au","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1177/1091581812449660","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-100.00-023251","identifier":[{"id":"84865030082","type":"scopus"},{"id":"22723514","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["au-90fb29aa-edd7-4a50-96b6-03e2670b5a32","ku-9aa6eec2-2908-4cda-aeea-1033178677a4"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-11DF7878B7DC02DE7B2E07FD16EA4026"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1177/1091581812449660","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Public Health, Department of Public Health - Institute of Environmental and Occupational Medicine"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Public Health","Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Public Health, Section of Environmental Health"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"dk","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Institut for Folkesundhed - Center for Arktisk Sundhed"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Tanja","key":"krügerpau","last":"Krüger","locid":"5a86183a-f117-4dc8-99a6-b5e7aef1c249","name":"Krüger, Tanja","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Yi","key":"caopau","last":"Cao","locid":"12a58790-dc5b-46fb-b955-bdfbc432ffe8","name":"Cao, Yi","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Søren K.","key":"kjærgaardpau","last":"Kjærgaard","locid":"02d84113-18df-40f9-875a-834d37c53387","name":"Kjærgaard, Søren K.","orcid":"0000-0002-5700-9263","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"first":"Lisbeth E.","key":"knudsenpau","last":"Knudsen","name":"Knudsen, Lisbeth E.","orcid":"0000-0002-9576-1202","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 3","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Eva Cecilie","key":"bonefeldjørgensenpau","last":"Bonefeld-Jørgensen","locid":"2e9445d9-efa7-4668-b6cd-41982d42e0b0","name":"Bonefeld-Jørgensen, Eva Cecilie","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["22723514"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1177/1091581812449660","issn":["10915818","1092874X"],"issn_org":["10915818"],"issue":"4","journal":"International Journal of Toxicology","pages":"364-71","publisher":"SAGE Publications Inc.","status":"p","title":"International Journal of Toxicology","volume":"31"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84865030082"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Miscellaneous","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Miscellaneous","Other Research","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-90fb29aa-edd7-4a50-96b6-03e2670b5a32","ku-9aa6eec2-2908-4cda-aeea-1033178677a4"],"src":["AU Aarhus University","KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Effects of Phthalates on the Human Corneal Endothelial Cell Line B4G12","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-100.00-023251","year":"2012","yearsub":"2012"}
{"abstract":"This paper presents a spatially resolved transient fuel cell model applied to the simulation of high temperature PEM fuel cell impedance spectra. The model is developed using a 2D finite volume method approach. The model is resolved along the channel and across the membrane. The model considers diffusion of cathode gas species in gas diffusion layers and catalyst layer, transport of protons in the membrane and the catalyst layers, and double layer capacitive effects in the catalyst layers. The model has been fitted simultaneously to a polarization curve and to an impedance spectrum recorded in the laboratory. A simultaneous fit to both curves is not achieved. In order to investigate the effects of the fitting parameters on the simulation results, a parameter variation study is carried out. It is concluded that some of the fitting parameters assume values which are not realistic. In order to remedy this, phenomena neglected in this version of the model must be incorporated in future versions.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Vang, Jakob Rabjerg","Andreasen, Søren Juhl","Kær, Søren Knudsen"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-053672"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["EIS","HTPEM","HTPEMFC","High temperature PEM","Impedance spectroscopy","Modelling"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"a transient model to simulate htpem fuel cell impedance spectra","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1115/1.4005609","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-053672","identifier":[{"id":"000302597100005","type":"wos"},{"id":"84859073479","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-0c677cc5-d8b2-439f-a685-e07eb4fcfdda"],"keyword":["EIS","HTPEM","HTPEMFC","High temperature PEM","Impedance spectroscopy","Modelling"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-408A997C4AAC9A8F68DDD9644013ADD8"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1115/1.4005609","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (ENG)","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy, Fluid Mechanics and Combustion"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jakob Rabjerg","key":"vangpau","last":"Vang","locid":"863c6a36-4e04-431b-a5b0-9e141fd73553","name":"Vang, Jakob Rabjerg","orcid":"0000-0002-4497-3205","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren Juhl","key":"andreasenpau","last":"Andreasen","locid":"02115d16-a485-4ac6-b914-7460ef6c4e83","name":"Andreasen, Søren Juhl","orcid":"0000-0002-0767-5874","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren Knudsen","key":"kærpau","last":"Kær","locid":"898d6584-ec2e-430a-b78d-e3e0d670dcdd","name":"Kær, Søren Knudsen","orcid":"0000-0003-2151-8055","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1115/1.4005609","issn":["1550624X","15516989"],"issn_org":["1550624X"],"issue":"2","journal":"Journal of Fuel Cell Science and Technology","publisher":"The American Society of Mechanical Engineers (ASME)","status":"p","title":"Journal of Fuel Cell Science and Technology","volume":"9"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84859073479"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-0c677cc5-d8b2-439f-a685-e07eb4fcfdda"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"A transient model to simulate HTPEM fuel cell impedance spectra","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-053672","year":"2012","yearsub":"2012"}
{"abstract":"The Fickian diffusivity of water in Nafion has been shown to exhibit a local maximum. In the present research effort it is shown that this spike vanishes if the equilibrium water content and chemical diffusivity are modeled carefully. Further, it is shown that permeation experiments falsely can generate a local maximum, if a wrong equilibrium water content relation is used. Finally, in order to study the obtained diffusivity model a parameter variation is carried out using a one-dimensional steady-state model. The effect of diffusivity model, surface roughness and water content driving force is studied.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Olesen, Anders Christian","Berning, Torsten","Kær, Søren Knudsen"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-065015"],"event":{"end":"2012-10-12","start":"2012-10-07","title":"The 222nd Electrochemical Society Meeting","year":"2012"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"on the diffusion coefficient of water in polymer electrolyte membranes","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1149/05002.0979ecst","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-065015","identifier":[{"id":"84885734418","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-339be30c-71b7-46f5-a907-3507a01d9a44"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-82D80BAF0CA9455BD9E74CE055DD3907"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://ma.ecsdl.org/content/MA2012-02/13/1556.abstract","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1149/05002.0979ecst","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (ENG)","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy, Fluid Mechanics and Combustion"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Anders Christian","key":"olesenpau","last":"Olesen","locid":"a6c83a7f-2f25-4b66-b42d-9ef435ffeecf","name":"Olesen, Anders Christian","orcid":"0000-0002-8344-914X","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Torsten","key":"berningpau","last":"Berning","locid":"eecf017d-14b4-4110-9df5-a10a6c7e9bd9","name":"Berning, Torsten","orcid":"0000-0003-3324-0927","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren Knudsen","key":"kærpau","last":"Kær","locid":"898d6584-ec2e-430a-b78d-e3e0d670dcdd","name":"Kær, Søren Knudsen","orcid":"0000-0003-2151-8055","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1149/05002.0979ecst","issn":["19385862"],"issn_org":["19386737"],"issue":"2","journal":"ECS Transactions","pages":"979-991","publisher":"Institute of Physics","status":"p","title":"ECS Transactions","volume":"50"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84885734418"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-339be30c-71b7-46f5-a907-3507a01d9a44"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"On the Diffusion Coefficient of Water in Polymer Electrolyte Membranes","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-065015","year":"2012","yearsub":"2012"}
{"abstract":"This paper investigates the effects of methanol and water vapor on the performance of a high temperature proton exchange membrane fuel cell (HT-PEMFC). A H3PO4-doped polybenzimidazole (PBI) membrane electrode assembly (MEA), Celtec P2100 of 45 cm2 of active surface area from BASF was employed. A long-term durability test of around 1250 h was performed, in which the concentrations of methanol-water vapor mixture in the anode feed gas were varied. The fuel cell showed a continuous performance decay in the presence of vapor mixtures of methanol and water of 5% and 8% by volume in anode feed. Impedance measurements followed by equivalent circuit fitting revealed that the effects were most significant for intermediate-high frequency resistances, implying that charge transfer losses were the most significant losses. Vapor mixture of 3% in feed, however, when introduced after operation at 8%, showed positive or no effect on the cell's performance in these tests.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Araya, Samuel Simon","Andreasen, Søren Juhl","Nielsen, Heidi Venstrup","Kær, Søren Knudsen"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-092021"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Fuel cell","High temperature PEM","Impedance spectroscopy","Methanol"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"investigating the effects of methanol water vapor mixture on a pbi based high temperature pem fuel cell","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijhydene.2012.09.009","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-092021","identifier":[{"id":"WOS:000311865700060","type":"wos"},{"id":"84868204021","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-907418a1-ca50-4109-8754-5dbd0219dabd"],"keyword":["Fuel cell","High temperature PEM","Impedance spectroscopy","Methanol"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-14DE92B8E543193FEED79F932687B692"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijhydene.2012.09.009","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0360319912020125","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (ENG)","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy, Hydrogen and Electro-fuels"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Samuel Simon","key":"arayapau","last":"Araya","locid":"31cc4ce7-c9ae-4406-95d1-b95d4269205f","name":"Araya, Samuel Simon","orcid":"0000-0001-9294-0793","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren Juhl","key":"andreasenpau","last":"Andreasen","locid":"02115d16-a485-4ac6-b914-7460ef6c4e83","name":"Andreasen, Søren Juhl","orcid":"0000-0002-0767-5874","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Heidi Venstrup","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"21f8c170-6623-4b0b-9c5f-8be0e0eb5fbc","name":"Nielsen, Heidi Venstrup","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren Knudsen","key":"kærpau","last":"Kær","locid":"898d6584-ec2e-430a-b78d-e3e0d670dcdd","name":"Kær, Søren Knudsen","orcid":"0000-0003-2151-8055","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.ijhydene.2012.09.009","issn":["03603199","18793487"],"issn_org":["03603199"],"issue":"23","journal":"International Journal of Hydrogen Energy","pages":"18231-18242","publisher":"Elsevier","status":"p","title":"International Journal of Hydrogen Energy","volume":"37"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84868204021"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-907418a1-ca50-4109-8754-5dbd0219dabd"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Investigating the effects of methanol-water vapor mixture on a PBI-based high temperature PEM fuel cell","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-092021","year":"2012","yearsub":"2012"}
