{"abstract":"This is the first report ever to demonstrate that L. Bozemanae can colonize synovial joints leading to infectious arthritis. L. Bozemanae is a rare Legionella species, earlier described as a cause of cavitating lung infections with up to 40% mortality (2). L. Bozemanae is missed by standard cultures, however, the case was diagnosed by combining 16S PCR and sequencing followed by culture under specific conditions, a method which may help in the diagnosis of septic arthritis caused by unusual pathogens not detected by standard culture.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Just, Søren Andreas","Bonde Knudsen, John","Skov, Marianne Nielsine","Holt, Hanne Marie"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-627747"],"event":{"end":"2008-02-03","place":"Levi, fi","start":"2008-01-30","title":"Scandinavian Congress of Rheumatology","year":"2008"},"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Legionella"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"legionella bozemanae a new cause of septic arthritis diagnosed by 000000000016s pcr followed by specific culture","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dco","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-627747","ids":["sdu-be390632-c069-4279-8c0c-ad9591c0c16f"],"keyword":["Legionella","Septisk Atrit"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-4C7E630A051D4FF4F792F530E6CBDE0D"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Clinical Research, KI, OUH, Research unit of Rheumatology (Odense)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren Andreas","key":"justpau","last":"Just","locid":"94aaa5ff-430a-4bdf-8d84-3248f247a78f","name":"Just, Søren Andreas","orcid":"0000-0002-3946-5919","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"John","key":"bondeknudsenpau","last":"Bonde Knudsen","locid":"6f433995-900f-4178-897d-417c671ef417","name":"Bonde Knudsen, John","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Marianne Nielsine","key":"skovpau","last":"Skov","locid":"5b2553ab-dfde-4995-8c58-7840a16be668","name":"Skov, Marianne Nielsine","orcid":"0000-0002-2619-0864","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Hanne Marie","key":"holtpau","last":"Holt","locid":"925af8c8-e298-4621-bd0c-8fa295b55539","name":"Holt, Hanne Marie","orcid":"0000-0003-2456-6108","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["sdu-be390632-c069-4279-8c0c-ad9591c0c16f"],"src":["SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Legionella Bozemanae, a New Cause of Septic Arthritis diagnosed by 16S PCR followed by specific culture","type":"Conference Poster","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-627747","year":"2012","yearsub":"2012"}
{"abstract":"Antimicrobial peptides are a new class of antibiotics that are promising for pharmaceutical applications because they have retained efficacy throughout evolution. One class of antimicrobial peptides are the defensins, which have been found in different species. Here we describe a new fungal defensin, eurocin. Eurocin acts against a range of Gram-positive human pathogens but not against Gram-negative bacteria. Eurocin consists of 42 amino acids, forming a cysteine-stabilized α/β-fold. The thermal denaturation data point shows the disulfide bridges being responsible for the stability of the fold. Eurocin does not form pores in cell membranes at physiologically relevant concentrations; it does, however, lead to limited leakage of a fluorophore from small unilamellar vesicles. Eurocin interacts with detergent micelles, and it inhibits the synthesis of cell walls by binding equimolarly to the cell wall precursor lipid II.","author_count":14,"contributors":["Øemig, Jesper Skøttegaard","Lynggaard, Carina","Knudsen, Daniel Højberg","Hansen, Frederik Teilfeldt","Nørgaard, Kent Dahm","Schneider, Tanja","Vad, Brian Stougaard","Sandvang, Dorthe","Nielsen, Line A.","Neve, Søren","Kristensen, Hans-Henrik","Sahl, Hans-Georg","Otzen, Daniel","Wimmer, Reinhard"],"cuid":["S02-097.10-008093"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Germany"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","University of Bonn"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-NOSI"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-PR-NOSI","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"eurocin a new fungal defensin structure lipid binding and its mode of action","src":["aau","au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY 4.0","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1074/jbc.M112.382028","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-097.10-008093","identifier":[{"id":"PMC3516779","type":"pmid"},{"id":"84871338911","type":"scopus"},{"id":"23093408","type":"pmid"},{"id":"WOS:000312103000071","type":"wos"},{"id":"PMC3516779","type":"pmcid"}],"ids":["aau-a74a97ca-fbd8-4392-87a7-a6f77d66d463","au-da7844f6-523d-4a53-9402-505cd66c521a"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-D691F4E6F28742972A1C1B9150D0692B"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1074/jbc.M112.382028","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (ENG)","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Chemistry and Bioscience","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Chemistry and Bioscience, Section of Biotechnology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Natural Sciences, Department of Molecular Biology and Genetics"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"de","key":"university of bonn","loc":["Germany","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Bonn","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"dk","key":"novonesis","l2":"DI-PR","l2n":"Private Research","l3":"DI-PR-NOSI","l3nn":"Novonesis","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Novonesis","namevar":["Novozymes A/S"],"nora_code":"DI-PR-NOSI","use