{"abstract":"This paper presents a numerical model of an exhaust heat recovery system for a high temperature polymer electrolyte membrane fuel cell (HTPEMFC) stack. The system is designed as thermoelectric generators (TEGs) sandwiched in the walls of a compact plate-fin heat exchanger. Its model is based on a finite-element approach. On each discretized segment, fluid properties, heat transfer process and TEG performance are locally calculated for higher model precision. To benefit both the system design and fabrication, the way to model TEG modules is herein reconsidered; a database of commercialized compact plate-fin heat exchangers is adopted. Then the model is validated against experimental data and the main variables are identified by means of a sensitivity analysis. Finally, the system configuration is optimized for recovering heat from the exhaust gas. The results exhibit the crucial importance of the model accuracy and the optimization on system configuration. Future studies will concentrate on heat exchanger structures.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Gao, Xin","Andreasen, Søren Juhl","Chen, Min","Kær, Søren Knudsen"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-055623"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Fuel cell","Heat recovery","Thermoelectric generator"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"numerical model of a thermoelectric generator with compact plate fin heat exchanger for high temperature pem fuel cell exhaust heat recovery","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijhydene.2012.03.009","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-055623","identifier":[{"id":"84860380495","type":"scopus"},{"id":"000305040400042","type":"wos"}],"ids":["aau-1328dc85-8bab-4971-a778-f14c9cd8445c"],"keyword":["Discretized model","Fuel cell","Heat exchanger database","Heat recovery","Thermoelectric generator"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-456C25723CDEBCD9AF1D686618DE24B7"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijhydene.2012.03.009","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (ENG)","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy, Fluid Mechanics and Combustion"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Gao","key":"xinpau","last":"Xin","locid":"0c7cc98f-3f75-4d7a-baac-8833cfc63ab5","name":"Gao, Xin","name_org":"Xin, Gao","orcid":"0000-0001-6011-0859","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren Juhl","key":"andreasenpau","last":"Andreasen","locid":"02115d16-a485-4ac6-b914-7460ef6c4e83","name":"Andreasen, Søren Juhl","orcid":"0000-0002-0767-5874","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Min","key":"chenpau","last":"Chen","locid":"9efe2461-3f4a-46b4-82d6-8e5fb687cc3b","name":"Chen, Min","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren Knudsen","key":"kærpau","last":"Kær","locid":"898d6584-ec2e-430a-b78d-e3e0d670dcdd","name":"Kær, Søren Knudsen","orcid":"0000-0003-2151-8055","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.ijhydene.2012.03.009","issn":["03603199","18793487"],"issn_org":["03603199"],"issue":"10","journal":"International Journal of Hydrogen Energy","pages":"8490-8498","publisher":"Elsevier","status":"p","title":"International Journal of Hydrogen Energy","volume":"37"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84860380495"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-1328dc85-8bab-4971-a778-f14c9cd8445c"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Numerical model of a thermoelectric generator with compact plate-fin heat exchanger for high temperature PEM fuel cell exhaust heat recovery","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-055623","year":"2012","yearsub":"2012"}
{"abstract":"A three-dimensional, multicomponent, two-fluid model developed in the commercial CFD package CFX 13 (ANSYS Inc.) is used to investigate the effect of porous media compression on water transport in a proton exchange membrane fuel cell (PEMFC). The PEMFC model only consist of the cathode channel, gas diffusion layer, microporous layer, and catalyst layer, excluding the membrane and anode. In the porous media liquid water transport is described by the capillary pressure gradient, momentum loss via the Darcy-Forchheimer equation, and mass transfer between phases by a nonequilibrium phase change model. Furthermore, the presence of irreducible liquid water is taken into account. In order to account for compression, porous media morphology variations are specified based on the gas diffusion layer (GDL) through-plane strain and intrusion which are stated as a function of compression. These morphology variations affect gas and liquid water transport, and hence liquid water distribution and the risk of blocking active sites. Hence, water transport is studied under GDL compression in order to investigate the qualitative effects. Two simulation cases are compared; one with and one without compression.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Olesen, Anders Christian","Berning, Torsten","Kær, Søren Knudsen"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-104740"],"event":{"end":"2011-08-10","place":"Washington, DC, us","start":"2011-08-07","title":"ASME 2011 9th Fuel Cell Science, Engineering and Technology Conference","year":"2011"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"the effect of inhomogeneous compression on water transport in the cathode of a proton exchange membrane fuel cell","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1115/1.4006475","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-104740","identifier":[{"id":"84860487733","type":"scopus"},{"id":"WOS:000304819200010","type":"wos"}],"ids":["aau-bca7f4e8-c63a-4227-9587-d593efb4a51f"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-EF05633770CC26518FD8AF06B6C186BC"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1115/1.4006475","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (ENG)","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy, Fluid Mechanics and Combustion"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Anders Christian","key":"olesenpau","last":"Olesen","locid":"a6c83a7f-2f25-4b66-b42d-9ef435ffeecf","name":"Olesen, Anders Christian","orcid":"0000-0002-8344-914X","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Torsten","key":"berningpau","last":"Berning","locid":"eecf017d-14b4-4110-9df5-a10a6c7e9bd9","name":"Berning, Torsten","orcid":"0000-0003-3324-0927","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren Knudsen","key":"kærpau","last":"Kær","locid":"898d6584-ec2e-430a-b78d-e3e0d670dcdd","name":"Kær, Søren Knudsen","orcid":"0000-0003-2151-8055","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1115/1.4006475","issn":["1550624X","15516989"],"issn_org":["1550624X"],"issue":"3","journal":"Journal of Fuel Cell Science and Technology","publisher":"The American Society of Mechanical Engineers (ASME)","status":"p","title":"Journal of Fuel Cell Science and Technology","volume":"9"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84860487733"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-bca7f4e8-c63a-4227-9587-d593efb4a51f"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"The Effect of Inhomogeneous Compression on Water Transport in the Cathode of a Proton Exchange Membrane Fuel Cell","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-104740","year":"2012","yearsub":"2012"}
{"abstract":"Formålet med Task Forcen er at indsamle og præsentere eksisterende kerneviden om energirenovering af eksisterende bygninger. Eksisterende bygninger omfatter alle slags bygninger inkl. sommerhuse. Hovedområderne er: A.Besparelsespotentialer i bygningsmassen B.Energirenoveringseksempler - erfaring og evaluering C.Nye bygnings- og installationsteknologier D.Energiforsyning - på selve bygningen og fra net E.Barrierer, virkemidler og incitamenter. A. Besparelsespotentialer i bygningsmassen Her er indsamlet eksisterende danske analyser om potentialet for energibesparelser. Skal også fungere som forarbejde til analyseprojektet om: Energibesparelsespotentialer i bygningsmassen. B. Energirenoveringseksempler Her er opsamlet viden om evaluerede renoveringsprojekter. Skal også fungere som forarbejde til analyseprojektet om: Energibesparel-sespotentialer i bygningsmassen. Kan bl.a. bruges til at kalibrere forventningerne til besparelserne ved forskellige bygningstyper og ejerformer. Der indsamles både nationale og udenlandske erfaringer. C. Nye bygnings- og installationsteknologier Her er identificeret løsninger, som kan drive energibesparelserne i eksisterende bygninger længere end det er muligt med dagens teknologi. Skal også fungere som forarbejde til analyseprojektet om: Nye bygnings- og installationsteknologier. D. Energiforsyning Skal kunne bruges til at perspektivere mulighederne og betingelserne ved de fremtidige energiforsynings muligheder på bygningen og fra nettet i forhold til besparelsestiltagene i bygningerne. Skal også fokusere på samspillet mellem bygninger og energinettet, herunder muligheder og forudsætninger ved \"smart grid\". E. Barrierer, virkemidler og incitamenter I dette afsnit gives et brutto billede af mulige barrierer, virkemidler og incita-menter samt en beskrivelse af erfaringen med dem under forskellige omstændigheder fx lande, bygningstyper og ejerformer. Skal også fungere som forarbejde til analyseprojektet om: Barrierer, incitamenter og virkemidler. Rapporten er målrettet deltagerne i netværket om udarbejdelse af renoveringsstrategien især byggebranchen og styrelserne samt de politiske beslutningstagere.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Thomsen, Kirsten Engelund","Knudsen, Henrik Nellemose","Mortensen, Lone Hedegaard","Aggerholm, Søren","Jensen, Ole Michael","Wittchen, Kim Bjarne"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-123852"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"task force netværk for energirenovering indsamling og præsentation af eksisterende kerneviden om energirenovering af eksisterende bygninger","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/681517379/task-force.-netvaerk-for-energirenovering-1.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-123852","ids":["aau-fe3a5b4b-549d-4671-9187-3ca861ddd631"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-06AB4760458EF38C69DC713FBA831AC3"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/681517379/task-force.-netvaerk-for-energirenovering-1.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.ens.dk/da-DK/byggeri/renoveringsstrategi/analyser/Documents/SBI%202012-09.pdf","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (ENG)","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Danish Building Re