{"abstract":"Offshore wind energy capitalizes on the higher and less turbulent wind speeds at sea. The use of floating structures for deeper waters is being explored. The control objective is a tradeoff between power capture and fatigue, especially that produced by the oscillations caused by the reduced structural stiffness of a floating installation in combination with a coupling between the fore–aft motion of the tower and the blade pitch. To address this problem, the present paper models a ballast-stabilized floating wind turbine, and suggests a linear quadratic regulator (LQR) in combination with a wind estimator and a state observer. The results are simulated using aero elastic code and analysed in terms of damage equivalent loads. When compared to a baseline controller, this controller clearly demonstrates better generator speed and power tracking while reducing fatigue loads.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Christiansen, Søren","Knudsen, Torben","Bak, Thomas"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-057925"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"optimal control of a ballast stabilized floating wind turbine","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1109/CACSD.2011.6044574","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-057925","identifier":[{"id":"80755169875","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-1aea6159-72b3-4c4f-8dec-631aedff29e7"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-C9D771D6003A1ECEB3AC40055FD7FFC3"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1109/CACSD.2011.6044574","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://ieeexplore.ieee.org/xpl/articleDetails.jsp?arnumber=6044574","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (TECH)","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Electronic Systems, Automation & Control"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Søren","key":"christiansenpau","last":"Christiansen","locid":"31e1968a-95d9-469a-bc94-0ce41a58b13b","name":"Christiansen, Søren","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Torben","key":"knudsenpau","last":"Knudsen","locid":"2320ea13-8eb2-4116-9386-b562514277b8","name":"Knudsen, Torben","orcid":"0000-0002-5478-8513","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Thomas","key":"bakpau","last":"Bak","locid":"474a52b5-2182-461f-8b5c-4ef451576fe4","name":"Bak, Thomas","orcid":"0000-0002-8282-5932","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1109/cacsd.2011.6044574","issn":["42442221"],"journal":"IEEE Conference on Computer-Aided Control Systems Design","status":"p","title":"IEEE Conference on Computer-Aided Control Systems Design"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-80755169875"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-1aea6159-72b3-4c4f-8dec-631aedff29e7"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Optimal Control of a Ballast-Stabilized Floating Wind Turbine","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-057925","year":"2011","yearsub":"2011"}
{"abstract":"High temperature polymer electrolyte membrane(HTPEM) fuel cells offer many advantages due to their increased operating tempera-tures compared to similar Nafion-based membrane tech-nologies, that rely on the conductive abilities of liquid water. The polybenzimidazole (PBI) membranes are especially suited for reformer systems, where high CO tolerance is required. This enables the use fuels based on e.g. liquid alcohols. This work presents the control strategies of a methanol refoermer for a 350W HTPEM FC system. The system examined is the Serenergy H3-350 Mobile Battery Charger, an integrated system.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Andreasen, Søren Juhl","Kær, Søren Knudsen","Jensen, Hans-Christian Becker","Sahlin, Simon Lennart"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-122735"],"event":{"end":"2011-12-05","place":"Xcaret, mx","start":"2011-12-01","title":"Hydrogen and Fuel Cells Conference 2011","year":"2011"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Control strategies","Methanol reforming"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"control and experimental characterization of a methanol reformer for a 000000000350w high temperature polymer electrolyte membrane fuel cell system","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dco","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/58818269/sja_Zing2011_poster_EPSpics_A0.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-122735","ids":["aau-fa3df794-d7dc-4f4a-a211-f10bb14d9045"],"keyword":["Control Strategies","Fuel Cell Systems","methanol reforming"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-F7CBB60C3C5AE6525ACDD3C7404C0420"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/58818269/sja_Zing2011_poster_EPSpics_A0.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (ENG)","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy, Thermal Energy Systems"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren Juhl","key":"andreasenpau","last":"Andreasen","locid":"02115d16-a485-4ac6-b914-7460ef6c4e83","name":"Andreasen, Søren Juhl","orcid":"0000-0002-0767-5874","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren Knudsen","key":"kærpau","last":"Kær","locid":"898d6584-ec2e-430a-b78d-e3e0d670dcdd","name":"Kær, Søren Knudsen","orcid":"0000-0003-2151-8055","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Hans-Christian Becker","key":"jensenpau","last":"Jensen","locid":"372be06d-7f4f-4025-86a1-75eb41ce5af8","name":"Jensen, Hans-Christian Becker","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Simon Lennart","key":"sahlinpau","last":"Sahlin","locid":"10be1b68-a59d-4397-ae45-e356bf4c5844","name":"Sahlin, Simon Lennart","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-fa3df794-d7dc-4f4a-a211-f10bb14d9045"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Control and experimental characterization of a methanol reformer for a 350W high temperature polymer electrolyte membrane fuel cell system","type":"Conference Poster","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-122735","year":"2011","yearsub":"2011"}
{"abstract":"We present a case of neurocysticercosis in a 12-year old refugee from Zambia. Magnetic resonance imaging demonstrated a solitary, ring enhancing cystic lesion located subcortically in the left parietal lobe. Despite extensive diagnostic workup it was not possible to rule out alternative differential diagnoses. Serological tests for neurocysticercosis came out negative. The lesion was removed en bloc using microsurgical technique. Subsequent histological examination revealed a thick-walled cyst containing a cysticercus identifiable as a Taenia solium.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Cortnum, Søren Ole Stigaard","Knudsen, Kristine Bach","Sørensen, Preben"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-133524"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"kirurgisk behandling af neurocysticerkose hos et 000000000012 årigt barn","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/80155133693","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-133524","identifier":[{"id":"80155133693","type":"scopus"},{"id":"21893007","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["au-07618c15-5bfa-4c63-94b7-166d7cc7cd85"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-A8953EFFFD30777C386ECEA93C498D7B"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine - Børneafdelingen, Aalborg Sygehus"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"a