{"abstract":"Summary Invasive aspergillosis (IA) is a major cause of death among patients with chronic granulomatous disease (CGD). Few cases of cardiac aspergillosis have been published on CGD patients. Diagnosis of IA in CGD patients can be hampered by lack of characteristic symptoms and clinical signs and the serum galactomannan assay is often negative. We report the first CGD patient with IA presenting as pericarditis where combined antifungal therapy resulted in a successful outcome.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Mortensen, Klaus L","Knudsen, Jane Byriel","Jensen-Fangel, Søren","Stausbøl-Grøn, Brian","Arendrup, Maiken C","Petersen, Eskild"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-206027"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"successful management of invasive aspergillosis presenting as pericarditis in an adult patient with chronic granulomatous disease","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1439-0507.2009.01835.x","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-206027","identifier":[{"id":"20041995","type":"pmid"},{"id":"79959255860","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-865d20f0-faad-11de-9c17-000ea68e967b"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-2-9D5EBABC5477F0405A1A4364C55E0643"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1439-0507.2009.01835.x","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine - Røntgen og Skanning, SKS"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Klaus L","key":"mortensenpau","last":"Mortensen","name":"Mortensen, Klaus L","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Jane B","key":"knudsenpau","last":"Knudsen","locid":"ca79612c-740a-4dbf-82ef-ce8764f246d6","name":"Knudsen, Jane Byriel","name_org":"Knudsen, Jane B","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren","key":"jensenfangelpau","last":"Jensen-Fangel","locid":"9822ac67-91e2-4c70-be62-1d560c6e4ba6","name":"Jensen-Fangel, Søren","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Brian","key":"stausbølgrønpau","last":"Stausbøl-Grøn","locid":"cdff3a14-083d-4bfa-a9bf-a96f11fc29c0","name":"Stausbøl-Grøn, Brian","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Maiken C","key":"arendruppau","last":"Arendrup","name":"Arendrup, Maiken C","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Eskild","key":"petersenpau","last":"Petersen","locid":"91c7ce03-d7e1-4557-91ca-bbd19ac0b7fe","name":"Petersen, Eskild","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["20041995"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1111/j.1439-0507.2009.01835.x","issn":["09337407","09437312"],"issn_org":["09337407"],"journal":"Mycoses","publisher":"Wiley-Blackwell Publishing Ltd","status":"p","title":"Mycoses"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-79959255860"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-865d20f0-faad-11de-9c17-000ea68e967b"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Successful management of invasive aspergillosis presenting as pericarditis in an adult patient with chronic granulomatous disease","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-206027","year":"2011","yearsub":"2011"}
{"abstract":"Advances at SR sources in the generation of nanofocused beams with a high degree of transverse coherence call for effective techniques to simulate the propagation of partially coherent X-ray beams through complex optical systems in order to characterize how coherence properties such as the mutual coherence function (MCF) are propagated to the exit plane. Here we present an approach based on Monte Carlo sampling of the Green function. A Gauss-Shell Stochastic Source with arbitrary spatial coherence is synthesized by means of the Gaussian copula statistical tool. The Green function is obtained by sampling Huygens-Fresnel waves with Monte Carlo methods and is used to propagate each source realization to the detector plane. The sampling is implemented with a modified Monte Carlo ray tracing scheme where the optical path of each generated ray is stored. Such information is then used in the summation of the generated rays at the observation plane to account for coherence properties. This approach is used to simulate simple models of propagation in free space and with reflective and refractive optics. © 2011 COPYRIGHT Society of Photo-Optical Instrumentation Engineers (SPIE). Downloading of the abstract is permitted for personal use only.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Prodi, A.","Bergbäck Knudsen, Erik","Willendrup, Peter Kjær","Schmidt, Søren","Ferrero, C.","Feidenhans'l, Robert","Lefmann, Kim"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-314137"],"event":{"end":"2011-08-25","place":"San Diego, CA, us","start":"2011-08-21","title":"Advances in Computational Methods for X-Ray Optics II","year":"2011"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["France"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","European Synchrotron Radiation Facility"],"keyword":["Materialekarakterisering og modellering","Materials characterization and modelling"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"a monte carlo approach for simulating the propagation of partially coherent x ray beams","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1117/12.894520","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-314137","identifier":[{"id":"80054088866","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-201c35c5-6dd3-411f-a27b-cea93811b0bb"],"keyword":["Materialekarakterisering og modellering","Materials characterization and modelling"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-3-5-F58FFEA040DBA105B70755A8F2789C55"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1117/12.894520","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["University of Copenhagen"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Risø National Laboratory for Sustainable Energy","Technical University of Denmark, Risø National Laboratory for Sustainable Energy, Materials Research Division","Technical University of Denmark, Risø National Laboratory for Sustainable Energy, Materials Research Division, Nano-Microstructures in Materials"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"fr","key":"european synchrotron radiation facility","loc":["France","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"European Synchrotron Radiation Facility","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"A.","key":"prodipau","last":"Prodi","name":"Prodi, A.","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Erik","key":"bergbäckknudsenpau","last":"Bergbäck Knudsen","locid":"2141b5d7-8d07-45fc-baae-d171c79a039f","name":"Bergbäck Knudsen, Erik","orcid":"0000-0003-1827-9188","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Peter Kjær","key":"willendruppau","last":"Willendrup","locid":"4f1611c7-e63f-430d-8f27-414ff62554eb","name":"Willendrup, Peter Kjær","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren","key":"schmidtpau","last":"Schmidt","locid":"a18f4d8f-3013-4c86-b79b-7141a752c70d","name":"Schmidt, Søren","orcid":"0000-0002-8694-2044","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"C.","key":"ferreropau","last":"Ferrero","name":"Ferrero, C.","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Robert","key":"feidenhanslpau","last":"Feidenhans'l","name":"Feidenhans'l, Robert","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Kim","key":"lefmannpau","last":"Lefmann","name":"Lefmann, Kim","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1117/12.894520","issn":["0277786X","1996756X"],"issn_org":["0277786X"],"issue":"1","journal":"Proceedings of SPIE - The International Society for Optical Engineering","pages":"814108","publisher":"SPIE","status":"p","title":"Proceedings of SPIE - The International Society for Optical Engineering","volume":"8141"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-80054088866"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-201c35c5-6dd3-411f-a27b-cea93811b0bb"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"A Monte Carlo approach for simulating the propagation of partially coherent x-ray beams","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-314137","year":"2011","yearsub":"2011"}
{"author_count":5,"contributors":["Andersen, Erling","Kristensen, Lone Søderkvist","Busck, Anne Gravsholt","Knudsen, Marie","Kristensen, Søren Bech Pilgaard"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-419217"],"filters":{"added":"2022-04","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"katalog over incitamenter og værktøjer til naturpleje på vedvarende græsarealer","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"doo","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-419217","ids":["ku-2b3c18e7-d6a7-4a13-9f84-f0ba1d15894e"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-2FFF477FF13B554D25D8CFA2CFE8FEC6"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Science, Department of Geosciences and Natural Resource Management, Landscape Architecture and -Urbanism"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Erling","key":"andersenerlingpau","last":"Andersen","locid":"ee71739a-2c1d-4ebf-93f0-db3419d00da5","name":"Andersen, Erling","orcid":"0000-0002-2178-2772","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Lone Søderkvist","key":"kristensenlonesøderkvistpau","last":"Kristensen","locid":"cfd27be0-bac5-4bee-a66a-c60cf7c662a8","name":"Kristensen, Lone Søderkvist","orcid":"0000-0002-3524-2240","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Anne Gravsholt","key":"busckannegravsholtpau","last":"Busck","locid":"8d98c4be-b3bc-40f1-bff5-df78cb7a9a90","name":"Busck, Anne Gravsholt","orcid":"0000-0002-7328-795X","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Marie","key":"knudsenmariepau","last":"Knudsen","name":"Knudsen, Marie","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Søren Bech Pilgaard","key":"kristensensørenbechpilgaardpau","last":"Kristensen","locid":"ebd2560d-8822-4a8a-aec4-db7b2938d542","name":"Kristensen, Søren Bech Pilgaard","orcid":"0000-0002-4335-7662","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-2b3c18e7-d6a7-4a13-9f84-f0ba1d15894e"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Katalog over incitamenter og værktøjer til naturpleje på vedvarende græsarealer","type":"Other-Unknown","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-419217","year":"2011","yearsub":"2011"}
{"abstract":"We previously demonstrated a 20-30% reduction in cortical 5-HT2A receptor binding in patients with mild cognitive impairment (MCI) as compared to healthy subjects. Here we present a two-year follow-up of 14 patients and 12 healthy age-matched subjects. Baseline and follow-up partial volume corrected levels of 5-HT2A in four neocortical lobes and the posterior cingulate gyrus were investigated using [18F]altanserin positron emission tomography with a bolus-infusion approach. In the two-year follow-up period, 8 of 14 patients with MCI had progressed to fulfill diagnostic criteria for probable Alzheimer's disease (AD). In both patients and healthy subjects, no significant change in 5-HT2A receptor binding was found as compared to baseline values. In MCI patients, the average BPP in neocortex ranged from 1.49 to 2.45 at baseline and 1.38 to 2.29 at two-year follow-up; and in healthy subjects BPP ranged from 1.85 to 3.10 at baseline and 1.81 to 2.98 at two-year follow-up. The BPP of the patients that converted to AD during the follow-up period did not differ significantly from the patients that had not (yet) converted, neither at baseline, nor at follow-up. We conclude that the reduced levels of 5-HT2A receptor binding in MCI patients decrease only slowly and non-significantly, even in patients who convert to AD. Our finding suggests that profoundly reduced cortical 5-HT2A receptor binding is an early feature in MCI whereas the clinical progression from MCI to AD is less associated with further decrease in binding.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Marner, Lisbeth","Knudsen, Gitte Moos","Madsen, Karine","Holm, Søren","Baaré, William F C","Hasselbalch, Steen Gregers","Holm, Søren"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-504164"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"the reduction of baseline serotonin 000000000002a receptors in mild cognitive impairment is stable at two year follow up","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3233/JAD-2010-100903","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-504164","identifier":[{"id":"21098981","type":"pmid"},{"id":"79951904150","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-b9852f18-da53-428e-b884-69c449079888"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-23CD197B112C1026A12857AA663E42AA"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3233/JAD-2010-100903","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":1,"key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU"}],"person":[{"affno":"","first":"Lisbeth","key":"marnerlisbethpau","last":"Marner","locid":"bdc32ba4-8b70-4cae-807b-c3c8cfce3258","name":"Marner, Lisbeth","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Gitte M","key":"knudsengittemoospau","last":"Knudsen","locid":"f02aee9e-69cf-491a-9765-ff062f734db8","name":"Knudsen, Gitte Moos","name_org":"Knudsen, Gitte M","orcid":"0000-0003-1508-6866","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Karine","key":"madsenkarinepau","last":"Madsen","locid":"82148399-f4e2-492d-90bb-12aa20b9d639","name":"Madsen, Karine","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Søren","key":"holmsørenpau","last":"Holm","name":"Holm, Søren","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"William","key":"baaréwilliamfcpau","last":"Baaré","locid":"331769b3-4ec0-41ec-81ab-8431